<usx version="3.1">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">--- Open Bislama Bible Revised</book>
  <para style="h">NAMBA
</para>
  <para style="mt1">NAMBA BLONG OL LAEN BLONG ISREL
</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Fas sensas blong kaontem olgeta man long ol laen blong Isrel
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 26.1-51</char></note>Nao long seken yia biaen long taem ya we ol laen* blong Isrel*<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Isrel</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Long ples ya, nem ya i narafala nem blong Jekob ya bifo, we stori blong hem i stap long Jenesis. Yu luk tok ya Isrel long Diksonari.</char></note> oli aot long Ijip, long seken manis, long fas dei blong hem, taem oli stap long draeples ya Sinae, Hae God i toktok long Moses insaed long Haos Tapolen ya we olgeta oli stap kam long hem blong mit wetem hem. Hem i talem se,
<verse eid="NUM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2"/>“Moses. Yu wetem Hae Pris Eron, yutufala i mas mekem sensas blong kaontem yufala evriwan we i laen blong Isrel. Bambae yufala i mas folem ol twelef laen blong ol pikinini blong Isrel we yufala i kamaot biaen long olgeta, mo yufala i mas raetemdaon nem blong olgeta man
<verse eid="NUM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3"/>we yia blong olgeta i kasem twanti i go antap, mo we oli naf blong go long faet.
<verse eid="NUM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4"/>Mo yutufala i mas tekem twelef lida wanwan long ol twelef laen ya blong yufala, blong oli givhan long yutufala.
<verse eid="NUM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5"/>Nem blong ol twelef lida ya i olsem.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Long laen blong Ruben,* lida blong olgeta Elijuru, we papa blong hem Sedeuru.
<verse eid="NUM 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6"/>“Mo long laen blong Simeon,* lida blong olgeta Selumiel, we papa blong hem Jurisadae.
<verse eid="NUM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7"/>“Mo long laen blong Juda,* lida blong olgeta Nason, we papa blong hem Aminadab.
<verse eid="NUM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8"/>“Mo long laen blong Isakara,* lida blong olgeta Netanel, we papa blong hem Juara.
<verse eid="NUM 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9"/>“Mo long laen blong Sebulun,* lida blong olgeta Eliab, we papa blong hem Helon.
<verse eid="NUM 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10"/>“Mo long laen blong Josef i gat tu laen, laen blong Efrem* wetem laen blong Manase.*
</para>
  <para style="p">“Long laen blong Efrem, lida blong olgeta Elisama, we papa blong hem Amihud.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Mo long laen blong Manase, lida blong olgeta Gameliel, we papa blong hem Pedajuru.
<verse eid="NUM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11"/>“Mo long laen blong Benjamin,* lida blong olgeta Abidan, we papa blong hem Gideoni.
<verse eid="NUM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12"/>“Mo long laen blong Dan,* lida blong olgeta Ahiesa, we papa blong hem Amisadae.
<verse eid="NUM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13"/>“Mo long laen blong Asere,* lida blong olgeta Pagiel, we papa blong hem Okran.
<verse eid="NUM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14"/>“Mo long laen blong Gad,* lida blong olgeta Eliasaf, we papa blong hem Dehuel.
<verse eid="NUM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15"/>“Mo long laen blong Naftali,* lida blong olgeta Ahira, we papa blong hem Enan.”
<verse eid="NUM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16"/>Hemia nao ol twelef lida we Hae God i jusumaot olgeta blong mekem wok ya. Olgeta ya oli lida blong ol twelef laen blong Isrel mo oli lida blong ol famle blong olgeta tu.
<verse eid="NUM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="17-46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17-46"/>Nao long seken manis, long fas dei blong hem, tufala i tekem ol lida ya, mo oli singaot olgeta man oli kam wanples, nao olgeta oli raetemdaon nem blong olgeta, folem ol laen mo ol famle blong olgeta. Oli raetemdaon nem blong olgeta man we yia blong olgeta i kasem twanti i go antap, we oli naf blong go long faet, mo oli kaontem olgeta, olsem we Hae God i talem. Moses i mekem sensas ya long taem ya we oli stap long draeples ya Sinae. Oli stat long olgeta we oli laen blong Ruben, we hem i fasbon pikinini blong Isrel, mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i olsem.
</para>
  <para style="p">Olgeta we oli laen blong Ruben, namba blong olgeta i kasem foti sikis taosen, faef handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Simeon, namba blong olgeta i kasem fifti naen taosen, tri handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Gad, namba blong olgeta i kasem foti faef taosen, sikis handred fifti.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Juda, namba blong olgeta i kasem seventi fo taosen, sikis handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Isakara, namba blong olgeta i kasem fifti fo taosen, fo handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Sebulun, namba blong olgeta i kasem fifti seven taosen, fo handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Efrem, namba blong olgeta i kasem foti taosen, faef handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Manase, namba blong olgeta i kasem toti tu taosen, tu handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Benjamin, namba blong olgeta i kasem toti faef taosen, fo handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Dan, namba blong olgeta i kasem sikisti tu taosen, seven handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Asere, namba blong olgeta i kasem foti wan taosen, faef handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo olgeta we oli laen blong Naftali, namba blong olgeta i kasem fifti tri taosen, fo handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Nao namba blong olgeta ya evriwan i kasem sikis handred tri taosen, faef handred fifti man olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 1:17-46"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47"/>Be oli no raetemdaon nem blong ol laen blong Livae* wetem olgeta ya,
<verse eid="NUM 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48"/>from we Hae God i bin talem long Moses fastaem se,
<verse eid="NUM 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49"/>“Taem yu kaontem ol man we oli naf blong faet, yu no mas kaontem ol laen blong Livae wetem olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 1:49"/><verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50-51"/>Wok blong olgeta ya i blong lukaot long Haos Tapolen blong mi wetem olgeta samting we i stap long hem. Oltaem olgeta oli mas putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta oli stap raon long hem, mo sipos yufala i muv blong go long narafala ples, olgeta ya bambae oli mas karem Haos ya wetem olgeta samting blong hem. Bambae oli mas tekemaot Haos Tapolen ya, mo oli mas putumap bakegen long olgeta ples we bambae yufala i go stap long hem. Be sipos wan narafala man i kam klosap long Haos ya, bambae yufala i mas kilim hem i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 1:50-51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52"/>Ol narafala laen blong yufala bambae oli mas stap long ol kampani blong olgeta, mo long ol laen blong olgeta, mo oli mas putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta raonabaot long flaeg blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53"/>Be ol laen blong Livae bambae oli mas stap raon long Haos Tapolen ya blong lukaot gud long hem mo blong gad long hem, blong bambae i no gat man i save kam klosap long hem. Sipos wan man i kam klosap long Haos ya, bambae mi mi kros, nao mi spolem yufala evriwan from.”
<verse eid="NUM 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54"/>Nao olgeta oli mekem olgeta samting ya stret olsem we Hae God i talem long Moses.
<verse eid="NUM 1:54"/><verse eid="NUM 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Fasin we olgeta oli folem blong mekem ples blong olgeta
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses wetem Hae Pris Eron se,
<verse eid="NUM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2"/>“Oltaem, sipos yufala i muv i go long narafala ples, bambae yufala i mas putumap ol haos tapolen blong yufala raon long Haos Tapolen blong mi. Bambae yufala i mas pulum ol flaeg blong ol fo kampani blong yufala, mo olgeta man bambae oli mas putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta raon long flaeg blong kampani blong olgeta, mo flaeg blong laen* blong olgeta tu bambae i mas flae antap.
<verse eid="NUM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3"/>“Oltaem, olgeta we oli aninit long flaeg blong Juda* bambae oli mas putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta long saed i go long is, raon long flaeg blong olgeta. Bambae oli stap long ol laen blong olgeta, aninit long han blong ol lida blong olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Long kampani ya, i gat ol laen blong Juda, we lida blong olgeta Nason, we papa blong hem Aminadab,
<verse eid="NUM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem seventi fo taosen, sikis handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5"/>Mo i gat ol laen blong Isakara* we lida blong olgeta Netanel, we papa blong hem Juara,
<verse eid="NUM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem fifti fo taosen, fo handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7"/>Mo i gat ol laen blong Sebulun,* we lida blong olgeta Eliab, we papa blong hem Helon,
<verse eid="NUM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem fifti seven taosen, fo handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9"/>Namba blong olgeta evriwan long kampani ya i kasem wan handred eiti sikis taosen, fo handred. Mo taem yufala i muv blong go long narafala ples, oltaem kampani ya bambae i stap wokbaot i go fastaem.
<verse eid="NUM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10"/>“Mo olgeta we oli aninit long flaeg blong Ruben* bambae oli mas putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta long saed i go long saot, raon long flaeg blong olgeta. Bambae oli stap long ol laen blong olgeta, aninit long han blong ol lida blong olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Long kampani ya, i gat ol laen blong Ruben, we lida blong olgeta Elijuru, we papa blong hem Sedeuru
<verse eid="NUM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem foti sikis taosen, faef handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12"/>Mo i gat ol laen blong Simeon,* we lida blong olgeta Selumiel, we papa blong hem Jurisadae,
<verse eid="NUM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem fifti naen taosen, tri handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14"/>Mo i gat ol laen blong Gad,* we lida blong olgeta Eliasaf, we papa blong hem Dehuel,
<verse eid="NUM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem foti faef taosen, sikis handred fifti.
<verse eid="NUM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16"/>Namba blong olgeta evriwan long kampani ya i kasem wan handred fifti wan taosen, fo handred fifti. Mo taem yufala i muv blong go long narafala ples, oltaem taem we yufala i luk we kampani ya we i aninit long flaeg blong Juda i muv i go, ale, i taem blong yufala i muv.
<verse eid="NUM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17"/>“Nao ol laen blong Livae* bambae oli tekemaot Haos Tapolen blong mi wetem ol samting blong hem, oli karem, oli wokbaot long medel blong ol fo kampani blong yufala. Mo bambae yufala i wokbaot long ol kampani blong yufala, biaen long ol flaeg blong yufala, olsem we yufala i stap stanemap ol haos tapolen blong yufala raon long ol flaeg ya.
<verse eid="NUM 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18"/>“Mo olgeta we oli aninit long flaeg blong Efrem* bambae oli mas putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta long saed i go long wes, raon long flaeg blong olgeta. Bambae oli stap long ol laen blong olgeta, aninit long han blong ol lida blong olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Long kampani ya, i gat ol laen blong Efrem, we lida blong olgeta Elisama, we papa blong hem Amihud,
<verse eid="NUM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem foti taosen, faef handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20"/>Mo i gat ol laen blong Manase,* we lida blong olgeta Gameliel, we papa blong hem Pedajuru,
<verse eid="NUM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem toti tu taosen, tu handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22"/>Mo i gat ol laen blong Benjamin,* we lida blong olgeta Abidan, we papa blong hem Gideoni,
<verse eid="NUM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem toti faef taosen, fo handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24"/>Namba blong olgeta evriwan long kampani ya i kasem wan handred eit taosen, wan handred. Mo taem kampani ya we i aninit long flaeg blong Ruben i muv i go, ale, i taem blong yufala i muv.
<verse eid="NUM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25"/>“Mo olgeta we oli aninit long flaeg blong Dan* bambae oli mas putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta long saed i go long not, raon long flaeg blong olgeta. Bambae oli stap long ol laen blong olgeta, aninit long han blong ol lida blong olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Long kampani ya, i gat ol laen blong Dan, we lida blong olgeta Ahiesa, we papa blong hem Amisadae,
<verse eid="NUM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem sikisti tu taosen, seven handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27"/>Mo i gat ol laen blong Asere* we lida blong olgeta Pagiel, we papa blong hem Okran,
<verse eid="NUM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem foti wan taosen, faef handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29"/>Mo i gat ol laen blong Naftali,* we lida blong olgeta Ahira, we papa blong hem Enan,
<verse eid="NUM 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30"/>mo namba blong olgeta i kasem fifti tri taosen, fo handred.
<verse eid="NUM 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31"/>Namba blong olgeta evriwan long kampani ya i kasem wan handred fifti seven taosen, sikis handred. Mo taem yufala i muv blong go long narafala ples, kampani ya bambae i laswan blong muv i go, biaen long taem ya we kampani we i aninit long flaeg blong Efrem i muv.”
<verse eid="NUM 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32"/>Namba blong olgeta man we Moses olgeta oli raetemdaon ol nem blong olgeta, folem ol laen blong olgeta insaed long ol kampani ya, i gat sikis handred tri taosen, faef handred fifti.
<verse eid="NUM 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33"/>Be olsem we Hae God i talem finis long hem, olgeta oli no raetemdaon nem blong ol laen blong Livae wetem olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34"/>Olgeta oli mekem evri samting stret olsem we Hae God i talem long Moses. Oli putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta raon long flaeg blong olgeta, mo oltaem, taem oli muv i go long narafala ples, olgeta oli stap wokbaot folem ol famle blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 2:34"/><verse eid="NUM 2:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ol pikinini blong Hae Pris Eron
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1"/>Nao long taem ya bifo we Hae God i toktok long Moses long hil ya Sinae, ol pikinini blong Hae Pris Eron mo Moses i olsem.
<verse eid="NUM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 26.60</char></note>Hae pris ya i gat fo pikinini boe blong hem, we nem blong olgeta Nadab, we i fasbon, mo Abihu, mo Eleasara mo Itamara.
<verse eid="NUM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3"/>Long taem ya, Moses i saksakem oel i go smosmol long olgeta ya, mo i putumap olgeta oli kam pris.
<verse eid="NUM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Lev 10.1,2; Nam 26.61</char></note>Be biaen, Nadab mo Abihu, tufala i ded long draeples long Sinae long fes blong Hae God, long taem ya we tufala i bonem insens* long faea we i no tabu blong givim i go long hem. Tufala ya i no gat pikinini blong tekem ples blong tufala, nao tufala pris ya Eleasara mo Itamara, tufala nomo i stap wok wetem papa blong tufala long taem ya we hem i stap.
<verse eid="NUM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hae God i putumap ol Livaet blong oli givhan long ol pris
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6"/>“Moses. Ol narafala man we oli laen* blong Livae,* yu tekem olgeta i kam, mo yu putumap olgeta, blong oli stap givhan long Hae Pris Eron.
<verse eid="NUM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7"/>Olgeta ya bambae oli mas mekem ol hevi wok blong Haos Tapolen blong mi, mo oli mas mekem ol narafala wok blong givhan long ol pris mo ol narafala man blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8"/>Oltaem oli mas lukaot long olgeta samting blong Haos Tapolen ya, mo oli mas mekem ol wok blong hem long nem blong yufala evriwan.
<verse eid="NUM 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9"/>Wok blong olgeta ya i blong givhan nomo long hae pris ya wetem tufala pikinini blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10"/>Bambae yu mas putumap hem wetem tufala pikinini ya blong hem, blong trifala nomo i mekem wok blong pris. Mo sipos wan narafala man i traem blong mekem wok ya, bambae yufala i mas kilim hem i ded.”
<verse eid="NUM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11"/>Mo Hae God i talem long hem bakegen se,
<verse eid="NUM 3:11"/><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12-13"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 13.2</char></note>“Mi mi Hae God. I stat naoia, ol laen blong Livae oli tabu, oli man blong mi. Yufala evriwan i laen blong Isrel,* mo bifo, long taem ya we mi kilim olgeta fasbon pikinini boe blong ol man Ijip wetem olgeta fasbon pikinini man blong ol anamol blong olgeta oli ded, mi mi makemaot olgeta fasbon pikinini boe blong yufala wetem olgeta fasbon pikinini man blong ol anamol blong yufala, se oli tabu, oli blong mi. Fastaem, olgeta fasbon pikinini boe blong yufala oli blong mi, be naoia, ol laen blong Livae oli tekem ples blong olgeta, oli man blong mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 3:12-13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moses i kaontem ol laen blong Livae
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14"/>Nao Hae God i toktok long Moses bakegen long draeples ya Sinae, i talem long hem se,
<verse eid="NUM 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15"/>“Moses. Yu mas raetemdaon nem blong olgeta man long laen* blong Livae,* folem ol laen mo famle blong olgeta, mo yu mas stat long ol pikinini boe we oli gat wan manis i go antap.”
<verse eid="NUM 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16"/>Nao hem i gohed, i mekem wok ya.
<verse eid="NUM 3:16"/><verse number="17-20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17-20"/>Olfala Livae ya i gat tri pikinini boe blong hem, we nem blong trifala, Geson mo Kohat mo Merari, mo trifala ya i kam stamba blong trifala laen ya we i karem nem blong trifala. Mo Geson i gat tu pikinini boe blong hem, we nem blong tufala, Libni mo Simei. Mo Kohat i gat fo pikinini boe blong hem, we nem blong olgeta Amram, mo Ijara, mo Hebron, mo Usiel. Mo Merari i gat tu pikinini boe blong hem, we nem blong tufala, Mali mo Musi. Mo olgeta ya oli kam ol stamba blong ol laen we oli karem ol nem blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:17-20"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21"/>Nao long laen blong Geson, i gat ol famle we oli laen blong Libni mo ol famle we oli laen blong Simei.
<verse eid="NUM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22"/>Mo namba blong olgeta man evriwan long tufala laen ya, i stat long ol pikinini boe we oli gat wan manis i go antap, i kasem seven taosen, faef handred man olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23"/>Olgeta ya oli stap putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta biaen long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God, long saed i go long wes,
<verse eid="NUM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24"/>mo Eliasaf, we papa blong hem Lael, hem i lida blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25"/>Wok blong olgeta ya i blong lukaot long Haos Tapolen ya wetem tufala tapolen ya blong hem blong blokem antap, mo kaliko we i hang long doa,
<verse eid="NUM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26"/>mo ol rop blong fasem haos ya wetem fenis blong hem, mo ol kaliko blong fenis ya we i goraon long Haos Tapolen ya, i blokem yad blong hem wetem Olta we i stap long hem, mo kaliko blong blokem doa blong yad ya. Wok blong olgeta samting ya i stap long han blong olgeta ya.
<verse eid="NUM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27"/>Mo long laen blong Kohat, i gat ol famle we oli laen blong Amram, wetem ol famle we oli laen blong Ijara, mo ol famle we oli laen blong Hebron, mo ol famle we oli laen blong Usiel.
<verse eid="NUM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28"/>Mo namba blong olgeta man evriwan long ol laen ya, i stat long ol pikinini boe we oli gat wan manis i go antap, i kasem eit taosen, sikis handred man olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29"/>Olgeta ya oli stap putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta klosap long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God, long saed i go long saot,
<verse eid="NUM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30"/>mo Elijafan, we papa blong hem Usiel, hem i lida blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31"/>Wok blong olgeta ya i blong lukaot long Bokis ya we i Saen blong Promes* blong Hae God, wetem Tebol blong Bred, mo Ples blong Putum ol Laet i Sidaon long hem mo tufala Olta, mo ol samting we ol pris oli stap yusum long Haos Tapolen ya, mo Kaliko we i blokem Rum ya we i Tabu we i Tabu. Wok blong olgeta samting ya i stap long han blong olgeta ya.
<verse eid="NUM 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32"/>Ol lida blong ol Livaet, bigfala lida blong olgeta evriwan pris ya Eleasara, we papa blong hem Hae Pris Eron. Mo wok blong hem blong i lukaot long ol man we oli stap wok long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God.
<verse eid="NUM 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33"/>Mo long laen blong Merari, i gat ol famle we oli laen blong Mali wetem ol famle we oli laen blong Musi.
<verse eid="NUM 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34"/>Mo namba blong olgeta man evriwan long tufala laen ya, i stat long ol pikinini boe we oli gat wan manis i go antap, i kasem sikis taosen, tu handred man olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35"/>Olgeta ya oli stap putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta klosap long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God, long saed i go long not, mo Juriel, we papa blong hem Abihael, hem i lida blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36"/>Wok blong olgeta ya i blong lukaot long olgeta wud blong Haos Tapolen ya. Hemia ol frem* blong wol blong hem, mo ol rel blong hem, mo ol pos blong hem, mo ol spesel stamba ya we oli wokem long silva no bras, blong ol frem mo ol pos ya oli stanap long olgeta, mo ol strap blong holemtaet olgeta samting ya. Ol wok blong ol samting ya i stap long han blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37"/>Mo oli stap lukaot long ol pos blong fenis blong yad blong Haos Tapolen ya, wetem ol spesel stamba blong ol pos ya, mo ol waea mo ol rop blong taetem fenis ya.
<verse eid="NUM 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38"/>Moses wetem Hae Pris Eron mo tufala pikinini blong hem oli stap putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta long fran blong Haos Tapolen blong Hae God, long saed i go long is. Mo wok blong olgeta i blong mekem wosip, mo blong mekem ol narafala wok long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God, long nem blong olgeta man. Be i gat tok i stap se sipos narafala man i traem blong mekem wok ya, bambae ol man oli mas kilim hem i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 3:38"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39"/>Nao namba blong olgeta laen blong Livae evriwan we Moses i kaontem olgeta folem ol laen mo famle blong olgeta olsem we Hae God i talem, i stat long ol pikinini we oli gat wan manis i go antap, i kasem twanti tu taosen man olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olgeta we oli laen blong Livae oli tekem ples blong ol fasbon pikinini boe blong ol laen blong Isrel
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="40-41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40-41"/>Nao bakegen, Hae God i talem long Moses se, “Moses. Mi mi Hae God, mi God blong yufala. Fastaem, olgeta fasbon pikinini boe blong yufala evriwan oli tabu, oli blong mi. Be naoia, i no moa olsem. Yufala ya nomo we i laen* blong Livae,* yufala i tekem ples blong ol fasbon ya, yufala i tabu, yufala i man blong mi. Mo ol anamol blong yufala oli blong mi tu, oli tekem ples blong ol fasbon anamol blong ol narafala laen blong yufala. Be yu mas raetemdaon nem blong olgeta fasbon pikinini boe blong olgeta ya, i stat long olgeta we oli gat wan manis, i go antap.”
<verse eid="NUM 3:40-41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42"/>Nao hem i mekem olsem we Hae God i talem, i raetemdaon nem blong olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 3:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43"/>mo namba blong olgeta evriwan ya i kasem twanti tu taosen, tu handred seventi tri man olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:43"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44"/>Nao Hae God i talem long hem se,
<verse eid="NUM 3:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45"/>“Naoia, yu mas makemaot ol laen blong yufala se oli blong mi, blong oli tekem ples blong olgeta fasbon pikinini boe blong ol narafala laen ya. Mo ol anamol blong yufala tu, yu mas makemaot olgeta se oli blong mi, blong oli tekem ples blong ol fasbon anamol blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 3:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46"/>Be from we namba blong ol fasbon blong olgeta i go antap winim namba blong yufala, we i gat tu handred seventi tri fasbon we i no gat jenis blong olgeta, bambae olgeta oli mas pemaot ol fasbon ya oli no moa blong mi,
<verse eid="NUM 3:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47"/>we praes blong olgeta, tu taosen faef handred vatu* long wan. Olgeta oli mas pemaot olgeta long sem mane we yufala stap yusum oltaem blong pem ol samting long ples blong mekem wosip,
<verse eid="NUM 3:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48"/>mo oli mas givim mane ya i go long Hae Pris Eron wetem tufala pikinini blong hem.”
<verse eid="NUM 3:48"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49"/>Nao Moses i mekem olsem we Hae God i talem,
<verse eid="NUM 3:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50"/>i tekem sikis handred naenti taosen vatu long ol man,
<verse eid="NUM 3:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51"/>nao i givim i go long hae pris ya wetem tufala pikinini blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 3:51"/><verse eid="NUM 3:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ol wok blong ol laen blong Kohat
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2"/>“Moses. Yu mas mekem sensas blong kaontem ol laen* blong Kohat. Bambae yu mas folem ol laen mo ol famle blong olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3"/>mo yu mas raetemdaon nem blong olgeta man we yia blong olgeta i kasem toti, gogo kasem olgeta we yia blong olgeta i kasem fifti. Hemia olgeta we oli save wok long Haos Tapolen blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4"/>Wok blong olgeta i blong lukaot long ol samting ya we i tabu we i tabu, we i blong Haos Tapolen ya.
<verse eid="NUM 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5"/>“Nao taem yufala i stap mekemrere blong muv i go long narafala ples, trifala pris ya, Hae Pris Eron wetem tufala pikinini blong hem, bambae trifala i mas kam insaed long Haos Tapolen ya blong mekemrere ol samting blong hem. Trifala i mas tekemaot Kaliko we i blokem Rum ya we i Tabu we i Tabu, we Bokis ya we i Saen blong Promes* blong mi i stap long hem, mo trifala i mas kavremap Bokis ya long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6"/>Nao trifala i mas tekem wan skin blong sikao, trifala i kavremap Bokis ya bakegen long hem, mo biaen, trifala i mas tekem wan blu kaliko, trifala i kavremap bakegen long hem. Nao biaen, trifala i mas tekem tufala wud ya blong karem Bokis ya, trifala i pusum i gotru long ol ring blong hem blong karem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7"/>“Mo trifala i mas tekem narafala blu kaliko, trifala i kavremap Tebol blong Bred ya we i No Gat Is long hem we trifala i stap givim i kam long mi. Nao trifala i mas tekem ol besin, wetem ol smol besin blong insens,* mo ol besin blong putum ol samting blong givim i kam long mi, mo ol botel we trifala i stap fulumap waen long hem blong givim i kam long mi, trifala i mas putum long Tebol ya, antap long blu kaliko ya. Mo oltaem, i mas gat bred* ya blong mi long Tebol ya.
<verse eid="NUM 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8"/>Nao trifala i mas tekem wan red kaliko, trifala i mas kavremap Tebol ya wetem ol samting ya long hem, mo antap long hemia, bambae trifala i mas kavremap bakegen long wan skin blong sikao. Nao biaen, trifala i mas tekem tufala wud blong karem Tebol ya, trifala i pusum i gotru long ol ring blong hem blong karem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9"/>“Mo bambae trifala i mas tekem wan narafala blu kaliko, trifala i kavremap ol Seven Laet ya wetem Ples ya blong Putum olgeta, mo ol samting blong kilim laet, mo ol trei, mo ol botel we trifala i stap fulumap olifoel* long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10"/>Nao bambae trifala i mas tekem wan skin blong sikao, trifala i mas rolemapgud olgeta samting ya long hem bakegen, mo trifala i mas putum long wan bed blong karem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11"/>“Mo nekis samting, bambae trifala i mas tekem wan narafala blu kaliko, trifala i kavremap Olta ya we oli wokem long gol, mo trifala i mas tekem wan skin blong sikao, trifala i kavremap Olta ya bakegen long hem, mo biaen, trifala i mas tekem tufala wud blong karem Olta ya, trifala i pusum i gotru long ol ring blong hem blong karem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12"/>Be ol narafala samting we trifala i stap yusum long Olta ya insaed long Haos Tapolen, trifala i mas rolemapgud olgeta long wan blu kaliko, mo trifala i mas rolemap olgeta bakegen long wan skin blong sikao, mo trifala i putum olgeta long wan bed blong karem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13"/>“Nao trifala i mas tekemaot ol asis mo doti blong gris long narafala Olta we i stap afsaed, mo trifala i tekem wan pepol kaliko, trifala i kavremap Olta ya long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14"/>Nao trifala i mas putum olgeta samting ya we oli stap yusum blong wok long Olta ya antap long hem. Hemia ol flat aean blong mekem faea long hem, mo ol huk, mo ol savel, mo ol besin. Nao trifala i mas tekem wan skin blong sikao, trifala i kavremap Olta ya bakegen long hem, mo trifala i mas tekem tufala wud blong karem Olta ya, trifala i pusum i gotru long ol ring blong hem blong karem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15"/>Nao taem yufala i rere blong muv i go long narafala ples, ol laen blong Kohat bambae oli kam karem olgeta samting ya. Be fastaem, trifala ya i mas kam kavremap olgeta samting ya blong mekemrere olgeta, from we ol laen blong Kohat, i tabu blong oli tajem ol samting ya. Sipos oli tajem, bambae oli ded from.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Mo oltaem, taem we yufala i tekemaot Haos Tapolen blong mi, hemia nao ol wok we ol laen blong Kohat oli mas mekem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16"/>“Mo wok blong pris ya Eleasara, we papa blong hem Hae Pris Eron, hem i mas lukaot long Haos Tapolen ya wetem olgeta samting we i stap insaed long hem, we hemia oel blong ol laet, mo insens, mo ol kakae blong garen* we ol man oli stap givim i kam long mi, mo oel blong makemaot ol samting oli kam tabu, mo olgeta narafala samting insaed long Haos Tapolen ya we mi bin mekem olgeta oli tabu, oli blong mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses mo Hae Pris Eron se,
<verse eid="NUM 4:17"/><verse number="18-20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18-20"/>“Taem ol laen blong Kohat oli kam blong karem ol samting ya we i tabu we i tabu, yutufala i mas blokem olgeta, blong oli no kam insaed. Eron. Yu wetem tufala pikinini blong yu, bambae yutrifala i mas kam insaed fastaem blong givimaot ol wok blong olgeta, mo yutrifala i mas talemaot long olgeta wanwan ol samting we bambae oli mas karem, from we sipos olgeta ya oli kam insaed long Haos Tapolen ya, nao oli luk ol tabu samting ya we yutrifala i stap mekemrere blong karemaot, nating we i blong smol taem nomo, be bambae oli ded from.”
<verse eid="NUM 4:18-20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol wok blong ol laen blong Geson
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22"/>“Yu mas mekem sensas bakegen blong kaontem ol laen* blong Geson, folem ol laen mo ol famle blong olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23"/>mo yu mas raetemdaon nem blong olgeta man we yia blong olgeta i kasem toti, gogo kasem olgeta we yia blong olgeta i kasem fifti. Hemia olgeta we oli save wok long Haos Tapolen blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24"/>Wok blong olgeta ya i blong karem
<verse eid="NUM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25"/>olgeta samting blong Haos Tapolen ya, wetem ol kaliko we i blong blokem ol wol blong hem insaed, mo tufala tapolen ya blong blokem antap, we faswan, oli wokem long skin blong man sipsip,* mo sekenwan, oli wokem long skin blong sikao, mo kaliko we i blong blokem doa,
<verse eid="NUM 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26"/>mo ol kaliko mo ol rop blong fenis we i goraon long Haos ya, i blokem yad blong hem wetem Olta we i stap long hem, mo kaliko blong blokem doa blong yad ya, mo olgeta samting we oli stap yusum blong putumap Haos ya wetem ol samting blong hem. Oltaem ol man ya oli mas mekem olgeta wok long ol samting ya, mo oli mas lukaot gud long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27"/>Yu wetem hae pris, yutufala i mas lukaot long ol laen blong Geson, blong oli mekem olgeta wok ya mo oli karem olgeta samting we hae pris ya wetem tufala pikinini blong hem trifala i givim long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28"/>Hemia nao ol wok blong ol laen blong Geson, long Haos Tapolen blong mi. Pris ya Itamara, we papa blong hem Hae Pris Eron, hem bambae i bos blong olgeta, blong oli mekem ol wok ya.”
<verse eid="NUM 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol wok blong ol laen blong Merari
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se, “Moses. Yu mas mekem sensas bakegen blong kaontem ol laen* blong Merari, folem ol laen mo ol famle blong olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30"/>mo yu mas raetemdaon nem blong olgeta man we yia blong olgeta i kasem toti, gogo kasem olgeta we yia blong olgeta i kasem fifti. Hemia olgeta we oli save wok long Haos Tapolen blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31"/>Wok blong olgeta ya i blong karem olgeta wud blong Haos Tapolen ya. Hemia ol frem* blong wol blong hem, mo ol rel blong hem, mo ol pos blong hem, mo ol spesel stamba we oli wokem long silva no bras, blong ol frem mo ol pos ya oli stanap long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32"/>Mo bambae oli stap karem tu ol pos blong fenis blong blokem yad blong Haos ya, wetem ol spesel stamba blong ol pos ya mo ol aean we i blong taetem ol rop long olgeta, mo ol rop blong holemtaet fenis ya, mo ol strap blong holemtaet ol frem ya. Bambae yu mas seraot ol samting ya blong ol man oli karem, nao olgeta man wanwan bambae oli gat ol spesel samting blong oli stap karem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33"/>Hemia nao ol wok blong ol laen blong Merari, long Haos Tapolen blong mi, mo pris ya Itamara bambae i bos blong olgeta ya tu blong oli mekem ol wok ya.”
<verse eid="NUM 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moses i kaontem ol laen blong Livae
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="34-48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34-48"/>Nao Moses wetem Hae Pris Eron mo ol lida blong olgeta man ya oli folem tok blong Hae God, oli mekem trifala sensas ya. Olgeta oli kaontem ol laen* blong Kohat, mo ol laen blong Geson, mo ol laen blong Merari, folem ol laen mo ol famle blong olgeta, mo oli raetemdaon nem blong olgeta man we yia blong olgeta i kasem toti, gogo kasem olgeta we yia blong olgeta i kasem fifti. Hemia olgeta ya we oli save mekem wok long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long ol laen blong Kohat, namba blong olgeta i kasem tu taosen, seven handred fifti.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long ol laen blong Geson, namba blong olgeta i kasem tu taosen, sikis handred toti.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long ol laen blong Merari, namba blong olgeta i kasem tri taosen, tu handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Nao namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem eit taosen, faef handred eiti man olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 4:34-48"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49"/>Moses olgeta oli raetemdaon nem blong ol man ya wanwan, stret olsem we Hae God i talem long hem, mo hem i seraot ol wok i go long olgeta, blong oli karem ol samting ya, olsem we Hae God i talem.
<verse eid="NUM 4:49"/><verse eid="NUM 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ol man we oli no klin long fes blong Hae God
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1"/>Nao Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses
<verse eid="NUM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2"/>blong i go talemaot long ol laen* blong Isrel.* Hem i talem se, “Moses. Olgeta man long ples blong yufala we oli gat rabis sik long skin blong olgeta, wetem olgeta we oli gat sik, no soa, no wanem, nao blad no wota no wanem i stap kamkamaot long bodi blong olgeta, mo olgeta we oli tajem dedbodi, yufala i mas sanemaot olgeta oli gowe long ples ya we ol haos tapolen blong yufala i stap long hem, oli go stap afsaed.
<verse eid="NUM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3"/>Yufala i man blong mi, mo mi mi stap wetem yufala long ples ya, be olgeta man ya oli no klin long fes blong mi. Nating we man no woman, be yufala i mas sanem olgeta oli go stap afsaed, blong oli no mekem ples ya i doti.”
<verse eid="NUM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4"/>Nao olgeta oli mekem olsem we Hae God i talem. Oli sanemaot olgeta ya oli gowe long ples ya we olgeta oli stap long hem, oli go stap afsaed.
<verse eid="NUM 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rod blong givimbak ol samting we man i stilim
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Lev 6.1-7</char></note>Mo bakegen, Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses
<verse eid="NUM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6"/>blong i go talemaot long olgeta. Hem i talem se, “Moses. Sipos tingting blong wan man i no moa stap long mi, nao hem i girap, i go stilim sam samting blong narafala man, no i go mekem narafala fasin nogud olsem,
<verse eid="NUM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7"/>hem bambae i mas talemaot sin ya blong hem. Mo sipos hem i stilim ten samting, bambae hem i mas givimbak ol ten samting ya evriwan i go long man blong hem, wetem tu narafala samting antap bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8"/>Be sipos man blong hem i ded, mo i no gat wan stret famle blong hem i stap, blong man ya i givimbak ol samting ya i go long hem, hem i mas givim ol samting ya i kam long mi, blong ol pris oli save yusum. Mo hem i mas givim wan man sipsip tu long pris blong i mekem sakrefaes long hem, blong mekem hem i klin bakegen long fes blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9"/>“Olgeta spesel samting we yufala i stap givim i kam long mi oli blong pris we i tekem ol samting ya, i givim i kam long mi.
<verse eid="NUM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10"/>Pris i gat raet blong yusum ol samting olsem we yufala i putum long han blong hem.”
<verse eid="NUM 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rod blong stretem bisnes ya we man i jalus tumas long woman blong hem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11"/>Mo bakegen, Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses
<verse eid="NUM 5:11"/><verse number="12-14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12-14"/>blong i go talemaot long olgeta. Hem i talem se, “Moses. Sipos wan man i stap jalus from we i ting se woman blong hem i stap slip wetem narafala man, be hem i no save stret se samting ya i tru, from we woman ya i stap haedem, mo i no gat witnes blong samting ya, mo i no gat man i faenem we woman ya i mekem olsem, be i gat rod blong stretem bisnes olsem i stap. No sipos wan man i stap jalus from nating se woman blong hem i stap slip wetem narafala man, be woman ya blong hem i stap holemgud promes blong tufala yet, be sem rod i stap blong stretem tufala bisnes ya.
<verse eid="NUM 5:12-14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15"/>Sipos wan man i stap jalus olsem, bambae hem i mas tekem woman blong hem i go luk pris blong stretem bisnes ya. Mo hem i mas tekem wan kilo flaoa we oli wokem long bale* blong givim long mi long nem blong woman ya, olsem we Loa i talem. Be hem i no mas kafsaedem olifoel* i go long flaoa ya, mo i no mas putum insens* long hem. Hem i mas givim flaoa ya long mi blong mekem wosip long mi, from we jalus ya i stap spolem hem, nao hem i wantem faenemaot se i tru no i no tru.
<verse eid="NUM 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16"/>“Nao pris i mas tekem woman ya i kam, i putum hem i stanap long fes blong mi, long fran blong Olta.
<verse eid="NUM 5:16"/><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17-18"/>Nao hem i mas kafsaedem smol wota we i tabu, i klin gud i go long wan graonpot, mo i go tekem smol asis blong graon insaed long Haos Tapolen blong mi, i putum i go long wota ya blong mekem i konkon mo i save spolem man. Nao hem i mas slakem hea blong woman ya, mo i mas tekem flaoa ya we i blong givim i kam long mi, i givim long hem blong i holem fastaem. Nao pris i mas holem graonpot ya we wota i stap long hem,
<verse eid="NUM 5:17-18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19"/>mo i mas talem wan strong tok, we woman ya i mas agri long hem. Hem i mas talem se, ‘Sipos i tru we yu no go slip wetem narafala man, wota ya bambae i no save spolem yu.
<verse eid="NUM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20"/>Be sipos yu bin slip wetem narafala man,
<verse eid="NUM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21"/>Hae God bambae i mekem nem blong yu i kam wan tok nogud blong singaot* trabol i kam long narafala man, nao olgeta man we oli stap raonabaot long yu bambae oli save yusum nem blong yu olsem. Hae God bambae i mekem ples blong pikinini long bel blong yu i kam drae, mo bel blong yu bambae i solap.
<verse eid="NUM 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22"/>Wota ya bambae i go insaed long bel blong yu, i mekem i solap, mo i mekem ples blong pikinini long bel blong yu i kam drae olgeta.’
</para>
  <para style="p">“Nao woman ya bambae i mas talem se, ‘I gud nomo. Hae God bambae i mekem olsem.’
<verse eid="NUM 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23"/>“Nao pris i mas raetemdaon strong tok ya, mo i mas wasemaot tok ya bakegen i go insaed long wota ya we i konkon.
<verse eid="NUM 5:23"/><verse number="24-26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24-26"/>Nao hem i mas tekemaot flaoa ya long han blong woman ya, i leftemap blong soemaot we i givim i kam long mi, mo i kam putum long Olta, mo i mas tekem sam flaoa long han blong hem, i bonem long Olta, blong soemaot we i givim i kam long mi. Nao hem i mas tekem wota ya i givim long hem blong i dring.
<verse eid="NUM 5:24-26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27"/>Sipos woman ya i bin slip wetem narafala man, bambae wota ya i mekem hem i harem bodi blong hem i soa we i soa. Bambae bel blong hem i solap, mo ples blong pikinini long bel blong hem bambae i kam drae. Mo ol man we oli stap raonabaot long hem bambae oli stap yusum nem blong hem blong singaot trabol i kam long man.
<verse eid="NUM 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28"/>Be sipos hem i no mekem samting nogud olsem, bambae wota ya i no save spolem hem, mo bambae hem i save karem pikinini.
<verse eid="NUM 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29-30"/>“Hemia nao loa blong stretem tufala fasin ya we i save mekem man i jalus long woman blong hem. Bambae pris i mas tekem woman i kam stanap long fes blong mi, nao bambae i mas mekem ol samting we loa ya i talem.
<verse eid="NUM 5:29-30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31"/>Man we i tekem woman blong hem i kam, hem i mekem i stret nomo, be sipos oli faenem se woman blong hem i mekem sin, bambae woman ya i mas panis from.”
<verse eid="NUM 5:31"/><verse eid="NUM 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ol rul blong ol Nasiraet
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1"/>Nao bakegen, Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses
<verse eid="NUM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2"/>blong i go talemaot long ol laen* blong Isrel.* Hem i talem se, “Moses. Sipos wan man no wan woman i wantem mekem promes long mi se bambae hem i kam wan Nasiraet,* we i tabu, i spesel man blong mi,
<verse eid="NUM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Luk 1.15</char></note>bambae hem i no mas dring waen mo ol narafala dring we i save mekem man i drong. Hem i no mas dring ol dring we ol man oli stap wokem long grep,* mo i no mas kakae ol frut blong rop ya tu, nating we oli tekem we i jes raep no i sandrae.
<verse eid="NUM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4"/>Sipos man i kam Nasiraet, bambae i tabu blong hem i kakae wan samting blong rop ya, nating we sid blong hem, no skin blong frut blong hem, be i tabu blong hem i kakae.
<verse eid="NUM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5"/>“Mo sipos wan man i mekem promes long mi mo i kam Nasiraet, man ya i kam tabu, i man blong mi. Mo hem i mas holem promes ya blong hem gogo kasem en blong taem ya we hem i putum, mo hem i mas letem hea blong hem mo mustas blong hem i gru go kasem en blong taem ya.
<verse eid="NUM 6:5"/><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6-7"/>Hea blong hem bambae i soemaot we hem i tabu, i man blong mi. Mo sipos man i mekem promes olsem, bambae hem i no mas go klosap long dedbodi, from we dedbodi bambae i mekem hem i kam doti long fes blong mi. I nomata we dedman ya i papa blong hem no mama blong hem, no brata blong hem, no sista blong hem, be hem i no mas go klosap long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 6:6-7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8"/>Olwe long taem ya we hem i Nasiraet, hem i tabu, i man blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9"/>“Mo sipos wan man i ded wantaem nomo klosap long wan Nasiraet, samting ya i mekem hea blong Nasiraet ya i no moa klin long fes blong mi, i no moa tabu. Nasiraet ya i mas wet go kasem we seven dei i pas, nao hem i mas sevemaot hea blong hem wetem mustas blong hem, blong kam klin bakegen long fes blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10"/>Nao long namba eit dei blong hem, hem i mas tekem tu sotleg* no tu nawimba i kam long pris long doa blong yad blong Haos Tapolen blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11"/>Nao pris i mas tekem wan long tufala pijin ya, i mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong man ya, mo i mas tekem narawan, i mekem sakrefaes ya we i bonem i bon evriwan blong mekem wosip long mi. Pris i mas mekem ol samting ya blong mekem Nasiraet ya i klin bakegen long fes blong mi, from we hem i stap klosap long man ya taem i ded. Nao long sem dei ya nomo, man ya bambae i mas mekem promes, se taem hea blong hem i gru, bambae i tabu, i blong mi bakegen,
<verse eid="NUM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12"/>mo hem i mas mekem narafala promes long mi bakegen, se bambae hem i tabu, i man blong mi blong hamas yia ya bakegen we hem i promes blong mekem fastaem. Bambae hem i no save kaontem ol yia ya blong hem blong fastaem, from we dedbodi ya i mekem hea blong hem i no moa klin long fes blong mi. Mo hem i mas tekem wan smol sipsip i kam we i gat wan yia blong hem, blong mekem sakrefaes long hem blong mekem hem i klin bakegen long fes blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13-15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13-15"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Wok 21.23,24</char></note>“Mo sipos wan Nasiraet i finisim taem blong hem, ol samting we hem i mas mekem i olsem. Hem i mas tekem tri sipsip we i no gat wan samting i rong long bodi blong trifala, i tekem trifala i kam long doa blong yad blong Haos Tapolen blong mi blong givim i kam long mi, wetem ol kakae blong garen* mo waen we Loa i talem se i mas givim wetem trifala. Trifala sipsip ya, wan i mas smol man sipsip we i gat wan yia blong hem, we i blong mekem sakrefaes ya we i blong bonem i bon evriwan blong mekem wosip long mi, mo wan i mas smol woman sipsip we i gat wan yia blong hem, we i blong mekem spesel sakrefaes long hem blong tekemaot sin, mo wan i mas man sipsip bakegen we i blong mekem sakrefaes ya we i soemaot we man i stap fren gud wetem mi. Mo bakegen, hem i mas tekem wan basket kakae we oli wokem long flaoa we i no gat is long hem. Long basket ya, i mas gat ol bred* ya we i no gat is long hem, we oli wokem long flaoa ya we i beswan, we oli tantanem flaoa blong hem wetem olifoel,* mo ol bisket* we oli ravem olifoel long olgeta. Olgeta samting ya, hem i mas tekem olgeta i kam blong givim i kam long mi.
<verse eid="NUM 6:13-15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16"/>“Nao pris i mas givim olgeta samting ya i kam long mi. Hem i mas mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin, mo sakrefaes ya we i blong bonem i bon evriwan,
<verse eid="NUM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17"/>mo hem i mas mekem sakrefaes long narafala man sipsip ya we hem i bonem haf, man ya i kakae haf blong soemaot we hem i stap fren gud wetem mi. Mo taem hem i bonem sakrefaes ya, hem i mas givim basket kakae ya tu i go wetem, mo i mas tekem ol narafala kakae mo waen, i givim i kam long mi.
<verse eid="NUM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18"/>Long taem ya, Nasiraet ya i mas kam stanap long doa blong yad blong Haos Tapolen blong mi, mo i mas sevemaot ol hea blong hed blong hem, mo i mas bonem long faea ya we pris i stap bonem haf blong man sipsip ya long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19"/>“Nao pris i mas kukum narafala haf blong man sipsip ya, mo taem i tan, hem i mas tekemaot solda blong hem, i tekem i kam long Nasiraet ya, i putum long han blong hem wetem wan bred we i no gat is long hem, mo wan bisket, we i tekemaot tufala long basket ya.
<verse eid="NUM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20"/>Nao biaen, hem i mas tekemaot ol samting ya bakegen, i leftemap olgeta long fes blong mi blong givim olgeta i kam long mi. Olgeta samting ya i tabu, i spesel presen long pris blong hem i kakae. Presen ya i antap long jes mo leg blong man sipsip ya we Loa i talem se i blong pris. Nao biaen, Nasiraet ya i save dring waen bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21"/>“Hemia nao ol rul blong Nasiraet. Be sipos wan Nasiraet i promes blong givim sam samting i kam long mi we i bitim mak we ol rul ya i talem, hem i mas mekem samting ya stret olsem we hem i promes blong mekem.”
<verse eid="NUM 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tok blong ol pris blong blesem ol man
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22"/>Nao bakegen, Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses
<verse eid="NUM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23"/>blong i go talemaot long Hae Pris Eron wetem tufala pikinini ya blong hem. Mo Moses i go talemaot we Hae God i talem se, “Eron. Yu wetem tufala pikinini blong yu, mo olgeta we bambae oli stap kamaot biaen long yufala, sipos yufala i blesem ol laen* blong Isrel,* bambae yufala i mas talem se,
<verse eid="NUM 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24"/>‘Prea blong mi,
</para>
  <para style="q2">we Hae God bambae i blesem yu,
</para>
  <para style="q3">mo i stap lukaot gud long yu,
<verse eid="NUM 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25"/>hem bambae i kaen gud long yu,
</para>
  <para style="q3">mo i gat sore long yu,
<verse eid="NUM 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q2"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26"/>hem bambae i stap lukluk i kam long yu oltaem,
</para>
  <para style="q4">blong givhan long yu long gladhat blong hem,
</para>
  <para style="q3">mo hem bambae i givim pis long yu.’
<verse eid="NUM 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27"/>Mo sipos yufala i blesem ol man long nem blong mi, mi bambae mi blesem olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 6:27"/><verse eid="NUM 6:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ol presen blong ol lida
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1"/>Nao Moses i putumap Haos Tapolen ya we ol laen* blong Isrel* bambae oli stap kam long hem blong mit wetem Hae God. Mo taem hem i finisim wok ya, hem i saksakem oel i go long Haos Tapolen ya, wetem olgeta samting we i stap insaed long hem, mo long Olta blong hem wetem olgeta samting we oli stap yusum long hem, blong mekem olgeta oli tabu. Nao hem i prea blong givim olgeta i go long Hae God.
<verse eid="NUM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2"/>Nao ol twelef lida ya we oli lida blong ol twelef laen blong olgeta, mo we oli bin givhan long ol wok blong sensas ya bifo,
<verse eid="NUM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3"/>olgeta oli tekem ol presen blong olgeta, oli kam givim i go long Hae God. Oli givim sikis kat blong karem ol samting, we tu lida i givim wan, tu lida i givim wan, mo oli givim twelef buluk, we wan lida i givim wan, wan lida i givim wan, nao evri kat ya, tu buluk i pulum wan, tu buluk i pulum wan. Mo taem oli givim ol samting ya i go finis,
<verse eid="NUM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4"/>Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5"/>“I gud yu holem ol presen ya, yu yusum long ol wok blong Haos Tapolen blong mi. Bambae yu givim olgeta i go long ol Livaet* blong oli yusum long ol wok blong olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 7:5"/><verse number="6-8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6-8"/>Nao hem i givim tu kat wetem fo buluk blong pulum, i go long ol laen blong Geson, mo i givim fo kat wetem eit buluk i go long ol laen blong Merari. Olgeta ya, pris ya Itamara we papa blong hem i hae pris, hem nao i bos blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 7:6-8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9"/>Be ol laen blong Kohat, hem i no givim kat mo buluk i go long olgeta, from we olgeta oli man blong lukaot long ol tabu samting, we oltaem oli mas karem long solda blong olgeta nomo.
<verse eid="NUM 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10"/>Nao long taem ya we Moses i saksakem oel i go long Olta blong Bonem Sakrefaes mo i mekem prea blong givim Olta ya i go long Hae God, ol lida ya oli tekem ol narafala presen tu i kam blong givim i go long Hae God. Mo taem olgeta oli rere blong go putum ol presen ya long fran blong Olta,
<verse eid="NUM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11"/>Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses blong i go talemaot long ol twelef lida ya. Hem i talem se, “Moses. Bambae yufala i stap mekem wosip go kasem twelef dei, mo i nogud olgeta lida ya evriwan oli kam wantaem blong givim ol presen blong olgeta. Bambae wan i kam wan dei, wan i kam wan dei, gogo olgeta oli givim ol presen blong olgeta i kam long mi, blong mekem Olta ya we yufala i wantem givim i kam long mi i tabu, i blong mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12-83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12-83"/>Nao olgeta oli folem fasin ya blong givim ol presen blong olgeta i go long Hae God.
</para>
  <para style="p">Long fas dei, Nason, we papa blong hem Aminadab, we i lida blong ol laen blong Juda,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long seken dei, Netanel, we papa blong hem Juara, we i lida blong ol laen blong Isakara,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long namba tri dei, Eliab we papa blong hem Helon, we i lida blong ol laen blong Sebulun,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long namba fo dei, Elijuru, we papa blong hem Sedeuru, we i lida blong ol laen blong Ruben,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long namba faef dei, Selumiel, we papa blong hem Jurisadae, we i lida blong ol laen blong Simeon,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long namba sikis dei, Eliasaf, we papa blong hem Dehuel, we i lida blong ol laen blong Gad,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long namba seven dei, Elisama we papa blong hem Amihud, we i lida blong ol laen blong Efrem,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long namba eit dei, Gameliel, we papa blong hem Pedajuru, we i lida blong ol laen blong Manase,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long namba naen dei, Abidan, we papa blong hem Gideoni, we i lida blong ol laen blong Benjamin,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long namba ten dei, Ahiesa, we papa blong hem Amisadae, we i lida blong ol laen blong Dan,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long namba leven dei, Pagiel, we papa blong hem Okran, we i lida blong ol laen blong Asere,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo long namba twelef dei, Ahira, we papa blong hem Enan, we i lida blong ol laen blong Naftali,* hem i tekem ol presen blong olgeta i kam.
</para>
  <para style="p">Ol presen ya blong olgeta we oli tekem i kam i sem mak nomo, mo oli olsem. Ol lida ya wanwan oli givim wan bigfala silva besin we hevi blong hem i kasem wan kilo haf, mo praes blong hem i samwe long sikisti tu taosen faef handred vatu,* mo wan smol silva besin we hevi blong hem i kasem eit handred gram, mo praes blong hem i samwe long toti seven taosen faef handred vatu, we oli skelem olgeta long skel* ya we oli stap yusum long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God. Ol besin ya oli fulap long flaoa we oli tantanem finis wetem olifoel,* we presen ya i blong givim i go long Hae God long saed blong ol kakae blong garen.* Mo ol lida ya wanwan oli givim wan smol besin we oli wokem long gol we hevi blong hem i kasem wan handred twanti gram, we praes blong hem i samwe long seventi faef taosen vatu, we ol besin ya oli fulap long insens.* Mo olgeta wanwan oli givim wan yang bul, mo wan man sipsip, mo wan smol man sipsip we i gat wan yia blong hem. Trifala anamol ya i blong mekem sakrefaes ya we i blong bonem i bon evriwan blong mekem wosip long Hae God. Mo olgeta wanwan oli givim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin. Mo bakegen, olgeta wanwan oli givim tu bul, wetem faef man sipsip, mo faef man nani, mo faef man sipsip we oli gat wan yia blong olgeta, we olgeta i blong mekem sakrefaes ya we pris i bonem haf, ol man oli kakae haf, blong soemaot we oli stap fren gud wetem Hae God.
<verse eid="NUM 7:12-83"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="84-88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84-88"/>Olgeta presen ya evriwan we ol twelef lida ya oli tekem i kam long taem ya i olsem.
</para>
  <para style="p">I gat twelef bigfala silva besin mo twelef smol silva besin, we hevi blong olgeta evriwan i kasem twanti seven kilo sikis handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo i gat twelef smol besin we oli wokem long gol, we hevi blong olgeta i kasem wan kilo fo handred foti, mo ol besin ya oli fulap long insens.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo i gat twelef bul, mo twelef man sipsip, mo twelef smol man sipsip we oli gat wan yia blong olgeta wetem ol kakae blong garen, we olgeta samting ya i blong mekem sakrefaes ya we i blong bonem i bon evriwan, blong mekem wosip long Hae God.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo i gat twelef man nani we oli blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin.
</para>
  <para style="p">Mo i gat twanti fo bul, wetem sikisti man sipsip, mo sikisti man nani, mo sikisti smol man sipsip we oli gat wan yia blong olgeta, we olgeta i blong mekem sakrefaes ya we pris i bonem haf, ol man oli kakae haf blong soemaot we oli stap fren gud wetem Hae God.
</para>
  <para style="p">Hemia nao olgeta samting we ol twelef lida ya oli givim i go long Hae God, long taem ya we Moses i saksakem oel i go long bigfala Olta ya long fran blong Haos Tapolen ya mo i prea blong mekem i tabu, i blong Hae God.
<verse eid="NUM 7:84-88"/></para>
  <para style="s">Prapa fasin blong putum ol laet
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89"/>Nao taem Moses i go insaed long Haos Tapolen ya blong toktok wetem Hae God, hem i harem we Hae God i stap toktok long hem we voes blong hem i stap kamaot long medel blong tufala jerubim* antap long lid blong Bokis ya we i Saen blong Promes* blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 7:89"/><verse eid="NUM 7:89"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8"/>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 25.31-40; 37.17-24</char></note>Long taem ya, Hae God i givim tok blong hem long hem,
<verse eid="NUM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2"/>blong i go talemaot long Hae Pris Eron. Hem i talem se, “Moses. Taem hae pris ya i kam putum ol seven smol laet ya i stap long spesel ples blong olgeta insaed long Haos Tapolen blong mi, bambae hem i mas tanem olgeta oli saen i kam long fran.”
<verse eid="NUM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3"/>Nao hae pris ya i stap mekem olsem we Hae God i talem. Oltaem hem i stap putum ol laet ya oli stap saen i kam long fran.
<verse eid="NUM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4"/>Mo Ples ya blong Putum ol Laet, taem ol man oli wokem, oli hamarem long wan pis gol nomo, i stat long botom blong hem, i go kasem top blong hem, folem plan blong hem we Hae God i soem long Moses fastaem.
<verse eid="NUM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moses i mekem ol Livaet oli klin long fes blong Hae God
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6"/>“Moses. Ol Livaet* ya, bambae yu tekemaot olgeta long ol narafala laen* blong Isrel,* yu mekem olgeta oli klin long fes blong mi. Rod blong mekem samting ya i olsem.
<verse eid="NUM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7"/>Yu mas tekem wota ya we i blong mekem ol samting i klin long fes blong mi, yu mas saksakem i go long olgeta. Mo yu mas talem long olgeta blong oli go sevemaot olgeta hea blong olgeta, i stat long hed blong olgeta, i go kasem leg blong olgeta daon, mo blong oli go wasem ol klos blong olgeta. Nao bambae olgeta oli klin long fes blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8"/>Nao oli mas tekem wan yang bul wetem ol kakae blong garen* olsem we Loa i talem blong mekem sakrefaes ya we i blong bonem i bon evriwan blong mekem wosip long mi. Hemia flaoa we oli tantanem wetem olifoel.* Mo bambae yu yu mas tekem wan bul bakegen we i blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin.
<verse eid="NUM 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9"/>Nao yu mas tekem olgeta laen blong Isrel oli kam wanples, mo bambae yu putum ol Livaet ya oli stanap long fran blong Haos Tapolen blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10"/>Nao ol laen ya blong Isrel oli mas kam putum han blong olgeta long hed blong ol Livaet ya,
<verse eid="NUM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11"/>mo Hae Pris Eron i mas mekem prea blong makemaot olgeta se oli tabu, oli man blong mi. Olgeta ya oli kamaot long yufala evriwan, mo yufala i givim olgeta i kam long mi blong oli mekem wok blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12"/>Nao olgeta oli mas putum han blong olgeta long hed blong tufala bul ya, mo hae pris i mas tekem wan long tufala, i mekem spesel sakrefaes long hem blong tekemaot sin. Mo narawan, hem i mas mekem sakrefaes ya long hem we i blong bonem i bon evriwan blong mekem wosip long mi. Hemia nao rod we bambae yu mas folem blong mekem olgeta oli klin long fes blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13"/>“Long fasin ya, bambae yu yu mekem olgeta ya oli tabu, oli blong mi. Olgeta ya i wan spesel presen we yufala i givim i kam long mi, mo bambae yu mas putum olgeta oli stap wok aninit long hae pris ya wetem tufala pikinini ya blong hem, blong oli stap givhan long trifala.
<verse eid="NUM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14"/>Yu mas tekemaot olgeta oli no moa stap wetem yufala, blong bambae oli kam spesel man blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15"/>Mo taem yu mekem olgeta oli klin long fes blong mi, mo yu mekem prea long olgeta blong mekem olgeta oli tabu, oli spesel man blong mi, bambae oli save kam mekem wok blong mi long Haos Tapolen blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16"/>Mi mi talemaot finis long yufala we olgeta ya oli blong tekem ples blong olgeta fasbon pikinini boe blong yufala evriwan, mo oli tabu, oli blong mi nomo.
<verse eid="NUM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 13.2</char></note>Bifo, long taem ya we mi mi kilim olgeta fasbon pikinini boe blong ol man Ijip, mi mekem we olgeta fasbon pikinini boe blong yufala wetem olgeta fasbon pikinini man blong ol anamol blong yufala oli tabu, oli blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18"/>Be naoia, mi mi tekem ol Livaet, blong oli tekem ples blong ol pikinini ya,
<verse eid="NUM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19"/>mo mi putum olgeta oli stap aninit long hae pris ya wetem tufala pikinini ya blong hem, blong givhan long trifala. Olgeta oli wan spesel presen we yufala i givim i kam long mi blong mekem ol wok long nem blong yufala long Haos Tapolen blong mi, mo blong blokem yufala evriwan, blong trabol i no kasem yufala. Haos Tapolen blong mi i tabu, mo sipos wan man blong narafala laen i kam klosap tumas long hem, bambae hem i ded from.”
<verse eid="NUM 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20-22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20-22"/>Nao Moses mo Hae Pris Eron, wetem olgeta laen blong Isrel oli mekem olsem we Hae God i talem. Fastaem, ol Livaet ya oli wasem ol klos blong olgeta, mo oli mekem olgeta oli klin long fes blong Hae God, nao hae pris i mekem prea blong mekem olgeta oli tabu, oli blong Hae God, mo i mekem ol sakrefaes ya tu blong mekem olgeta oli klin long fes blong hem. Olgeta ya i wan spesel presen we ol narafala laen blong Isrel oli givim i go long Hae God, mo ol narafala laen ya oli mekem olgeta samting long olgeta olsem we Hae God i talem. Mo long fasin ya, olgeta oli mekem ol Livaet ya oli gat raet blong mekem ol wok blong Haos Tapolen blong Hae God. Olgeta oli kam man blong givhan long pris, mo oli stap wok aninit long hae pris ya wetem tufala pikinini blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 8:20-22"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24"/>“Ol Livaet we yia blong olgeta i kasem twanti faef i go antap oli mas mekem ol wok blong Haos Tapolen blong mi,
<verse eid="NUM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25"/>gogo kasem we oli gat fifti yia blong olgeta, nao bambae oli mas ritae.
<verse eid="NUM 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26"/>Nao sipos man i ritae, bambae hem i save givhan nomo long ol narafala fren blong hem long ol wok long Haos ya, be hem i no save mekem wok hem wan. Hemia nao rod we bambae yu mas folem blong lukaot long olgeta ya.”
<verse eid="NUM 8:26"/><verse eid="NUM 8:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Namba tu Lafet blong Pasova we ol laen blong Isrel oli mekem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 12.1-13</char></note>Nao long seken yia biaen long taem ya we olgeta oli aot long Ijip, long fas manis blong hem, Hae God i toktok long Moses long draeples ya long Sinae. Hem i talem se,
<verse eid="NUM 9:1"/><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2-3"/>“Moses. Long namba fotin dei* blong manis ya, i stat long taem we san i godaon, bambae yufala evriwan i mas mekem Lafet* blong Pasova,* mo bambae yufala i mas folem ol rul blong hem olsem we Loa i talem.”
<verse eid="NUM 9:2-3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4"/>Nao Moses i talemaot tok ya long olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5"/>mo long draeples ya, long namba fotin dei blong manis ya, taem san i godaon, olgeta oli mekem lafet ya, mo oli mekem evri samting blong hem stret olsem we Hae God i bin talem bifo.
<verse eid="NUM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6"/>Be long taem ya, i gat sam long olgeta i stap we oli no klin long fes blong Hae God, from we oli bin tajem dedbodi, nao oli no save joen blong mekem lafet ya long dei blong hem. Nao olgeta oli go luk Moses wetem hae pris, oli talem long tufala se,
<verse eid="NUM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7"/>“Mifala i no klin long fes blong Hae God, from we mifala i bin tajem dedbodi. ?Olsem wanem? ?I gat rod i stap blong mifala i save joen wetem olgeta blong givim presen i go long Hae God?”
<verse eid="NUM 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8"/>Nao Moses i talem se, “Yufala i wet fastaem. Bambae mi go traem faenemaot rod blong yufala long Hae God.”
<verse eid="NUM 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9"/>Nao hem i go askem long Hae God, mo Hae God i givim tok blong hem long hem
<verse eid="NUM 9:9"/><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10-11"/>blong i go talemaot long olgeta laen* blong Isrel.* Hem i talem se, “Moses. Rul blong yufala wetem ol pikinini blong yufala mo olgeta we bambae i kamaot biaen long yufala i olsem. Sipos i taem blong Lafet blong Pasova, nao wan long yufala i no klin long fes blong mi from we i tajem dedbodi, bambae hem i save mekem lafet ya long nekis manis blong hem. No sipos wan long yufala i stap wokbaot blong go long narafala ples long taem ya, be i wantem yet blong mekem lafet ya, bambae hem tu i save mekem long nekis manis blong hem. Ol man olsem bambae oli save mekem long seken manis, long namba fotin dei blong hem, long sapa. Be oli mas kakae mit blong smol sipsip wetem ol bred* ya we i no gat is long hem, mo ol lif ya we i konkon,
<verse eid="NUM 9:10-11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 12.46; Jon 19.36</char></note>mo oli no mas livim ol hafkakae i stap kasem nekis moning, mo oli no mas brekem bun blong anamol ya we bambae oli kakae. Taem oli mekem lafet ya, be bambae oli mas folem olgeta rul blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13"/>Be sipos wan long yufala i stap klin nomo long fes blong mi, mo i no go samples, i stap wetem yufala nomo be i no mekem lafet ya, bambae mi mi no moa save kaontem hem, se i man blong mi<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">9.13: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tok ya we i talem se </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">“bambae mi mi no moa save kaontem hem, se i man blong mi,” </char><char style="ft" closed="false">i min se man ya bambae i ded.</char></note>, from we hem i no givim presen long mi blong mekem wosip long mi long prapa taem we mi mi putum. Man ya bambae i mas panis from sin blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14"/>“Mo sipos wan narafala man i stap wetem yufala, mo i wantem joen long yufala blong mekem lafet ya, bambae hem i mas folem olgeta rul blong hem. Sem tok nomo bambae i kavremap olgeta man sem mak, nating we i wan long yufala no i narafala man.”
<verse eid="NUM 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Klaod ya we i stap lidim olgeta
</para>
  <para style="r">(Eksodas 40.34-38)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15-16"/>Nao long dei ya we Moses olgeta oli putumap Haos Tapolen blong Hae God we Bokis ya we i Saen blong Promes* blong hem i stap long hem, klaod ya we i soemaot we Hae God i stap i kam kavremap Haos Tapolen ya. Mo long naet, olgeta oli luk klaod ya i laet olsem faea. Mo oltaem klaod ya i stap wetem olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 9:15-16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17"/>Nao oltaem, oli stap lukluk long klaod ya, mo taem hem i muv i go antap, olgeta oli tektekemaot ol haos tapolen blong olgeta, oli girap, oli biaen long hem. Mo taem klaod ya i kamdaon bakegen, i stap long wan ples, olgeta oli mekem ples blong olgeta bakegen long ples ya.
<verse eid="NUM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18"/>Oltaem, taem Hae God i talem long olgeta blong oli muv i go, olgeta oli tektekemaot ol haos tapolen blong olgeta, oli muv i go. Mo taem hem i talem long olgeta blong oli stap long wan ples, olgeta oli mekem ples blong olgeta bakegen long ples ya. Nao taem we klaod ya i no moa muv, i stap nomo antap long Haos Tapolen ya, be olgeta tu oli stap long sem ples ya, oli no save aot.
<verse eid="NUM 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19"/>Mo taem we klaod ya i stap longtaem antap long Haos ya, be olgeta oli obei long Hae God, oli stap longtaem long ples ya, oli no save muvaot.
<verse eid="NUM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20"/>Samtaem, klaod ya i save stap antap long Haos Tapolen ya blong tutri dei nomo, be oltaem, olgeta oli folem tok we Hae God i talem long olgeta, se oli stap no oli muvaot.
<verse eid="NUM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21"/>Samtaem klaod ya i stap wan naet nomo, nao taem we hem i muv, olgeta tu oli girap, oli muv i go. Evritaem, taem we klaod i go antap, be olgeta oli girap, oli go.
<verse eid="NUM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22"/>Sipos klaod ya i stap antap long Haos Tapolen ya tu dei, no wan manis, no wan yia no i bitim wan yia, be olgeta tu oli mas stap olsem, oli no save aot long ples ya. Be sipos klaod i muv i go antap, olgeta oli girap, oli muv i go.
<verse eid="NUM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23"/>Oltaem oli stap obei long Hae God blong tektekemaot ol haos tapolen blong olgeta, mo blong putumap olgeta bakegen. Olgeta oli folem tok ya we Hae God i talem long Moses fastaem, se bambae oli mas mekem olsem.
<verse eid="NUM 9:23"/><verse eid="NUM 9:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10"/>
  <para style="s">Tu trampet we oli wokem long silva
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2"/>“Bambae yu tekem silva we oli flatem finis long hama, yu wokem tu trampet long hem, nao oltaem yu mas yusum tufala trampet ya blong singaot olgeta man oli kam wanples. Mo sipos yufala i aot blong go long narafala ples, bambae yu yusum tufala blong givim saen long olgeta blong oli tektekemaot ol haos tapolen blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3"/>Nao sipos tu man i stap blu long tufala trampet ya, we tufala i stap pulum i go longfala, hemia i min se olgeta man oli mas kam wanples long yu, long doa blong Haos Tapolen blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4"/>Be sipos wan man nomo i stap blu long hem, hemia i min se ol lida blong olgeta laen* blong yufala bambae oli mas kam wanples long ples we yu yu stap long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 10:4"/><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5-6"/>Mo sipos tufala i stap blu sotsotwan nomo long tufala trampet ya, hemia i min se i taem blong yufala i muvaot blong go long narafala ples. Fastaem, taem we tufala i stap blu sotsotwan, hemia i min se i taem blong olgeta long kampani ya we i stap long saed i go long is bambae oli girap, oli muv blong go. Mo taem we tufala i stap blu sotsotwan bakegen, hemia i min se i taem blong olgeta long kampani ya we i stap long saed i go long saot oli girap, oli muv i go.
<verse eid="NUM 10:5-6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7"/>Be sipos tufala i stap blu we tufala i pulum i go longfala, hemia i min se bambae olgeta man oli mas kam wanples.
<verse eid="NUM 10:7"/><verse number="8-10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8-10"/>Tufala pikinini blong Hae Pris Eron, tufala i pris, mo tufala ya nao bambae i stap blu long tufala trampet ya.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Bakegen, taem we bambae yufala i stap long kantri blong yufala, nao ol enemi blong yufala oli kam blong spolem yufala, mo yufala i go blong mekem faet blong blokem olgeta, bambae yufala i mas blu long tufala trampet ya blong singaot ol man oli biaen long yufala. Mi mi Hae God, mi God blong yufala, mo long ol taem olsem, mi bambae mi tingbaot yufala, mi givhan long yufala, mi tekemaot yufala long han blong ol enemi blong yufala. Nao long taem we yufala i mekem lafet, mo yufala i harem gud, tu pris i mas blu long tufala trampet ya, nao mi, bambae mi stap tingbaot yufala. Long taem blong ol lafet we Loa i talem wetem ol Lafet* blong Niumun,* we yufala i kam mekem ol sakrefaes ya we sam i blong bonem i bon evriwan, mo sam i blong soemaot we yufala i stap fren gud wetem mi, bambae tufala i mas blu long tufala trampet ya. Rul ya, we yufala i mas blu tufala trampet ya blong mekem saen olsem, bambae yufala i mas holem olwe, gogo i no save finis.”
<verse eid="NUM 10:8-10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olgeta man oli tektekemaot ol haos tapolen blong olgeta, oli muv i go
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11"/>Nao long seken yia biaen long taem ya we olgeta oli aot long Ijip, long seken manis, long namba twanti dei blong hem, klaod ya we i stap antap long Haos Tapolen ya we oli stap kam long hem blong mit wetem Hae God i aot, i go antap.
<verse eid="NUM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12"/>Klaod ya i aot long ples ya, nao olgeta oli biaen long hem, oli aot long bigfala draeples ya Sinae, oli wokbaot i go smosmol gogo klaod ya i kamdaon bakegen long draeples ya Paran.
<verse eid="NUM 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13"/>Hemia i fastaem we olgeta oli folem plan ya we Hae God i talemaot long Moses, se bambae oli folem taem oli wokbaot blong muv i go long narafala ples.
<verse eid="NUM 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14"/>Mo biaen, taem oli muv blong go long narafala ples, oltaem oli stap folem plan ya. Olgeta we oli aninit long flaeg blong kampani ya blong Juda,* oli aot fastaem mo kampani ya i faswan blong muv i go. Nason, we papa blong hem Aminadab, hem i stap lidim ol laen* blong Juda, mo hem i lida blong kampani ya.
<verse eid="NUM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15"/>Mo Netanel, we papa blong hem Juara, hem i stap lidim ol laen blong Isakara,*
<verse eid="NUM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16"/>mo Eliab, we papa blong hem Helon, hem i stap lidim ol laen blong Sebulun.*
<verse eid="NUM 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="17-21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17-21"/>Nao ol laen blong Geson mo ol laen blong Merari oli tekemaot Haos Tapolen ya we olgeta oli stap go long hem blong mit wetem Hae God, mo oli karem, oli biaen long olgeta. Mo taem oli kamtru long ples we olgeta oli stap wokbaot blong go long hem, oli stanemap Haos Tapolen ya bakegen.
</para>
  <para style="p">Nekiswan, olgeta we oli aninit long flaeg blong kampani ya blong Ruben,* oli wokbaot i go, we olgeta oli stap long ol laen blong olgeta. Elijuru, we papa blong hem Sedeuru, hem i stap lidim ol laen blong Ruben, mo hem i lida blong kampani ya. Mo Selumiel, we papa blong hem Jurisadae, hem i stap lidim ol laen blong Simeon,* mo Eliasaf, we papa blong hem Dehuel, hem i stap lidim ol laen blong Gad.*
</para>
  <para style="p">Nao ol laen blong Kohat oli karem ol samting ya we oli tabu, oli blong Haos Tapolen ya, mo olgeta tu oli girap, oli go. Mo taem oli gotru long ples ya we olgeta oli stap wokbaot blong go long hem, oli save go insaed long Haos Tapolen we ol laen blong Geson wetem ol laen blong Merari oli stanemap finis, blong putum ol tabu samting ya oli stap gud insaed.
<verse eid="NUM 10:17-21"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22"/>Nekiswan, olgeta we oli aninit long flaeg blong kampani ya blong Efrem* oli wokbaot i go, we olgeta oli stap long ol laen blong olgeta. Elisama, we papa blong hem Amihud i stap lidim ol laen blong Efrem, mo hem i lida blong kampani ya.
<verse eid="NUM 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23"/>Mo Gameliel, we papa blong hem Pedajuru i stap lidim ol laen blong Manase,*
<verse eid="NUM 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24"/>mo Abidan we papa blong hem Gideoni i stap lidim ol laen blong Benjamin.*
<verse eid="NUM 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25"/>Mo laswan, olgeta we oli aninit long flaeg blong kampani ya blong Dan* oli wokbaot i go. Olgeta ya oli stap long ol laen blong olgeta, mo oli wokbaot biaen, blong gad long olgeta evriwan. Ahiesa we papa blong hem Amisadae i stap lidim ol laen blong Dan, mo hem i lida blong kampani ya.
<verse eid="NUM 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26"/>Mo Pagiel we papa blong hem Okran i stap lidim ol laen blong Asere,*
<verse eid="NUM 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27"/>mo Ahira we papa blong hem Enan i stap lidim ol laen blong Naftali.*
<verse eid="NUM 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28"/>Nao oltaem, taem we olgeta oli tektekemaot ol haos tapolen blong olgeta blong muv i go long narafala ples, hemia nao plan we oli stap folem blong wokbaot.
<verse eid="NUM 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moses i wantem blong Hobab i go wetem olgeta
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29"/>Nao Moses i talem long tawian blong hem Hobab we papa blong hem man Midian ya Jetro se, “Klosap i taem blong mifala i go long kantri ya we Hae God i talem se bambae i givim long mifala, mo hem i promes* se bambae i givim ol gudgudfala samting long mifala. I gud yu kam wetem mifala. Sipos yu kam, bambae mifala i save givim haf blong ol samting ya i go long yu.”
<verse eid="NUM 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30"/>Be Hobab i talem se, “No, bambae mi mi gobak long ples blong mi, mi go stap wetem ol famle blong mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31"/>Nao Moses i talem long hem se, “Plis yu no lego mifala. Yu nomo yu save ol ples long draeples ya we yumi save stap long hem, mo yu yu save lidim mifala.
<verse eid="NUM 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32"/>Sipos yu kam wetem mifala, olgeta gudgudfala samting ya we Hae God bambae i givim long mifala, bambae mifala i givim haf i go long yu.”
<verse eid="NUM 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olgeta man oli aot, oli go
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33"/>Nao taem olgeta oli aot long tabu hil ya Sinae, oli wokbaot tri dei, mo Bokis ya we i Saen blong Promes* blong Hae God, oltaem olgeta oli karem i go fastaem long olgeta, blong i soemaot ples we bambae oli stap long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34"/>Mo oltaem, taem oli stap wokbaot long dei blong muv i go long narafala ples, klaod ya blong Hae God i stap antap long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Sam 68.1</char></note>Nao oltaem, taem we olgeta we oli stap karem Bokis ya oli stat wokbaot blong go, Moses i stap prea se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“!Hae God!
</para>
  <para style="q1">!Plis yu girap,
</para>
  <para style="q2">yu ronemaot ol enemi blong yu
</para>
  <para style="q3">oli go wanwan!
</para>
  <para style="q1">!Olgeta we oli no laekem yu,
</para>
  <para style="q2">oli stap agens long yu,
</para>
  <para style="q3">plis yu mekem olgeta oli ronwe!”
<verse eid="NUM 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36"/>Mo taem we Bokis ya i gotru long narafala ples, hem i stap prea bakegen se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“!Hae God!
</para>
  <para style="q1">Mifala i laen* blong Isrel,*
</para>
  <para style="q2">mo mifala i plante we plante.
</para>
  <para style="q1">!Plis yu kambak,
</para>
  <para style="q2">yu kam stap wetem mifala!”
<verse eid="NUM 10:36"/><verse eid="NUM 10:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Hae God i sanem faea i kam, from we ol man oli girap, oli agens long hem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1"/>Nao ol man oli stap tok agens long Hae God, from we oli trabol tumas. Mo taem hem i harem olgeta, hem i kros, nao i sanem faea i kam long medel blong olgeta, mo faea ya i stat bonem haf blong ples ya we oli stap long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2"/>Nao olgeta oli krae i go long Moses, blong hem i givhan long olgeta, mo hem i prea long Hae God, nao faea ya i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3"/>Nao oli putum nem blong ples ya se Tabera<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">11.3: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tabera</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Long lanwis ya Hibru, nem ya klosap i olsem wan narafala tok we i min se “I stap bon”.</char></note>, from we long ples ya nao, faea blong Hae God i stap bon long medel blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moses i jusumaot seventi lida
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4"/>Nao long taem ya, i gat ol narafala man oli stap wetem ol laen* blong Isrel,* mo ol man ya oli wantem tumas blong kakae mit. Mo i no longtaem, ol laen ya blong Isrel tu oli stap harem nogud bakegen, oli stat tok agens long Hae God. Olgeta oli talem se, “!Sipos yumi gat mit i gud!
<verse eid="NUM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5"/>!Long Ijip, yes! Yumi stap kakae fis olsem we yumi wantem, we yumi no pem nating. Oltaem yumi stap kakae kukamba mo melen, mo salad, mo anian, mo lae we yumi no sot.
<verse eid="NUM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6"/>!Yu luk! !Naoia yumi no moa strong nao! I no gat narafala kakae nating. !Evri dei nomo yumi stap kakae mana* ya! !Yumi les long hem finis!”
<verse eid="NUM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 16.31</char></note>Samting ya mana i smol samting nomo, i olsem sid blong gras ya korianda,* mo kala blong hem i waet we i yala lelebet.
<verse eid="NUM 11:7"/><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8-9"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.8-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 16.13-15</char></note>Hem i stap folfoldaon wetem wota blong naet long ples ya we olgeta oli stap long hem. Nao evri dei, long moning, ol man oli go pikimap, mo oli stap granem i kam olsem flaoa. Nao oli kukum, mo oli mekem ol smol bred* long hem we i flat. Mo taem oli kakae, oli harem olsem bred we oli kukum long olifoel.*
<verse eid="NUM 11:8-9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10"/>Nao Moses i luk we ol man oli stap hivap long doa blong ol haos tapolen blong olgeta, mo i harem we oli stap krae from we oli harem nogud. Nao Hae God i kros tumas long olgeta, mo Moses tu i harem nogud from olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11"/>nao hem i tok long Hae God, i talem se, “!Hae God. Yu yu mekem i nogud tumas long mi! !Mi mi luk se yu no moa laekem mi nao! ?From wanem yu putum mi mi stap lukaot long ol man ya?
<verse eid="NUM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12"/>!Mi mi no papa blong olgeta! !Mi mi no bonem olgeta! ?From wanem yu mekem mi mi kam olsem mama blong olgeta, blong karem olgeta long han blong mi, olsem we oli smol pikinini blong mi? Mi mi no save karem olgeta long fasin ya gogo oli kasem kantri ya we yu promes* long ol bubu blong mifala bifo, se bambae yu givim long mifala.
<verse eid="NUM 11:12"/><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13-14"/>Olgeta oli stap krae long mi blong mi givim mit long olgeta, be oli plante tumas, mo mi mi wan nomo. Mi mi no save lukaot long olgeta. ?Weples bambae mi mi save tekem mit we i naf blong olgeta?
<verse eid="NUM 11:13-14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15"/>Sipos yu wantem mekem mi olsem, i moa gud yu kilim mi mi ded, nao bambae mi no moa save harem nogud bakegen long ol strong samting ya we yu stap mekem long mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16"/>Nao Hae God i talem long hem se, “Yu go singaot seventi man we oli lida blong yufala, we ol man oli stap tinghevi long olgeta, yu tekem olgeta oli kam wanples, blong oli kam stanap wetem yu raon long Haos Tapolen blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17"/>Nao bambae mi mi kamdaon long ples ya, mi toktok long yu, mo Spirit blong mi we i stap long yu, bambae mi putum i stap tu long olgeta.<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">11.17: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Narafala rod blong tanem tok long fas haf blong vas ya i olsem. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nao bambae mi mi kamdaon long ples ya, mi toktok long yu, mo <char style="bd" closed="true">paoa</char> </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">blong mi we i stap long yu, bambae mi putum i stap tu long olgeta.</char></note> Nao bambae olgeta oli save givhan long yu blong lukaot long ol man ya, blong wok ya bambae i no moa stap long yu, yu wan.
<verse eid="NUM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18"/>Be naoia, yu mas go talemaot long olgeta man, se oli mas mekem olgeta oli klin long fes blong mi, oli rere, from we tumora bambae oli kakae mit. Mi mi harem ol toktok ya we oli stap talem, we oli stap krae from mit, mo oli talem se bifo, taem oli stap long Ijip, i moa gud i winim ples ya. Oraet, bambae mi givim mit long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19"/>Mo mit ya bambae oli no kakae long wan dei nomo, no tu dei, no faef dei, no ten dei, no twanti dei.
<verse eid="NUM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20"/>Bambae oli mas kakae evri dei gogo kasem wan ful manis. Mo nating we maot blong olgeta bambae i kam nogud long hem, mo oli harem we oli taed long hem, we oli taedgud long hem, be bambae oli mas kakae, gogo oli finisim. Fasin ya bambae i kasem olgeta from we mi mi stap long medel blong olgeta, be oli tanem baksaed long mi, mo oli stap tok agens long mi se sipos oli stap nomo long Ijip, bambae i moa gud.”
<verse eid="NUM 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21"/>Be hem i tok long Hae God, i talem se, “!Yu luk! Mi mi stap lidim sikis handred taosen man we mifala i stap wokbaot long leg nomo, mo yu yu talem se bambae yu givim mit long mifala we i stret long wan manis.
<verse eid="NUM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22"/>?Olsem wanem? ?Sipos mifala i kilim evri buluk wetem ol sipsip blong mifala, yu ting se bambae i naf blong olgeta ya oli kakae, oli fulap? !Sipos mifala i go pulum olgeta fis long solwota, be bambae i no naf long olgeta ya!”
<verse eid="NUM 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23"/>Be Hae God i talem se, “?Weswe? ?Yu ting se mi mi no naf blong mekem samting ya? !Mbae yu luk!”
<verse eid="NUM 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24"/>Nao Moses i go afsaed, i go talemaot ol samting ya long ol man. Mo biaen, hem i tekem seventi lida oli kam wanples, mo i putum olgeta oli stap stanap raon long Haos Tapolen ya.
<verse eid="NUM 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25"/>Nao Hae God i kamdaon long klaod ya we i stap lidim olgeta, mo i toktok wetem Moses. Hem i tekem Spirit blong hem we i bin givim long Moses bifo, i putum long ol lida ya tu, mo taem Spirit blong hem i kam long olgeta, olgeta oli toktok olsem ol profet, be oli no mekem longtaem.<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">11.25: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Narafala rod blong tanem tok long las haf blong vas ya i olsem. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hem i tekem <char style="bd" closed="true">paoa</char> </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">blong hem we i bin givim long Moses bifo, i putum long ol lida ya tu, mo taem <char style="bd" closed="true">paoa</char> </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">blong hem kam long olgeta, olgeta oli toktok olsem ol profet, be oli no mekem longtaem.</char></note>
<verse eid="NUM 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26"/>Nao tu long ol seventi lida ya, we nem blong tufala Eldad mo Medad, tufala i stap nomo long haos blong tufala, tufala i no kam long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God blong mit wetem hem. Be Spirit blong Hae God i kam long tufala tu long haos tapolen blong tufala, mo tufala tu i toktok olsem ol profet.<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">11.26: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Narafala rod blong tanem tok long las haf blong vas ya i olsem. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Be <char style="bd" closed="true">paoa</char> </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">blong Hae God i kam long tufala tu long haos tapolen blong tufala, mo tufala tu i toktok olsem ol profet.</char></note>
<verse eid="NUM 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27"/>Nao wan yang man i resis i kam long Moses, i talemaot samting ya we tufala i stap mekem.
<verse eid="NUM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28"/>Nao Josua, we papa blong hem Nun, we i bin stap givhan long Moses i stat taem we i yang, hem i tok long hem, i talem se, “!Masta, yu go blokem tufala ya!”
<verse eid="NUM 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29"/>Be hem i talem se, “?Olsem wanem? ?Yu wantem blokem olgeta ya from we yu wantem se mi nomo mi nambawan? !Be mi mi wantem blong Hae God bambae i givim Spirit blong hem long olgeta man, i mekem olgeta evriwan oli toktok olsem ol profet!<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">11.29: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Narafala rod blong tanem tok long las haf blong vas ya i olsem. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">!Be mi mi wantem blong Hae God bambae i givim <char style="bd" closed="true">paoa ya</char> </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">blong hem long olgeta man, i mekem olgeta evriwan oli toktok olsem ol profet!</char></note>”
<verse eid="NUM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30"/>Nao hem wetem ol lida ya oli gobak long ol haos tapolen blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hae God i sanem ol pijin i kam
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31"/>Nao Hae God i sanem wan win i kam we i tekem ol pijin ya kwel* long solwota, i karem olgeta i kam we oli stap flae daon we daon olgeta, samwe long wan meta nomo blong go kasem long graon. Oli kam folfoldaon olbaot long ples ya we ol man ya oli stap long hem, mo long ol ples raonabaot long hem, i go kasem plante kilometa long evri saed blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32"/>Nao long wan fuldei, mo long wan fulnaet, mo long wan fuldei bakegen, olgeta man oli stap holem ol pijin ya. Mo i no gat wan long olgeta we i tekem smol nomo, olgeta man wanwan oli kasem wan taosen kilo pijin no antap long hem, nao oli putum olgeta long san olbaot long ol ples ya blong oli sandrae long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33"/>Be taem we oli gat plante mit yet blong oli kakae, Hae God i kros long olgeta, nao i sanem wan rabis sik i kam long olgeta we plante long olgeta oli ded from.
<verse eid="NUM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34"/>Nao ples ya, oli putum nem blong hem, se Kibrot Hatahava we i min se “Beregraon blong ol man we oli wantem mit tumas”, from we long ples ya nao oli berem ol man we oli wantem mit tumas.
<verse eid="NUM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35"/>Nao oli aot long ples ya oli go long Hajerot, oli mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya.
<verse eid="NUM 11:35"/><verse eid="NUM 11:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Hae God i panisim Meriam
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1"/>Nao long ples ya, Hae Pris Eron mo Meriam, tufala i stap tok agens long Moses, brata blong tufala, from we wan woman blong hem i woman Itiopia.<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">12.1: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Narafala rod blong tanem tok blong vas ya i olsem. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nao long ples ya, Hae Pris Eron mo Meriam, tufala i stap tok agens long Moses, brata blong tufala, from we woman blong hem i wan woman Kus.</char></note>
<verse eid="NUM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2"/>Tufala i stap talem se, “Hae God i no stap toktok wetem Moses nomo. Hem i stap toktok wetem mitufala tu.” Mo Hae God i harem tok ya we tufala i stap talem.
<verse eid="NUM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3"/>Moses, hem i wan man we tingting blong hem i stap daon moa, i no gat wan narafala man long wol we tingting blong hem i stap daon olsem hem.
<verse eid="NUM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4"/>Nao wantaem nomo, Hae God i talem long trifala se, “Yutrifala i kam long Haos Tapolen blong mi.” Nao trifala i go,
<verse eid="NUM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5"/>mo Hae God i kamdaon long wan bigfala klaod, i kam stanap long doa blong Haos Tapolen ya, mo i singaot hae pris ya wetem Meriam, tufala i kam stanap long fes blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6"/>Nao hem i talem se, “!Yutufala i harem tok blong mi! Sipos i gat wan man we i profet nomo i stap wetem yufala, bambae mi mi stap kamtru long hem long ol vison* blong hem, mo bambae mi stap toktok long hem long ol drim blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Hib 3.2</char></note>Be Moses ya, hem i hae moa long profet. Hem i spesel man blong wok blong mi, mo mi stap toktok wetem hem long narafala rod olgeta. Yufala i laen* blong Isrel,* yufala i man blong mi, mo mi mi putum hem blong i lukaot long yufala evriwan.<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">12.7: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Narafala rod blong tanem tok long las haf blong vas ya i olsem. <char style="bd" closed="true">Tingting blong hem i stap strong moa long mi, i winim</char> </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">yufala evriwan.</char></note>
<verse eid="NUM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8"/>Taswe mi stap kamtru stret long fes blong hem, mo taem mi stap toktok wetem hem, mi no yusum ol tok haed, mi toktok wetem hem long ol tok we i klia we i klia. Hem i luk mi finis, stret long ae blong hem. !Man ya, hem i spesel man blong wok blong mi! ?Weswe yutufala i no fraet blong tok agens long hem?”
<verse eid="NUM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9"/>Nao Hae God i kros tumas long tufala, mo taem hem i gowe,
<verse eid="NUM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10"/>klaod ya tu i gowe long Haos Tapolen ya, mo kwiktaem nomo wan rabis sik i kasem skin blong Meriam we i finisimgud bodi blong hem, mo i mekem skin blong hem i waet we i waet. Nao taem hae pris i luk samting ya,
<verse eid="NUM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11"/>hem i kam talem long Moses se, “Masta, mitufala i stap toktok krangke ya, mitufala i stap mekem i nogud long yu, be plis, yu no letem panis blong sin ya i mekem mitufala i harem nogud olsem.
<verse eid="NUM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12"/>Yu no letem sista blong yumitufala i kam olsem pikinini we i bon we i ded finis, we sik i spolem bodi blong hem finis.”
<verse eid="NUM 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13"/>Nao Moses i krae long Hae God, i talem se, “!God, plis yu tekemaot sik ya long hem!”
<verse eid="NUM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 5.2,3</char></note>Nao Hae God i talem se, “Kastom blong yufala, sipos papa i spet long fes blong pikinini blong hem, be pikinini ya bambae i sem bigwan, mo bambae i mas aot long ples blong yufala, i mas go stap afsaed seven dei. Hemia i panis blong hem from we i mekem papa blong hem olsem. Oraet, yu mas putumaot sista ya blong yu i gowe long yufala wan ful wik, nao biaen, yufala i save tekem hem i kam stap wetem yufala bakegen.”
<verse eid="NUM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15"/>Nao oli putumaot hem i gowe long ples blong olgeta, i go stap afsaed seven dei, mo oli no muvaot long ples ya go kasem we oli tekem hem i kam stap wetem olgeta bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16"/>Nao biaen, oli muvaot long ples ya Hajerot, oli go mekem ples blong olgeta long draeples ya Paran.
<verse eid="NUM 12:16"/><verse eid="NUM 12:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ol man oli go long Kenan blong lukluksave ples
</para>
  <para style="r">(Dutronome 1.19-33)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1-3"/>Nao long taem ya we olgeta oli stap long draeples ya Paran, Hae God i talem long Moses se, “Yu mas jusumaot twelef lida wanwan long ol twelef laen* blong yufala, mo yu mas sanem olgeta oli go long kantri ya Kenan,* blong oli go lukluksave ples ya we mi mi promes* finis blong givim long yufala.” Nao hem i mekem olsem we Hae God i talem, i jusumaot twelef lida blong olgeta, mo i sanem olgeta oli go blong lukluksave kantri ya.
<verse eid="NUM 13:1-3"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4"/>Ol lida ya we hem i sanemaot olgeta oli go, nem blong olgeta i olsem.
</para>
  <para style="p">Long laen blong Ruben,* i gat Samua, we papa blong hem Sakuru.
<verse eid="NUM 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5"/>Mo long laen blong Simeon,* i gat Safat, we papa blong hem Hori.
<verse eid="NUM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6"/>Mo long laen blong Juda,* i gat Keleb, we papa blong hem Jefune.
<verse eid="NUM 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7"/>Mo long laen blong Isakara,* i gat Igal, we papa blong hem Josef.
<verse eid="NUM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8"/>Mo long laen blong Efrem,* i gat Hosea, we papa blong hem Nun.
<verse eid="NUM 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9"/>Mo long laen blong Benjamin,* i gat Palti, we papa blong hem Rafu.
<verse eid="NUM 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10"/>Mo long laen blong Sebulun,* i gat Gadiel, we papa blong hem Sodi.
<verse eid="NUM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11"/>Mo laen blong Manase,* olgeta oli kamaot biaen long Josef, mo long laen ya i gat Gadi, we papa blong hem Susi.
<verse eid="NUM 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12"/>Mo long laen blong Dan,* i gat Amiel, we papa blong hem Gemali.
<verse eid="NUM 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13"/>Mo long laen blong Asere,* i gat Seturu, we papa blong hem Mikael.
<verse eid="NUM 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14"/>Mo long laen blong Naftali,* i gat Nabi, we papa blong hem Vofsi.
<verse eid="NUM 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15"/>Mo long laen blong Gad,* i gat Gehuel, we papa blong hem Maki.
<verse eid="NUM 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16"/>Hemia nao ol man we hem i sanem olgeta i go blong oli lukluksave kantri ya Kenan. Mo long taem ya, hem i jenisim nem blong Hosea ya we papa blong hem Nun, i kam Josua.
<verse eid="NUM 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17"/>Mo taem hem i sanem olgeta i go, hem i talem long olgeta se, “Taem yufala i aot long ples ya, bambae yufala i go insaed long kantri ya Kenan wantaem nomo, nao yufala i mas wokbaot i go olwe long not, go kasem ol ples blong hil.
<verse eid="NUM 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18"/>Yufala i mas traem blong faenemaot se ples ya i olsem wanem, mo hamas man oli stap long hem. Mo bambae yufala i mas traem blong faenemaot se ol man ya oli strong no oli no strong,
<verse eid="NUM 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19"/>mo ples ya i gud no i nogud, mo ol vilej blong olgeta oli gat stonwol i goraon long olgeta no nogat.
<verse eid="NUM 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20"/>Bambae yufala i mas faenemaot tu se graon i gud blong planem kakae no i nogud, mo i gat plante tri i stap no nogat. Mo taem yufala i kambak, bambae yufala i mas karem sam frut blong ples ya i kam.” Hem i talem olsem, from we long taem ya, ol grep* oli stat raep.
<verse eid="NUM 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21"/>Nao ol lida ya oli aot, oli wokbaot i go long not blong lukluksave ol samting long kantri ya. Oli stat long draeples ya long Jin, we long saed blong hem long saot, mo oli wokbaot go kasem ples ya Rehob, klosap long ples ya Hamat we i stap long not olgeta, we rod i pastru long ol hil.
<verse eid="NUM 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22"/>Fastaem oli go lukluk haf blong kantri ya saed i kam, long saot, nao oli go long taon ya Hebron, we i ples blong ol laen blong Ahiman, mo ol laen blong Sesae, mo ol laen blong Talmae. Ol man Hebron ya oli laen blong Anak,* we i wan lariken man bifo. Taon ya Hebron i olfala we i olfala. Ples ya Joan long Ijip i wan olfala ples, be Hebron i olfala moa long hem seven yia.
<verse eid="NUM 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23"/>Nao ol lida ya oli kam long wan bigfala levelples long medel blong ol hil, mo long ples ya, oli katem wan han blong grep, we i gat wan bigfala bandel grep i stap long hem. Bandel grep ya i hevi tumas, nao tufala man i karem long wan wud. Mo oli tekem sam grenadin* wetem sam fig* tu, oli karem i kam.
<verse eid="NUM 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24"/>Nao bigfala levelples ya, biaen oli putum nem blong hem se Eskol, we i min se “Bandel”, from bigfala bandel grep ya we olgeta ya oli katemaot long ples ya.
<verse eid="NUM 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25"/>Long taem ya, olgeta oli stap foti dei long kantri ya, mo oli stap wokbaot olbaot blong savegud ol ples, nao oli kambak bakegen
<verse eid="NUM 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26"/>long ples ya Kades, long draeples ya Paran. Hemia ples ya we Moses wetem Hae Pris Eron mo olgeta man oli stap long hem. Nao olgeta oli talemaot olgeta samting we oli luk, mo oli soemaot ol frut ya tu we oli tekem longwe, oli karem i kam.
<verse eid="NUM 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27"/>Mo oli talem long Moses se, “Mifala i faenemaot we kantri ya, kakae blong hem i gud tumas. !Yu luk! Hemia samfala frut we mifala i tekem longwe, mifala i karem i kam.
<verse eid="NUM 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28"/>Be ol man we oli stap long hem oli strong tumas, mo ol taon blong olgeta oli bigbigwan, mo oli gat ol bigbigfala stonwol i goraon gud long olgeta. Mo antap long samting ya, mifala i luk ol man we oli laen blong ol lariken man ya bifo oli stap.
<verse eid="NUM 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29"/>Mo mifala i luk we ol laen blong Amalek oli stap long hem saed i kam, long saot, mo ol laen blong Het, wetem ol laen blong Jebus mo ol laen blong Amoro* oli stap long ples blong hil, mo ol laen blong Kenan oli stap long saed blong Mediterenian Si mo long saed blong Jodan Reva.”
<verse eid="NUM 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30"/>Nao ol man ya we oli stap hivap raon long Moses oli fraet, mo oli stap toktok tumas, be Keleb i tok blong kwaetem olgeta, i talem se, “I moa gud yumi go kilim olgeta ya naoia, yumi holem ples ya. !Yumi strong ya! !Yumi naf blong winim olgeta!”
<verse eid="NUM 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31"/>Be olgeta we oli bin go wetem hem oli talem se, “!Nogat! !Yumi no strong ya! !Yumi no naf blong go kilim olgeta ya! !Ol man ya oli strong moa winim yumi!”
<verse eid="NUM 13:31"/><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32-33"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.32-33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jen 6.4</char></note>Nao oli girap, oli giaman, oli talem se, “!Kantri ya, graon blong hem i nogud ya! !Bambae i flatem yumi evriwan ya! Kakae blong hem i no naf blong fidim olgeta ya we oli stap long hem. Mo ol man ya we mifala i luk olgeta longwe, olgeta evriwan oli longlongfala, mo mifala i luk ol lariken man ya tu longwe, we oli laen blong Anak. Taem we mifala i luk olgeta, mifala ya i smol tumas, mifala i olsem anis nomo, mo olgeta tu oli stap luk mifala olsem.” Mo toktok ya i goraon, i kasem olgeta man.
<verse eid="NUM 13:32-33"/><verse eid="NUM 13:32-33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ol man oli toktok from we oli harem nogud
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1"/>Nao long naet ya, olgeta man oli stap krae bigwan, gogo kasem delaet, from we oli harem nogud, oli fraet.
<verse eid="NUM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2"/>Nao oli stap tok agens long Moses mo Hae Pris Eron, oli talem se, “!Sipos mifala i ded nomo long Ijip no long draeples ya, bambae i moa gud!
<verse eid="NUM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3"/>?Blong wanem Hae God i wantem tekem yumi i go long kantri ya? Sipos yumi go mekem faet long olgeta ya longwe, bambae oli kilim yumi evriwan i ded, mo bambae oli tekem ol woman blong yumi wetem ol pikinini blong yumi tu. I moa gud yumi gobak long Ijip.”
<verse eid="NUM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4"/>Nao oli stap taltalem long olgeta se, “!Yumi mas jusum wan narafala lida blong yumi! !Yumi mas gobak long Ijip!”
<verse eid="NUM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5"/>Nao long fes blong olgeta, Moses mo hae pris, tufala i nildaon, tufala i bodaon we fes blong tufala i godaon kasem graon, nao tufala i prea, from we tufala i save se Hae God bambae i jajem olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6"/>Nao Josua wetem Keleb, we olgeta i bin go lukluksave ples ya, tufala i harem nogud tumas, tufala i stap terem* klos blong tufala from.
<verse eid="NUM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7"/>Mo tufala i talem long ol man ya se, “!Olgeta! !Kantri ya we mifala i go luk, hem i gud we i gud!
<verse eid="NUM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8"/>Sipos Hae God i glad long yumi, bambae hem i tekem yumi i go long ples ya, mo bambae hem i givim graon ya long yumi we kakae blong hem i nambawan.
<verse eid="NUM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Hib 3.16</char></note>!Yufala i no mas girap agens long hem! !Yufala i no fraet long olgeta ya longwe! !Olgeta oli no naf long yumi ya! !Bambae yumi flatem olgeta ya! Hae God i stap wetem yumi, mo hem i winim finis ol god ya blong olgeta we oli stap givhan long olgeta. !From samting ya, yumi no mas fraet!”
<verse eid="NUM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10"/>Be ol man ya oli girap, oli wantem stonem tufala i ded, be wantaem nomo oli luk wan bigfala laet we i soemaot we Hae God i stap, i stap saen i kamaot antap long Haos Tapolen blong hem, i saen i kam.
<verse eid="NUM 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moses i prea from olgeta
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se, “Moses. ?Olgeta ya bambae oli stap tanem baksaed long mi gogo kasem wetaem? !Yu luk! Mi mi mekem plante merikel finis long fes blong olgeta, be no yet. ?Wetaem bambae oli tanem tingting blong olgeta blong trastem mi?
<verse eid="NUM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12"/>!Bambae mi sanem wan rabis sik i kam blong kilim olgeta i ded! Be yu no harem nogud. Bambae mi mekem we yu yu kam stamba blong wan narafala laen,* we ol man blong hem bambae oli plante moa mo oli gat paoa moa i winim olgeta ya.”
<verse eid="NUM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 32.11-14</char></note>Be hem i talem long Hae God se, “?No, be mifala evriwan i man blong yu, mo sipos ol man Ijip oli harem samting ya, bambae i olsem wanem nao? Olgeta oli savegud we yu yu tekemaot mifala long kantri blong olgeta, mo yu tekem mifala i kam long ples ya long paoa blong yu nomo. Mo sipos oli harem we yu spolem olgeta olsem,
<verse eid="NUM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14"/>bambae oli mas talemaot samting ya long ol man ya we oli stap long kantri ya Kenan.* Olgeta long Kenan oli harem finis we yu yu stap wetem mifala, mo we yu stap soemaot samting ya i klia long fes blong olgeta man, from we klaod blong yu i stap antap long mifala. Oli harem tu we long dei, yu stap go fastaem long mifala long bigfala klaod ya we i stanap stret, mo long naet, yu stap lidim mifala long bigfala faea ya we i stanap stret.
<verse eid="NUM 14:14"/><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15-16"/>Be sipos yu kilim olgeta i ded long draeples ya, ol man ya long Kenan we oli harem nius blong ol bigbigfala wok ya blong yu finis, bambae oli talem se yu kilim olgeta from we yu kanduit blong tekem olgeta i go long kantri ya we yu promes* blong givim long mifala.
<verse eid="NUM 14:15-16"/><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17-18"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.17-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 20.5,6; 34.6,7; Dut 5.9,10; 7.9,10</char></note>From samting ya, naoia mi mi prea long yu blong yu soemaot paoa blong yu, yu tekem mifala i go long kantri ya. Bifo, yu yu mekem promes long mifala, yu talem se, ‘Mi mi Hae God, mo fasin blong mi, mi no save kros kwik. Oltaem mi mi stap lavem man, mo oltaem mi stap holem promes blong mi. Mi stap fogivim ol man blong mi, mo mi stap tekemaot ol rabis fasin blong olgeta, mo ol sin blong olgeta. Be olgeta we oli stap mekem nogud, mi mi stap panisim olgeta, wetem ol pikinini blong olgeta, mo ol smol bubu blong olgeta, go kasem ol seken smol bubu blong olgeta, mo ol namba tri smol bubu blong olgeta.’ Hae God, plis yu holem promes ya blong yu.
<verse eid="NUM 14:17-18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19"/>Fasin blong yu, oltaem yu stap lavem man, nao from samting ya, mi mi askem long yu blong yu fogivim ol man ya blong yu, yu tekemaot ol sin blong olgeta bakegen, olsem we yu stap fogivim mifala oltaem, yu stap tekemaot ol sin blong mifala, i stat long taem ya we mifala i aot long Ijip, i kam kasem tede.”
<verse eid="NUM 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20"/>Nao Hae God i talem se, “Bambae mi mi fogivim olgeta, mi tekemaot ol sin blong olgeta, olsem we yu yu askem.
<verse eid="NUM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Hib 3.18</char></note>Be mi mi Hae God, mi laef, mi stap we mi stap, mo paoa blong mi i fulap long olgeta ples long wol. Mo naoia, mi mi promes long nem blong mi,
<verse eid="NUM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22"/>se i no gat wan long olgeta ya we bambae i go insaed long kantri ya Kenan. Oli luk mi finis long bigfala laet ya we i saen we i saen, we i soemaot we mi mi stap, mo oli luk ol merikel ya we mi mi mekem long Ijip mo long draeples. Be olgeta oli stap traem mi plante taem, we man i no save kaontem, mo naoia oli no wantem obei long mi.
<verse eid="NUM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23"/>Olgeta ya bambae oli no save go kasem kantri ya samtaem, we mi mi promes long ol bubu blong yufala bifo, se bambae mi givim long yufala. Bambae i no gat wan long olgeta ya we oli tanem baksaed long mi we i save go kasem kantri ya.
<verse eid="NUM 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jos 14.9-12</char></note>Be man blong wok blong mi Keleb, tingting blong hem i narafala. Oltaem, tingting blong hem i stap strong long mi, mo from samting ya, bambae mi mi tekem hem i go long kantri ya we hem i bin go wokbaot long hem blong lukluksave ples. Mo olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long hem bambae oli holem kantri ya
<verse eid="NUM 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25"/>we naoia ol laen blong Amalek mo ol laen blong Kenan oli stap olbaot long ol nambawan graon blong hem. Kantri ya bambae i blong olgeta. Be tumora, bambae yufala i tanemraon, yufala i gobak bakegen long draeples ya long saot, long rod ya we i pastru long draeples blong go long Akaba Bei.”
<verse eid="NUM 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hae God i panisim olgeta from we oli stap tok agens long hem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses mo Hae Pris Eron se,
<verse eid="NUM 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27"/>“?Ol man nogud ya bambae oli stap tok agens long mi gogo kasem wetaem? Mi mi harem ol toktok ya blong olgeta, we oltaem oli stap tok agens long mi. Naoia i naf.
<verse eid="NUM 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28"/>Yutufala i go talemaot long olgeta we mi mi Hae God, mi laef, mi stap we mi stap, mo long nem blong mi, mi mekem wan strong promes* long olgeta se bambae mi mekem samting ya we olgeta oli askem.
<verse eid="NUM 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Hib 3.17</char></note>Bambae olgeta oli ded olbaot long draeples ya, mo bodi blong olgeta bambae oli stap olbaot long hem. Olgeta oli girap, oli tok agens long mi, mo from samting ya, olgeta evriwan we i gat twanti yia i go antap bambae oli no save go long kantri ya.
<verse eid="NUM 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30"/>Mi mi promes finis se bambae olgeta evriwan oli go stap long ples ya, be bambae i no moa olsem. Keleb mo Josua, tufala nomo bambae i go.
<verse eid="NUM 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31"/>Olgeta oli fraet, mo oli talem se ol man blong kantri ya bambae oli tekemaot ol pikinini blong olgeta, be mi bambae mi tekem ol pikinini ya blong olgeta oli go long kantri ya we olgeta oli no wantem, blong ples ya i kam hom blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32"/>Be olgeta ya bambae oli ded olbaot long draeples ya nomo.
<verse eid="NUM 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Wok 7.36</char></note>Mo from we tingting blong olgeta i no stap strong long mi, ol pikinini ya blong olgeta bambae oli stap wokbaot olbaot long draeples ya foti yia. Olgeta ya we oli girap agens long mi bambae oli stap harem nogud gogo kasem we laswan blong olgeta i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34"/>Bambae oli harem nogud from ol sin blong olgeta foti yia, we wan yia i makem wan dei blong ol foti dei ya we ol man ya blong yufala oli stap longwe blong lukluksave kantri ya. !Long ol foti yia ya, bambae olgeta oli luksave se taem mi mi agens long olgeta, i nogud we i nogud!
<verse eid="NUM 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35"/>Olgeta we oli kam wanples blong tok agens long mi oli man nogud, mo mi mi mekem wan strong promes long olgeta, se bambae olgeta evriwan oli ded long draeples ya. Mi mi Hae God mo hemia tok blong mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36-37"/>Nao ol man ya we Moses i sanem olgeta i go lukluksave kantri ya, Hae God i panisim olgeta long wan rabis sik we oli ded long hem, from we taem oli kambak, oli talemaot ol giaman toktok we i mekem olgeta man oli harem nogud, oli stap tok agens long Hae God from.
<verse eid="NUM 14:36-37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38"/>Long olgeta twelef ya we oli bin go lukluksave kantri ya, Josua mo Keleb, tufala ya nomo, tufala i no ded.
<verse eid="NUM 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olgeta oli girap, oli traem go long kantri ya Kenan
</para>
  <para style="r">(Dutronome 1.41-46)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39"/>Nao taem Moses i talemaot tok ya blong Hae God long ol man ya, olgeta oli harem nogud tumas, nao oli krae we oli krae.
<verse eid="NUM 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40"/>Nao long nekis dei, long eli moning, oli girap, oli wantem go insaed long kantri ya Kenan,* long saed ya we i ples blong hil. Oli talem se, “Mifala i save we mifala i mekem i nogud, be hemia i finis. Naoia mifala i rere blong go long ples ya we Hae God i talemaot se bambae i blong yumi.”
<verse eid="NUM 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41"/>Be Moses i talem long olgeta se, “!Be naoia yufala i brekem tok blong Hae God bakegen! ?From wanem yufala i no save obei long hem? !Bambae yufala i no save win ya!
<verse eid="NUM 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42"/>!Yufala i no go! !Hae God bambae i no stap wetem yufala! Bambae ol enemi ya oli winim yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 14:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43"/>Sipos yufala i go blong fesem ol laen* blong Amalek mo ol laen blong Kenan, blong mekem faet long olgeta, bambae yufala i ded nomo long faet. Hae God bambae i no save stap wetem yufala, from we yufala i no wantem folem tok blong hem.”
<verse eid="NUM 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44"/>Be olgeta oli no fraet, oli girap, oli go, nating we Bokis ya we i Saen blong Promes* blong Hae God i no go wetem olgeta mo Moses tu i no go, i stap wetem Bokis ya daon long ples blong olgeta. Olgeta nomo oli go insaed long kantri ya, oli go antap long ples blong hil,
<verse eid="NUM 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45"/>nao ol laen blong Amalek wetem ol laen blong Kenan we oli stap olbaot long ples ya, olgeta oli kam mekem faet long olgeta, oli winim olgeta, mo oli ronem olgeta kam kasem ples ya Homa.
<verse eid="NUM 14:45"/><verse eid="NUM 14:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Ol rul blong sakrefaes
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1-2"/>Nao Hae God i givim ol rul long Moses blong ol laen* blong Isrel* bambae oli folem taem oli go stap long kantri ya we hem i promes* finis blong givim long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 15:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3"/>Hem i talem se, “Mi mi Hae God, mo tok blong mi i olsem. Sipos yufala i wantem kilim wan anamol blong bonem blong givim i kam long mi, bambae yufala i save tekem wan bul, no wan man sipsip, no wan woman sipsip, no wan nani. Long anamol ya bambae yufala i save mekem sakrefaes ya we i blong bonem i bon evriwan blong mekem wosip long mi, no sakrefaes ya we i blong fulumap promes we yufala i mekem long mi, no sakrefaes ya we yufala i bonem blong givim i kam long mi long gladhat blong yufala nomo, no ol sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem oltaem long ol lafet blong yufala blong mekem wosip long mi. Mo sipos yufala i bonem anamol olsem blong givim i kam long mi, gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:3"/><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4-5"/>Nao sipos wan man i tekem wan anamol olsem blong mekem sakrefaes long hem, hem i mas tekem wan kilo flaoa we i kafsaedem wan lita olifoel* i go long hem, i tantanem i go wetem, we hemia i presen long kakae blong garen.* Mo sipos wan man i tekem wan smol sipsip blong mekem sakrefaes ya we i blong bonem i bon evriwan, hem i mas tekem wan lita waen tu blong givim i kam long mi.
<verse eid="NUM 15:4-5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6"/>Mo sipos wan man i tekem wan man sipsip i kam blong mekem sakrefaes olsem, bambae hem i mas tekem tu kilo flaoa we i tantanem wetem wan lita haf olifoel, blong mekem presen long kakae blong garen,
<verse eid="NUM 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7"/>mo i mas tekem wan lita haf waen blong givim i kam long mi. Mo gudfala smel blong ol sakrefaes ya bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8"/>Mo sipos wan man i tekem wan bul blong mekem sakrefaes ya we i blong bonem i bon evriwan, no blong mekem sakrefaes ya we i blong fulumap promes blong hem, no blong mekem sakrefaes ya we i blong soemaot we hem i stap fren gud wetem mi,
<verse eid="NUM 15:8"/><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9-10"/>bambae hem i mas tekem tri kilo flaoa we i tantanem wetem tu lita olifoel blong mekem presen long kakae blong garen, mo i mas tekem tu lita waen blong givim i kam long mi. Bambae hem i mas bonem ol samting ya, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:9-10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11"/>Nao sipos wan man i wantem mekem sakrefaes long wan anamol olsem, hemia nao ol narafala samting we hem i mas tekem i kam wetem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12"/>Mo sipos wan man i tekem tutri anamol wantaem blong mekem sakrefaes, mak blong ol narafala samting ya i mas stret long mak blong ol samting we i mas givim wetem ol anamol ya wanwan.
<verse eid="NUM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13"/>“Yufala i man blong mi, mo sipos yufala i wantem bonem anamol blong mekem ol sakrefaes ya, hemia nao fasin we bambae yufala i mas folem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14"/>Mo sipos wan narafala man i stap wetem yufala blong smoltaem nomo, no blong longtaem, nao hem i wantem bonem anamol blong mekem ol sakrefaes ya, hem i mas folem sem rul ya nomo we yufala i folem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15"/>Sem rul ya i kavremap yufala evriwan wetem ol pikinini blong yufala, mo olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long yufala, mo ol narafala man we oli stap wetem yufala. Long fes blong mi, fasin we bambae yufala i folem, olgeta ya tu oli mas folem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Lev 24.22</char></note>Sem rul ya, bambae yufala evriwan i mas folem.”
<verse eid="NUM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17"/>Nao bakegen, Hae God i givim
<verse eid="NUM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18"/>ol narafala rul long Moses blong ol man ya bambae oli folem taem oli go stap long kantri ya we hem i promes finis blong givim long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 15:18"/><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19-20"/>Hem i talem se, “Sipos yufala i gotru longwe, nao yufala i stap mekem garen, be taem yufala i stap tekemaot ol fas kakae blong hem, oltaem yufala i mas putum haf i tabu, i blong mi. Nao sipos yufala i kukum bred* long hem, be fas bred we yufala i mekem long ol fas kakae ya, oltaem yufala i mas givim haf i kam long mi, nao yufala i save kakae ol narahaf blong hem. Mo yufala i mas givim bred ya long mi long sem fasin ya we yufala i stap givim ol bale* blong yufala long mi, taem we yufala i klinimaot ol makas blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:19-20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21"/>Rul ya, yufala wetem ol pikinini blong yufala, mo olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long yufala, bambae yufala evriwan i mas folem olwe, gogo i no save finis.
<verse eid="NUM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sakrefaes we man i mas mekem blong tekemaot sin blong hem we i no tingting blong mekem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22"/>“Mo sipos yufala evriwan i no folem olgeta rul ya we mi mi givim long yu tede, yufala i mestem wan long olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23"/>i stat long olgeta rul ya we mi mi givim long yu fastaem, i kam kasem olgeta ya we mi givim long yu tede,
<verse eid="NUM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24"/>rod blong stretem samting ya i olsem. Sipos yufala i no tingbaot blong brekem rul ya, yufala i mestem tru, bambae yufala evriwan i mas joen blong tekem wan yang bul blong mekem sakrefaes ya long hem we i blong bonem i bon evriwan blong mekem wosip long mi, nao mi bambae mi glad long smel blong hem. Mo yufala i mas tekem ol flaoa mo waen i kam we i stret blong givim long mi wetem sakrefaes ya, olsem we rul i talem. Mo bakegen, yufala i mas tekem wan man nani blong mekem sakrefaes ya long hem we i blong tekemaot sin blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25"/>Pris bambae i mas mekem sakrefaes blong tekemaot sin blong yufala, nao mi bambae mi fogivim yufala, from we yufala i no tingbaot blong brekem rul ya, yufala i mestem nomo, nao yufala i luk rong blong yufala, mo yufala i mekem sakrefaes ya long mi long bul ya we yufala i bonem i bon evriwan, mo yufala i mekem sakrefaes ya tu long man nani we i blong tekemaot sin blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26"/>Bambae mi fogivim yufala evriwan we i laen* blong Isrel,* wetem ol narafala man tu we oli stap wetem yufala, mi tekemaot ol sin blong yufala, from we yufala evriwan i mestem rul ya. Mi mi Hae God, mo hemia tok blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Lev 4.27-31</char></note>“Be sipos wan man nomo i mestem wan long ol rul ya, nao i mekem wan samting nogud we i no tingbaot blong mekem, hem bambae i mas tekem wan woman nani we i gat wan yia blong hem, blong mekem sakrefaes ya long hem we i blong tekemaot sin blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28"/>Bambae pris i stap long Olta, i mekem sakrefaes blong tekemaot sin blong man ya, mo mi bambae mi fogivim hem, mi tekemaot ol sin blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29"/>Sem rul ya bambae i kavremap yufala evriwan we i mestem wan long ol rul ya, nao i mekem samting we i nogud, nating we man i laen blong Isrel, no i narafala man.
<verse eid="NUM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30"/>“Be sipos wan man i mekem wan samting we i nogud, we hem i tingbaot blong mekem, man ya i stap mekem i nogud long mi. Nating we hem i wan long yufala no i narafala man, be man ya bambae i ded,
<verse eid="NUM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31"/>from we hem i tanem baksaed long mi. Hem i no wantem harem tok blong mi, nao i girap, i brekem wan long ol tok ya we mi mi talem. Bambae hem i ded, be i fol blong hem nomo. Mi mi Hae God, mo hemia tok blong mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wan man i brekem loa blong Sabat dei
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32"/>Nao wan taem, taem we ol laen* blong Isrel* ya oli stap yet long draeples, sam man oli faenem wan man i stap tekem faeawud long Sabat* dei.
<verse eid="NUM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33"/>Nao oli tekem man ya i kam stanap long fes blong Moses wetem Hae Pris Eron, mo olgeta narafala man we oli stap long ples ya,
<verse eid="NUM 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34"/>mo olgeta ya oli putum hem long han blong ol man blong oli stap gad long hem, from we oli no savegud wanem bambae oli mekem long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se, “Yufala i mas tekem hem i go afsaed long ples ya blong yufala, mo yufala i go kilim hem i ded. Yufala evriwan i mas stonem hem gogo i ded.”
<verse eid="NUM 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36"/>Nao olgeta evriwan oli tekem man ya oli go afsaed long ples blong olgeta, mo oli stonem hem gogo i ded, olsem we Hae God i talem long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rul blong ol samting ya we i blong putum long klos blong mekem man i tingbaot ol tok blong Hae God
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses,
<verse eid="NUM 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Dut 22.12</char></note>blong i talemaot long ol man ya se, “Bambae yufala i mas somap ol tasel* oli stap hanghang long ol kona blong ol klos blong yufala, mo yufala i mas putum wan blu rop long ol tasel ya, mo fasin ya bambae yufala i mas holem oltaem, gogo i no save finis.
<verse eid="NUM 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39"/>Ol tasel ya bambae oli stap blong makem ol tok blong mi, nao sipos yufala i luk olgeta, bambae yufala i save tingbaot ol tok ya bakegen, nao bambae yufala i no save gowe long mi, blong folem tingting blong yufala long ol samting we yufala i wantem, bambae yufala i obei long ol tok ya blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40"/>Ol tasel ya, bambae oli mekem yufala i stap tingbaot ol tok ya blong mi blong obei long olgeta, nao bambae yufala i kam tabu, yufala i kam man blong mi olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41"/>Mi mi Hae God, mi God blong yufala. Mi nao mi tekemaot yufala long Ijip blong mi kam God blong yufala. Mi mi Hae God.”
<verse eid="NUM 15:41"/><verse eid="NUM 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Kora mo Datan mo Abiram trifala i agens long Moses
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1-2"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.1-2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jud 1.11</char></note>Nao i gat wan man i stap, we nem blong hem Kora, mo papa blong hem Ijara. Hem i laen* blong Kohat, we i wan pikinini blong Livae.* Nao man ya i girap, i agens long Moses. Mo i gat tri man we i joen long hem, we nem blong trifala, Datan mo Abiram mo On. Trifala ya i laen blong Ruben.* Datan mo Abiram, papa blong tufala Eliab, mo On, papa blong hem Pelet. Mo i gat tu handred fifti man bakegen oli joen long hem. Olgeta ya oli lida we ol man oli jusumaot olgeta fastaem mo oli savegud olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 16:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3"/>Nao olgeta oli kam wanples long fes blong Moses wetem hae pris, mo oli talem long tufala se, “!Tufala! !Yutufala i go tumas ya! Yumi evriwan long kampani ya i blong Hae God, mo hem i stap wetem yumi evriwan. ?From wanem yutufala i putumap yutufala bakegen, se yutufala i hae moa long mifala?”
<verse eid="NUM 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4"/>Taem Moses i harem tok ya, hem i nildaon, i bodaon we fes blong hem i godaon kasem graon, nao i prea.
<verse eid="NUM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5"/>Nao biaen, hem i talem long Kora mo ol man blong hem se, “Tumora long moning, Hae God bambae i soemaot long yumi se hu nao i tabu, i man blong hem. Man we hem i jusumaot finis blong i mekem ol wok blong hem, man ya nao bambae hem i letem hem i kam klosap long hem long Olta blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 16:5"/><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6-7"/>Tumora, long moning, yu wetem ol man blong yu, bambae yufala i tekem ol sensa* blong yufala, yufala i putum faea long olgeta, mo yufala i karem i kam. Bambae yufala i putum insens* long olgeta, nao yufala i kam pas long Olta blong Hae God. Nao bambae yumi luk se hu long yumi nao we hem i bin jusumaot. !Yufala ol Livaet* nao, yufala i go tumas!”
<verse eid="NUM 16:6-7"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8"/>Nao hem i gohed, i talem se, “Kora. !Yufala ol Livaet i mas lesin!
<verse eid="NUM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9"/>God blong yumi, hem i bin makemaot yufala long ol narafala laen ya blong yumi, blong yufala i save kam klosap long hem. Yufala i save mekem wok blong hem insaed long Haos Tapolen blong hem, mo yufala i save mekem ol wok tu blong givhan long mifala evriwan. ?Yufala i ting se hemia i wan smol samting ya?
<verse eid="NUM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10"/>!Hem i letem long yufala wetem ol narafala Livaet blong yufala i tekem hae nem ya, be naoia yufala i stap traem tekem wok blong pris tu!
<verse eid="NUM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11"/>!Yu wetem ol man ya blong yu, taem yufala i stap tok agens long hae pris, be yufala i stap tok agens long Hae God ya!”
<verse eid="NUM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12"/>Nao Moses i singaot Datan mo Abiram blong tufala i kam luk hem, be tufala i talem se, “!Mitufala i no save kam!
<verse eid="NUM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13"/>!Yu luk! !Yu yu tekemaot mifala long gudfala graon ya long Ijip, blong kilim mifala i ded long draeples ya! ?Olsem wanem? ?Hemia i no naf long yu yet? !Yu yu no save kam masta blong mifala!
<verse eid="NUM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14"/>!Yu yu no tekem mifala i go long wan gudfala graon yet! !Yu no givim wan graon yet long mifala blong mifala i planem ol garen* mo ol plantesen blong mifala long hem! ?Yu ting se mifala i blaen? !Mitufala i no save kam!”
<verse eid="NUM 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15"/>Nao Moses i kros tumas from samting ya, mo hem i prea, i talem se, “!Hae God, sipos olgeta ya oli wantem givim presen long yu, be bambae yu no tekem! !Mi mi no mekem wan samting nating i rong long olgeta! !Nating we smol samting nomo olsem dongki no wanem we olgeta oli gat, be mi mi no tajem nating!”
<verse eid="NUM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16"/>Nao hem i talem long Kora se, “Tumora, yu wetem olgeta ya we oli biaen long yu, mo hae pris tu, bambae yufala evriwan i mas kam stanap long fes blong Haos Tapolen blong Hae God.
<verse eid="NUM 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17"/>Yufala evriwan i mas tekem ol sensa* blong yufala i kam, nao bambae yufala i bonem insens long olgeta, blong givim i go long Hae God blong mekem wosip long hem.”
<verse eid="NUM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18"/>Nao long nekis dei, olgeta evriwan oli tekem ol sensa blong olgeta, oli putum faea long olgeta, mo oli putum insens long olgeta, nao oli kam stanap wetem Moses mo hae pris long doa blong yad blong Haos Tapolen ya.
<verse eid="NUM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19"/>Nao Kora i singaot olgeta man oli kam stanap long ples ya, oli stap fesem Moses mo hae pris long doa blong Haos Tapolen ya.<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">16.19: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tok long fas haf blong vas ya i folem plante olfala Oltesteman long lanwis ya Hibru, be sam olfala kopi blong ol Oltesteman ya i talem olsem. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nao Kora i singaot <char style="bd" closed="true">ol man blong hem</char> </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">oli kam stanap long ples ya, oli stap fesem Moses mo hae pris long doa blong Haos Tapolen ya.</char></note> Nao wantaem nomo, laet ya we i saen we i saen, we i soemaot we Hae God i stap, hem i kam saen long olgeta evriwan,
<verse eid="NUM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20"/>nao Hae God i talem long Moses mo hae pris se,
<verse eid="NUM 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21"/>“Yutufala i muv i gobak. Bambae mi mi kilim olgeta ya naoia nomo.”
<verse eid="NUM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22"/>Be tufala i nildaon, tufala i bodaon we fes blong tufala i godaon kasem graon, mo tufala i talem se, “God, yu yu stamba blong laef. Olgeta man oli kasem laef long yu nomo. ?Olsem wanem? ?Sipos wan man nomo i mekem samting nogud, be bambae yu kros long mifala evriwan from?”
<verse eid="NUM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24"/>“Yu talem long olgeta man, se oli mas gowe long ol haos tapolen blong Kora mo blong Datan mo blong Abiram.”
<verse eid="NUM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25"/>Nao Moses wetem ol lida blong olgeta man oli go luk Datan mo Abiram.
<verse eid="NUM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26"/>Nao hem i talemaot long olgeta man se, “Yufala i mas gowe long ol haos tapolen blong ol man nogud ya. Hae God bambae i tekemaot olgeta, wetem ol sin blong olgeta. Yufala i no mas tajem olting blong olgeta. Sipos no, bambae yufala tu i lus wetem olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27"/>Nao ol man oli gowe long ol haos tapolen blong trifala ya.
</para>
  <para style="p">Long taem ya, Datan mo Abiram, tufala i kam afsaed finis, tufala wetem ol woman blong tufala mo ol pikinini blong tufala oli stap stanap long doa blong ol haos tapolen blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28"/>Nao Moses i talem long olgeta man se, “Naoia nomo, bambae yufala i save we Hae God nao i sanem mi blong mi mekem olgeta samting ya. Mo bambae yufala i save tu we mi mi no mekem olgeta samting ya long tingting blong mi nomo.
<verse eid="NUM 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29"/>Sipos olgeta ya oli ded long prapa taem blong ded blong olgeta, we Hae God i no panisim olgeta, hemia i min se hem i no bin sanem mi.
<verse eid="NUM 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30"/>Be sipos hem i mekem wan samting we i narafala olgeta, we i no gat man yet i luk, we graon i open bigwan, nao olgeta ya oli foldaon i go long hol ya wetem olting blong olgeta, mo graon i berem olgeta we oli laef yet, nao oli godaon wantaem long Hom* blong ol Dedman, nao bambae yufala i save se olgeta ya oli tanem baksaed long hem.”
<verse eid="NUM 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31"/>Nao taem we hem i talem tok ya finis, wantaem nomo, graon i brok, i open bigwan stret aninit long ples blong Datan mo Abiram.
<verse eid="NUM 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32"/>Nao tufala wetem ol famle blong tufala, mo olgeta man blong Kora, olgeta evriwan oli foldaon i go long hol ya wetem olting blong olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33"/>mo graon i berem olgeta we oli laef yet. Oli godaon long Hom blong ol Dedman wetem olting blong olgeta. Graon ya i berem olgeta, nao oli lus.
<verse eid="NUM 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34"/>Olgeta man we oli stap long ples ya oli harem we olgeta ya oli singaot bigwan, nao olgeta oli fraet, oli ronwe, mo oli stap singsingaot bigwan se, “!Yumi resis! !Sipos no, graon ya bambae i open bakegen, nao yumi foldaon long hem tu!”
<verse eid="NUM 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35"/>Nao Hae God i sanem wan faea i kam we i laet bigwan, nao i bonem ol tu handred fifti man ya we oli tekem insens i kam, blong givim i go long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol sensa
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37"/>“Moses. Yu talem long pris ya Eleasara pikinini blong Eron, blong i go long ples ya we asis blong ol man ya we faea i kakae olgeta i stap long hem, i tekemaot ol sensa* blong olgeta. Hem i mas kafsaedem ol sakol we i laet we i stap long olgeta, i mas saksakem olbaot long narafala ples longwe, be i mas karem ol sensa ya i kam, from we oli tabu, oli blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38"/>Olgeta oli kam tabu long taem ya we ol man ya oli tekem olgeta, oli kam bonem insens* long olgeta blong givim long mi. Ol man ya oli ded from ol sin blong olgeta, be ol sensa ya blong olgeta, ol man oli wokem long bras, nao yu mas hamarem olgeta oli kam flat, blong wokem wan bigfala bras blong kavremap Olta blong mi. Nao bigfala bras ya bambae i kam wan saen blong soemaot rod long yufala.”
<verse eid="NUM 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39"/>Nao pris ya i tekem ol sensa ya, i givim long ol man, blong oli go hamarem olgeta oli kam flat gud, oli wokem wan bras blong kavremap Olta ya long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40"/>Nao bigfala bras ya i kam wan strong saen long ol laen* blong Isrel,* se man we i no laen blong Hae Pris Eron i no save kam long Olta blong Bonem Insens blong mekem wosip long Hae God. Bras ya i stap soemaot se sipos wan man i mekem olsem, bambae hem i ded olsem we Kora wetem ol man blong hem oli ded. Nao pris ya i mekem olgeta samting ya, stret olsem we Hae God i talem.
<verse eid="NUM 16:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hae Pris Eron i sevem olgeta man
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41-42"/>Nao long nekis dei, olgeta man oli kam wanples blong luk Moses mo Hae Pris Eron, blong tok agens long tufala, mo taem oli luk tufala, oli talem se, “!E! !Yutufala i kilim ol man blong Hae God ya!” Nao taem oli tok long tufala finis, oli lukluk i go long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God, mo oli luk we klaod i kavremap Haos Tapolen ya mo laet ya we i saen we i saen, we i soemaot we Hae God i stap, hem i stap saen olbaot long ples ya.
<verse eid="NUM 16:41-42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43"/>Nao Moses wetem hae pris, tufala i go stanap long doa blong Haos Tapolen ya,
<verse eid="NUM 16:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44"/>mo Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 16:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45"/>“!Yutufala i muv i gowe long olgeta ya! !Bambae mi kilim olgeta tu oli ded wantaem nomo!”
</para>
  <para style="p">Nao tufala i nildaon, tufala i bodaon we fes blong tufala i godaon kasem graon, tufala i prea.
<verse eid="NUM 16:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46"/>Nao Moses i talem long hae pris ya se, “!Ei! !Hae God i kros finis! !Wan rabis sik i stap kilim olgeta ya! !Yu kwik! Yu go tekem sensa* blong yu, yu tekem faea long Olta ya, yu putum long hem, mo yu putum insens* long hem, nao yu karem, yu go joen long olgeta, yu mekem olgeta oli klin long fes blong Hae God. !Yu hareap!”
<verse eid="NUM 16:46"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47"/>Nao hae pris i mekem olsem we hem i talem. Hem i tekem sensa blong hem, i resis i go long medel blong ol man we oli stap long ples ya, mo taem hem i luk we rabis sik ya i stap kilim olgeta, hem i bonem insens blong mekem wosip long Hae God, blong mekem olgeta oli klin long fes blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 16:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48"/>Samting ya i blokem rabis sik ya, nao wantaem nomo, hem i luk we olgeta we oli laef oli stap narasaed, olgeta we oli ded oli stap narasaed, mo hem i stap long medel.
<verse eid="NUM 16:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49"/>Mo namba blong olgeta we oli ded long taem ya i kasem fotin taosen seven handred, be oli no kaontem olgeta ya we oli ded long trabol blong Kora.
<verse eid="NUM 16:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50"/>Nao taem rabis sik ya i finis, hae pris i gobak long ples ya we Moses i stap long hem, long doa blong Haos Tapolen blong Hae God.
<verse eid="NUM 16:50"/><verse eid="NUM 16:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17"/>
  <para style="s">Wokingstik blong Hae Pris Eron i gru
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2"/>“Yu talemaot long olgeta man ya, se ol twelef lida blong ol laen* blong yufala oli mas karem ol wokingstik blong olgeta i kam, oli givim long yu. Yu mas raetem nem blong olgeta wanwan long ol twelef stik ya,
<verse eid="NUM 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3"/>mo stik ya we ol laen blong Livae* i givim, bambae yu raetem nem blong Hae Pris Eron long hem. Bambae i mas gat wokingstik i stap blong karem nem blong ol lida blong ol twelef laen blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4"/>Nao yu mas tekem ol wokingstik ya i kam long Haos Tapolen blong mi, yu mas putum olgeta long fran blong Bokis ya we i Saen blong Promes* blong mi, long ples ya we mi stap mit wetem yu long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5"/>Mo man we mi mi jusumaot hem blong i mekem wok blong mi, wokingstik blong hem bambae i gru. Nao long fasin ya, bambae mi mi blokem toktok blong ol man ya we oli stap tok agens long yu oltaem.”
<verse eid="NUM 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6"/>Nao Moses i talemaot tok ya long olgeta, mo ol lida blong ol twelef laen ya oli kam givim wokingstik long hem. Long fasin ya, i gat twelef wokingstik i stap, mo wokingstik blong Hae Pris Eron i go wetem olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7"/>mo hem i go putum olgeta wokingstik ya insaed long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God, long fran blong Bokis ya we i Saen blong Promes blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Hib 9.4</char></note>Nao long nekis dei, taem Moses i kam long Haos Tapolen ya, hem i luk we wokingstik ya blong ol laen blong Livae, we nem blong Hae Pris Eron i stap long hem, hem i gru. Wokingstik ya i mekem ol lif blong hem, mo ol flaoa blong hem, mo i karem ol frut ya amon* tu we i raep.
<verse eid="NUM 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9"/>Nao hem i tekem ol stik ya, i go soemaot long olgeta man. Mo taem olgeta oli luk samting ya we i kamaot, ol lida oli kam tekembak ol wokingstik blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10"/>Nao Hae God i talem long hem se, “Yu tekem wokingstik ya blong hae pris, yu putum i gobak bakegen long fran blong Bokis ya we i Saen blong Promes blong mi. Bambae yu holem i stap long ples ya blong mekem saen long fes blong olgeta ya evriwan we oli girap, oli stap tok agens long mi. Mo oltaem bambae stik ya i stap soemaot se sipos oli no finis long fasin ya, bambae oli ded.”
<verse eid="NUM 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11"/>Nao hem i mekem olsem we Hae God i talem.
<verse eid="NUM 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12"/>Nao ol man ya oli talem long hem se, “!Ei! !Bambae mifala evriwan i ded ya!
<verse eid="NUM 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13"/>Sipos man we i kam klosap nomo long Haos Tapolen ya i mas ded, hemia i min se mifala evriwan bambae i ded ya.”
<verse eid="NUM 17:13"/><verse eid="NUM 17:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ol wok blong ol pris mo ol wok blong ol Livaet
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Hae Pris Eron se, “Sipos i gat wan samting we i no stret long saed blong ol wok insaed long Haos Tapolen ya we yufala i stap kam long hem blong mit wetem mi, yu wetem ol pikinini blong yu, mo ol Livaet,* bambae yufala evriwan i mas karem panis from. Be yu wetem ol pikinini blong yu, yufala nomo i pris, mo sipos i gat wan samting we i no stret long saed blong wok blong pris, yufala nomo bambae i mas karem panis from.
<verse eid="NUM 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2"/>Ol Livaet ya oli man blong givhan long pris, mo yu mas tekem olgeta oli kam blong oli wok wetem yu. Nao sipos yu wetem ol pikinini blong yu, yufala i stap wok long Haos Tapolen ya, bambae olgeta ya oli save givhan long yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3"/>Olgeta ya oli mas wok aninit long yu, mo oli mas mekem ol wok blong olgeta long Haos Tapolen ya. Be oli no mas kam klosap long Olta blong Bonem Sakrefaes, mo oli no mas kam klosap long ol tabu samting insaed long Rum ya we i Tabu, mo long Rum ya we i Tabu we i Tabu. Sipos olgeta oli tajem wan samting long ples ya, bambae oli ded from, mo yutrifala tu bambae i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4"/>Olgeta ya bambae oli mas wok wetem yu, mo oli mas mekem olgeta wok blong olgeta insaed long yad blong Haos Tapolen ya, mo oltaem bambae oli mas lukaot gud long hem tu. Be i tabu blong ol narafala man oli wok wetem yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5"/>Yufala evriwan i laen* blong Isrel,* be yu wetem tufala pikinini boe blong yu, yutrifala nomo i gat raet blong mekem ol wok long Rum ya we i Tabu mo ol wok long Olta, blong bambae mi no moa save kros bakegen long yufala evriwan.
<verse eid="NUM 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6"/>Ol Livaet, mi nao mi jusumaot olgeta, mo mi tekemaot olgeta long ol narafala laen ya blong yufala, mi mekem olgeta oli tabu, oli man blong mi. Nao mi givim olgeta long yutrifala, blong oli save givhan long yutrifala mo blong oli save mekem ol wok blong olgeta long yad blong Haos Tapolen ya.
<verse eid="NUM 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7"/>Be yu wetem tufala pikinini blong yu, yutrifala nomo i pris. Mi mi putumap yutrifala i kam pris, mo hae nem ya i presen blong mi long yutrifala. Mo from samting ya, bambae yutrifala nomo i gat raet blong mekem olgeta wok long Olta mo long ol samting we i stap insaed long Rum ya we i Tabu we i Tabu. Be sipos narafala man i kam klosap long ol tabu samting ya, bambae yufala i mas kilim hem i ded.”
<verse eid="NUM 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol presen we ol pris bambae oli stap kasem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8"/>Nao bakegen, Hae God i talem long hae pris ya se, “Eron. Yu mas savegud we promes* blong mi we mi mekem long yu, mo long ol pikinini blong yu, mo long olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long yu i olsem. Sipos wan man long laen* blong Isrel* i givim presen long mi we i no blong bonem blong mekem sakrefaes long hem, bambae mi mi givim presen ya long yu. Fasin ya bambae i stap oltaem nomo, gogo i no save finis.
<verse eid="NUM 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9"/>Sipos wan man i givim presen long mi, we hem i putum i tabu, i blong mi, be i gat haf blong hem i stap we yufala i no bonem long Olta, haf ya i blong yufala. Nating we presen ya we hem i givim i wan presen we i kamaot long garen* blong hem, no i wan spesel sakrefaes blong tekemaot sin blong hem, no i wan sakrefaes blong mekem hem i klin bakegen long fes blong mi, be olgeta haf ya oli blong yu wetem ol pikinini blong yu.
<verse eid="NUM 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10"/>Ol samting ya i tabu blong ol woman oli kakae, ol man nomo oli save kakae, mo oli mas kakae long yad blong Haos Tapolen ya. Yufala i mas save gud, ol samting ya oli tabu, from we oli blong mi fastaem.
<verse eid="NUM 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11"/>“Antap long hemia, ol narafala spesel presen we ol man ya bambae oli givim long mi, bambae oli blong yufala. Ol samting ya oli blong yu wetem ol pikinini blong yu, mo oli blong olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long yu gogo i no save finis. Mo olgeta evriwan long haos blong yu we oli klin long fes blong mi bambae oli save kakae.
<verse eid="NUM 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12"/>“Evri yia ol man ya oli mas givim ol fas kakae blong garen i kam long mi. Ol nambawan olifoel* we bambae oli stap givim, wetem ol nambawan niu waen, mo ol nambawan kakae,
<verse eid="NUM 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13"/>olgeta evriwan i blong yu. Mo olgeta evriwan long haos blong yu we oli klin long fes blong mi oli save kakae.
<verse eid="NUM 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Lev 27.28</char></note>“Mo olgeta samting we ol man oli makemaot se i tabu, i blong mi, nao oli givim i kam long mi blong mekem wosip long mi, olgeta ya tu i blong yu.
<verse eid="NUM 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15"/>“Mo evri fasbon pikinini blong olgeta, mo evri fasbon pikinini blong ol anamol blong olgeta we olgeta oli givim i kam long mi, olgeta oli blong yu. Be yu mas letem olgeta oli pemaot bakegen evri fasbon pikinini blong olgeta, mo evri fasbon anamol tu we i no klin long fes blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16"/>Taem pikinini i gat wan manis blong hem, papa blong hem i mas pemaot hem bakegen long mi blong i blong hem. Mo praes blong hem we mi mi putum, tu taosen faef handred vatu,* mo oli mas pem long sem mane ya we yufala i stap yusum oltaem blong pem ol samting long ples blong mekem wosip.
<verse eid="NUM 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17"/>Be ol fasbon buluk, mo sipsip, mo nani blong olgeta oli no save pemaot bakegen. Ol samting ya evriwan oli tabu, oli blong mi, mo yu mas kilim olgeta blong mekem sakrefaes long mi. Anamol olsem, yu mas tekem blad blong hem, yu kafsaedem i go long saed blong Olta, mo yu mas bonem gris blong hem long Olta blong givim i kam long mi, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18"/>Be mit blong olgeta i blong yu. Hem i olsem anamol we man i mekem spesel sakrefaes long hem, we jes blong hem mo raet leg blong hem i blong yu.
<verse eid="NUM 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19"/>“Bakegen, olgeta spesel presen ya we bambae oli stap givim i kam long mi, olgeta evriwan i blong yu, wetem ol pikinini blong yu, mo oli blong olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long yu, gogo i no save finis. Hemia i wan strong promes blong mi we mi mi mekem wetem yu, mo ol pikinini blong yu mo olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long yu, mo mi mi no save brekem.”
<verse eid="NUM 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20"/>Nao Hae God i talem long hem se, “Yufala evriwan i laen blong Isrel, mo long kantri ya we mi mi promes blong givim long yufala, ol narafala laen ya blong yufala bambae oli holem olgeta graon blong hem. Be bambae yufala i no save holem wan pis graon se i blong yufala, mo graon ya we bambae yufala i stap long hem, bambae yufala i no save givim long ol pikinini blong yufala se i blong olgeta. Mi nao mi stamba blong evri samting long laef blong yufala.”
<verse eid="NUM 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol presen we ol Livaet bambae oli stap kasem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Lev 27.30-33; Dut 14.22-29</char></note>Nao Hae God i talem se, “Promes blong mi long ol Livaet* i olsem. Oltaem, taem ol man blong ol narafala laen* blong Isrel* oli seraot olting blong olgeta i go long ten hif, nao oli givim wan hif i kam long mi, we hemia taet* blong olgeta, be bambae mi mi givim ol taet ya i go long ol Livaet ya. Hemia bambae i olsem pei blong olgeta from we oli stap lukaot long Haos Tapolen blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22"/>Ol narafala laen blong Isrel oli no save kam klosap long Haos Tapolen ya, from we sipos oli mekem olsem, bambae oli kasem panis we bambae oli ded from.
<verse eid="NUM 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23"/>I stat naoia, olgeta ya nomo bambae oli stap lukaot long Haos Tapolen ya, mo olgeta wok blong hem bambae i stap nomo long han blong olgeta. Mo sipos oli no folemgud ol fasin blong wok blong hem, bambae oli save kasem panis from. Hemia i wan strong rul we bambae i stap olwe, mo i kavremap ol pikinini blong yufala, mo olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long yufala tu. Long kantri ya we mi mi promes* blong givim long yufala evriwan, ol Livaet ya tu bambae oli no save holem graon blong olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24"/>from we mi talem finis se olgeta taet ya we ol man ya bambae oli givim i kam long mi, bambae mi givim i go long olgeta. Hemia i spesel presen blong mi we mi givim long olgeta, taswe mi talem se bambae olgeta oli no gat raet blong holem graon.”
<verse eid="NUM 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fasin we ol Livaet oli mas folem taem oli karem ol presen ya
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25"/>Nao Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses
<verse eid="NUM 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26"/>blong i go talemaot long ol Livaet.* Hem i talem se, “Taem ol Livaet oli kasem ol taet* ya we mi bambae mi givim long olgeta, we ol man long ol narafala laen* oli givim i kam long mi, fasin we bambae oli mas mekem long ol samting ya i olsem. Bambae olgeta oli mas seraot ol samting ya i go long ten hif, nao oli mas givim wan hif i kam long mi. Hemia i taet blong olgeta we bambae oli mas givim blong mekem wosip long mi.
<verse eid="NUM 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27"/>Bambae olgeta oli no gat garen blong olgeta mo plantesen blong grep* blong olgeta, be ol samting ya, bambae mi mi makem olsem kakae we i kamaot long garen blong olgeta, mo waen we i kamaot long plantesen blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28"/>Long fasin ya, bambae olgeta tu oli save givim taet long mi, we i kamaot long ol samting ya we ol narafala man ya oli givim long mi. Ol taet we bambae oli stap givim oli mas go long Hae Pris Eron,
<verse eid="NUM 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29"/>mo olgeta oli mas tekemaot long ol nambawan samting we oli kasem.
<verse eid="NUM 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30"/>Nao taem olgeta oli givim ol taet ya long mi finis, bambae oli save holem ol haf we i stap i blong olgeta, olsem we man we i wok long garen i givim taet blong hem long mi, mo i save holem ol narafala samting we i kamaot long garen blong hem oli blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31"/>Ol samting ya i olsem pei blong olgeta from ol wok we oli stap mekem insaed long Haos Tapolen ya, mo oli save kakae wetem ol pikinini blong olgeta mo ol narafala man we oli stap long haos blong olgeta, long weples oli stap long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32"/>Taem olgeta oli givim ol taet ya i kam long mi, bambae oli save kakae ol haf we i stap, mo oli no save kasem panis from. Be fastaem, ol samting ya oli tabu from we ol man oli givim i kam long mi, mo olgeta oli mas lukaot gud, mo oli mas tinghevi long olgeta. Sipos oli kakae wan long ol samting ya fastaem, we oli no givim taet blong hem yet i kam long mi, bambae oli mas ded from.”
<verse eid="NUM 18:32"/><verse eid="NUM 18:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19"/>
  <para style="s">Ol asis blong red kao
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1-2"/>Nao Hae God i givim ol rul blong hem long Moses mo Hae Pris Eron blong tufala i go talemaot long ol laen* blong Isrel.* Hem i talem se, “Bambae yufala i mas tekem wan red kao we i no gat wan samting i rong long bodi blong hem, mo we yufala i no yusum yet blong wok,
<verse eid="NUM 19:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3"/>nao bambae yufala i kam givim long pris ya Eleasara. Nao hem i mas tekem i gowe long ples ya we ol haos tapolen blong yufala i stap long hem, i go afsaed, mo long fes blong pris ya, wan man i mas kilim buluk ya i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4"/>Nao pris i mas tekem smol blad blong buluk ya, mo i mas lukluk i kam stret long ples ya we Haos Tapolen blong mi i stap long hem, mo hem i mas pusum fingga blong hem i go long blad ya, i mas sakem seven taem i kam long saed ya we hem i lukluk i kam long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5"/>Nao long fes blong pris ya, wan long yufala bambae i mas bonem buluk ya long faea. Man ya i mas bonem olgeta haf blong buluk ya wetem skin blong hem, mo mit blong hem, mo blad blong hem, mo ol gat blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6"/>Pris ya i mas tekem wan pis wud blong tri ya sida,* mo wan han blong smol tri ya hisop,* mo wan smol rop we i red, nao i mas sakem trifala tu i go long faea.
<verse eid="NUM 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7"/>Biaen, hem i mas wasem ol klos blong hem, mo i mas swim, nao bambae hem i save kam insaed long ples ya bakegen we ol haos tapolen blong yufala i stap long hem. Be long fes blong mi, bambae hem i no klin yet gogo kasem we san i godaon.
<verse eid="NUM 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8"/>Mo man we i bonem buluk ya, hem tu i mas wasem klos blong hem, mo i mas swim. Be long fes blong mi, hem tu bambae i no klin yet gogo kasem we san i godaon.
<verse eid="NUM 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Hib 9.13</char></note>Nao wan man we i klin long fes blong mi bambae i mas tekem ol asis blong buluk ya, i mas go putum long wan ples we i klin long fes blong mi afsaed long ples ya we ol haos tapolen blong yufala i stap long hem. Asis ya bambae i save stap gud long ples ya, nao bambae yufala i save yusum blong mekemrere wota blong mekem yufala i klin long fes blong mi. Wota ya we asis blong buluk ya i stap long hem bambae i save mekem man i klin long fes blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10"/>Nao man we i go putumgud asis blong buluk ya i mas wasem ol klos blong hem, mo hem tu bambae i no klin long fes blong mi gogo kasem we san i godaon. Yufala evriwan we i laen blong Isrel, wetem ol man afsaed we oli stap wetem yufala, rul ya bambae i holem yufala olwe, gogo i no save finis.”
<verse eid="NUM 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Man we i tajem dedbodi, hem i doti long fes blong Hae God
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11"/>Mo Hae God i talem long tufala se, “Man we i tajem dedbodi, bambae hem i no klin long fes blong mi gogo kasem seven dei.
<verse eid="NUM 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12"/>Nao long namba tri dei blong hem, mo long namba seven dei blong hem, hem i mas mekem hem i klin long wota we asis blong red buluk ya i stap long hem, nao bambae hem i kam klin bakegen. Be sipos hem i no mekem fasin ya, bambae hem i no save kam klin long fes blong mi,
<verse eid="NUM 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13"/>nao hem i stap mekem Haos Tapolen blong mi i doti long fes blong mi, mo bambae mi mi no moa save kaontem hem, se i man blong mi<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">19.13: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yu luk futnot <char style="bd" closed="true">B</char> long 9.13.</char></note> Bambae hem i stap olsem nomo, we i doti long fes blong mi, from we hem i no askem wan man we i klin long fes blong mi blong tekem wota ya, i kafsaedem i go long bodi blong hem blong mekem hem i klin.
<verse eid="NUM 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14"/>“Mo sipos wan man i ded insaed long wan haos tapolen blong yufala, rul blong samting ya i olsem. Ol man we oli stap long haos tapolen ya long taem ya, mo ol man we biaen oli go insaed long haos ya, bambae oli stap seven dei, we oli doti long fes blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15"/>Mo olgeta botel mo sospen long haos ya we ol man oli no putum led long olgeta, ol samting ya tu oli kam doti long fes blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16"/>Mo sipos man i stap long open ples, nao i tajem man we i ded long faet no long sam narafala samting, no i tajem bun blong wan man we i ded bifo, no i tajem beregraon blong wan man, man ya tu bambae i stap seven dei, we hem i doti long fes blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17"/>“Fasin we yufala i mas folem blong mekem olgeta oli klin bakegen long fes blong mi i olsem. Wan man i mas tekem asis ya, i mas putum long wan sospen, mo i mas kafsaedem wota we oli kasem long springwota i go long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18"/>Nao sipos man i ded long haos, wan man we i klin long fes blong mi bambae i mas tekem wan smol han blong tri ya hisop,* i mas pusum i go long wota ya, mo i mas saksakem wota ya i go long haos ya, mo long evri samting we i stap insaed long hem, mo long olgeta man we oli stap long haos ya long taem ya we dedman i stap. Mo sipos man i no klin from we i tajem bun blong dedman, no i tajem dedbodi, no beregraon blong wan man, man we i klin long fes blong mi bambae i mas saksakem wota ya i go long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19"/>Man ya i mas saksakem wota ya i go long hem long namba tri dei blong hem mo long namba seven dei blong hem, mo long namba seven dei ya nao, bambae i mekem hem i klin long fes blong mi. Nao man ya we fastaem i no klin bambae hem i mas wasem ol klos blong hem, mo i mas swim blong bodi blong hem i klin, mo long taem we san i godaon, bambae hem i klin.
<verse eid="NUM 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20"/>“Be sipos man we i doti long fes blong mi i no mekem ol samting ya blong kam klin bakegen, bambae hem i mekem Haos Tapolen blong mi i doti tu, mo bambae mi mi no moa save kaontem hem se i man blong mi. Bambae hem i stap olsem nomo, we i doti long fes blong mi, from we hem i no askem wan man we i klin long fes blong mi blong tekem wota ya, i kafsaedem i go long bodi blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21"/>Hemia i wan rul we bambae yufala i mas folem oltaem, gogo i no save finis.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Man we i stap saksakem wota i go long man olsem blong mekem hem i klin, hem tu bambae i mas wasem ol klos blong hem, mo olgeta man we oli tajem wota ya, bambae oli doti long fes blong mi, gogo kasem we san i godaon.
<verse eid="NUM 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22"/>Mo sipos wan man we i doti i tajem wan samting, samting ya tu bambae i kam doti long fes blong mi, mo sipos narafala man i tajem samting ya, bambae hem tu i doti gogo kasem we san i godaon.”
<verse eid="NUM 19:22"/><verse eid="NUM 19:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20"/>
  <para style="s">Ol samting we i hapen long Kades
</para>
  <para style="r">(Eksodas 17.1-7)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1"/>Nao long manis ya Abib* we i fas manis blong yia<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">20.1: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Plante man oli luk se yia ya i namba foti yia we oli wokbaot long draeples. Yu luk 33.36-38.</char></note>, olgeta laen* blong Isrel* oli kam long draeples ya Jin, mo oli mekem ples blong olgeta long Kades. Mo long taem ya, Meriam<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">20.1: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Meriam</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Woman ya i sista blong Moses, we bifo, hem i stap lukaot long Moses taem hem i smol.</char></note> i ded, mo oli berem hem long ples ya.
<verse eid="NUM 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 17.1-7</char></note>Nao long ples ya we oli stap long hem, i no gat wota, mo ol man oli kam hivap raon long Moses mo Hae Pris Eron,
<verse eid="NUM 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3"/>oli stap tok agens long tufala. Oli talem se, “Sipos mifala i ded wetem olgeta ya bifo we oli ded long fran blong Haos Tapolen blong Hae God, bambae i moa gud.
<verse eid="NUM 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4"/>?From wanem yutufala i tekem mifala i kam long draeples ya? ?Yutufala i wantem blong mifala evriwan i ded long ples ya, wetem ol anamol blong mifala?
<verse eid="NUM 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5"/>!Ples ya i wan rabis ples olgeta! !I no gat wan samting nating i save gru long hem! ?From wanem yutufala i tekemaot mifala long Ijip? !Yutufala i luk! !Long ples ya, i no gat kakae, mo i no gat fig,* mo i no gat grep,* mo i no gat grenadin*! !Mo antap bakegen, i no gat wota tu blong dring! ?From wanem yutufala i tekem mifala i kam long ples ya?”
<verse eid="NUM 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6"/>Nao tufala i gowe long olgeta, tufala i go stanap long doa blong Haos Tapolen blong Hae God. Mo tufala i nildaon, tufala i bodaon we fes blong tufala i godaon kasem graon, tufala i prea, nao tufala i luk laet ya we i saen we i saen, we i soemaot we Hae God i stap.
<verse eid="NUM 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8"/>“Yu kam tekem stik ya we i stap long fran blong Bokis ya we i Saen blong Promes* blong mi, mo yutufala i singaot olgeta man oli kam wanples. Nao long fes blong olgeta, bambae yu tok long ston ya longwe, mo bambae wota i sut i kamaot long hem, i kam long olgeta wetem ol anamol blong olgeta blong oli save dring.”
<verse eid="NUM 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9"/>Nao hem i go, i tekem stik ya, olsem we Hae God i talem.
<verse eid="NUM 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10"/>Nao tufala i singaot olgeta man oli kam wanples long fran blong bigfala ston ya, mo Moses i talem se, “!Olgeta! !Oltaem yufala i stap tok agens long Hae God! !Yufala i lesin! ?Olsem wanem? ?Mitufala i mas mekem wota i kamaot long ston ya blong yufala i dring?”
<verse eid="NUM 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11"/>Nao hem i leftemap stik ya, i kilim bigfala ston ya long hem tu taem, mo wantaem nomo, bigfala wota i sut i kamaot, mo olgeta man wetem ol anamol blong olgeta oli stap dring.
<verse eid="NUM 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12"/>Be biaen, Hae God i tok long tufala, i talem se, “!Tufala! !Bilif blong yutufala i no strong nating! !Yutufala i no naf blong soemaot long olgeta ya we mi mi tabu, mo mi gat paoa! From samting ya, bambae yutufala i no save lidim olgeta oli gotru long ples ya we mi mi promes blong givim long yufala.”
<verse eid="NUM 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13"/>Wota ya, olgeta oli putum nem blong hem se Meriba, we i min se “Oli stap tok agens”, from we long ples ya, oli girap, oli tok agens long Hae God, nao hem i soemaot long olgeta we hem i tabu, fasin blong hem i stret olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">King blong Edom i no save letem olgeta oli pastru long kantri blong hem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14"/>Nao taem Moses olgeta oli stap long Kades, hem i sanem sam man oli go blong luk king blong Edom, blong oli karem tok blong hem i go long hem. Mo taem olgeta oli gotru, oli talem long hem se, “King. Mifala ya i laen* blong Isrel,* we yumi kamaot long wan stamba nomo, mo tok blong mifala i olsem. Yu yu save we oltaem, hadtaem i stap kasem mifala, we i stap mekem mifala i harem nogud tumas.
<verse eid="NUM 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15"/>Mo yu save we ol bubu blong mifala bifo oli go long Ijip, mo oli stap plante handred yia long ples ya. Be biaen, ol man Ijip ya oli stap spolem olgeta, kam kasem taem blong mifala,
<verse eid="NUM 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16"/>nao mifala i krae long Hae God blong hem i givhan long mifala, mo hem i harem krae blong mifala, i sanem wan enjel i kam, we i lidim mifala i kamaot long Ijip. Mo naoia, mifala i stap long ples ya Kades, we i stap long mak blong graon blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17"/>?Plis yu save letem mifala i pastru long kantri ya blong yu? Mifala wetem ol anamol blong mifala, bambae mifala i no save go olbaot. Mifala i no save go insaed long ol garen blong yufala mo long ol plantesen blong yufala, mo mifala i no save dring wota long ol wel blong yufala tu. Bambae mifala i stap folem bigrod ya nomo, gogo kasem we mifala i goaot long kantri blong yu bakegen.”
<verse eid="NUM 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18"/>Be ol man Edom oli talem se, “!Nogat! !Mifala i no save letem yufala i kam pas long kantri blong mifala. Sipos yufala i kam, bambae mifala i mekem faet long yufala.”
<verse eid="NUM 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19"/>Nao ol man ya oli talem se, “Be bambae mifala i stap folem bigrod nomo, mo sipos mifala no ol anamol blong mifala i dring wota blong yufala, bambae mifala i mas pem. Mifala i wantem nomo blong pastru.”
<verse eid="NUM 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20"/>Be ol man Edom oli talem bakegen se, “!Nogat! !Mifala i no save letem!” Nao king i sanem plante soldia blong hem we oli strong man blong faet oli wokbaot i kam blong mekem faet long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21"/>Nao from we king ya i no save letem olgeta oli pastru long kantri blong hem, olgeta oli tanemraon, oli folem narafala rod.
<verse eid="NUM 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hae Pris Eron i ded
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22"/>Nao olgeta oli aot long Kades, oli kam kasem hil ya Horo,
<verse eid="NUM 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23"/>long mak blong kantri ya Edom. Mo taem oli kasem ples ya, Hae God i toktok long Moses mo Hae Pris Eron bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24"/>Hem i talem se, “Moses. Eron bambae i no save go insaed long kantri ya we mi mi promes* blong givim long yufala. Bambae hem i ded, from we yutufala i agens long mi long Meriba, yutufala i no folem tok blong mi.
<verse eid="NUM 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25"/>Naoia yu mas tekem hem wetem pikinini blong hem pris ya Eleasara, yutrifala i go antap long hil ya Horo,
<verse eid="NUM 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26"/>mo long ples ya, bambae yu mas tekemaot ol spesel klos ya we hem i stap werem, yu mas putum olgeta i go long pris ya. Mo biaen, bambae hae pris ya i ded long ples ya.”
<verse eid="NUM 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27"/>Nao Moses i mekem olsem we Hae God i talem. Long fes blong olgeta man, trifala i aot, trifala i wokbaot blong go antap long hil ya,
<verse eid="NUM 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 29.29; Nam 33.38; Dut 10.6</char></note>mo long ples ya, Moses i tekemaot ol spesel klos ya we hae pris i stap werem, i putum olgeta i go long pris, nao hae pris i ded antap long hil ya. Mo biaen, Moses wetem pris ya, tufala i kamdaon bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29"/>Mo taem ol man oli harem we hae pris ya i ded, olgeta evriwan oli stap krae from hem, gogo kasem toti dei.
<verse eid="NUM 20:29"/><verse eid="NUM 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21"/>
  <para style="s">Olgeta oli winim ol man Kenan, we oli kam mekem faet long olgeta
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 33.40</char></note>Nao i gat wan king i stap rul long kantri ya Kenan,* long saed blong hem long saot. Hem i wan laen* blong Kenan, mo hedkwota blong hem i stap long taon ya Arad. Nao taem hem i harem we ol laen blong Isrel* oli stap kam folem rod ya we i pas long Atarim, hem i girap, i go mekem faet long olgeta, mo i holem sam long olgeta oli kam slef* blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2"/>Nao ol narawan we oli stap oli mekem wan strong promes long Hae God se, “Hae God. Sipos yu letem mifala i winim king ya wetem ol man blong hem, bambae mifala i putum olgeta wetem ol taon blong olgeta oli tabu, oli blong yu, nao bambae mifala i kilim olgeta man ya evriwan i ded, mo bambae mifala i bonem ol taon ya oli bon evriwan, blong givim<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">21.2: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ol laen blong Isrel bifo, long fasin blong olgeta blong mekem wosip, oli stap bonem anamol we i bon evriwan blong givim i go long Hae God. Mo long sem fasin, samtaem, long taem blong faet, oli save bonem wan taon we i bon olgeta blong givim i go long hem.</char></note> i go long yu.”
<verse eid="NUM 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3"/>Nao Hae God i harem olgeta, mo i givhan long olgeta blong oli winim ol man Kenan ya. Nao olgeta oli kilim ol man Kenan ya mo oli bonem ol taon blong olgeta we oli bon olgeta, nao oli putum nem blong ples ya se Homa, we i min se “Oli spolemgud olgeta samting”.
<verse eid="NUM 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moses i wokem wan snek long bras
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Dut 2.1</char></note>Nao ol laen* blong Isrel* oli aot long hil ya Horo, oli folem rod ya we i go long Akaba Bei<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">21.4: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Akaba Bei</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Bei ya, hem i haf blong Red Si, long saed blong hem long is. Yu luk Namba 14.25 tu.</char></note>, blong oli pasraon long kantri ya Edom. Be taem oli stap wokbaot, oli stap harem nogud, nao oli girap,
<verse eid="NUM 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">1 Kor 10.9</char></note>oli stap tok agens long Hae God mo agens long Moses tu. Oli talem se, “?From wanem yu tekemaot mifala long Ijip blong mifala i kam ded long draeples ya? !Ples ya i no gat wota long hem, mo i no gat kakae tu. Mo mifala i taedgud long rabis kakae ya, mifala i no glad long hem nating.”
<verse eid="NUM 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6"/>Nao Hae God i sanem ol posen snek i kam long olgeta, mo ol snek ya oli kakae plante long olgeta oli ded.
<verse eid="NUM 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7"/>Nao olgeta oli kam luk Moses, oli talemaot long hem se, “Moses. Mifala i mekem i nogud ya we mifala i stap tok agens long Hae God mo agens long yu tu. Plis yu prea long hem blong i tekemaot ol snek ya i gowe long mifala.” Mo Moses i prea from olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8"/>Nao Hae God i talem long hem blong i tekem bras, i wokem wan pija blong snek long hem, i putum long wan pos, mo i stanemap, nao sipos snek i kakae wan man, man ya i save luk long pija ya blong snek, nao bambae i kam gud bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">2 King 18.4; Jon 3.14</char></note>Nao Moses i tekem bras, i wokem wan pija blong snek long hem, nao i putum long wan pos, i stanemap. Mo ol man we snek i kakae olgeta, oli stap luk long pija ya, nao oli kam gud bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olgeta oli aot long hil ya Horo, oli go long bigfala levelples long kantri ya Moab
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10"/>Nao olgeta oli aot long ples ya, oli go mekem ples blong olgeta long Obot.
<verse eid="NUM 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11"/>Mo biaen, oli aot long ples ya bakegen, oli go mekem ples blong olgeta long draeples, klosap long olfala taon ya Abarim, we i kam nogud finis. Ples ya i stap narasaed long graon blong ol man Moab, saed i go long is.
<verse eid="NUM 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12"/>Nao oli girap, oli go mekem ples blong olgeta bakegen long bigfala levelples ya Sered, long medel blong ol hil.
<verse eid="NUM 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13"/>Biaen, olgeta oli aot long ples ya bakegen, oli go mekem ples blong olgeta long narasaed Anon Reva saed i go long not, long haf blong bigfala draeples ya we i go kasem graon blong ol laen* blong Amoro.* Anon Reva ya, hem i mak blong graon blong ol man Moab mo ol laen blong Amoro, we graon blong ol man Moab i stap saed i kam, mo graon blong ol laen blong Amoro i stap saed i go.
<verse eid="NUM 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14"/>Taswe buk ya we nem blong hem <char style="bk" closed="true">Ol Stori blong ol Faet we Hae God i Mekem,</char> hem i tokbaot ol ples ya se, “…vilej ya Waheb long ples ya Sufa, mo ol bigbigfala levelples long medel blong ol hil, mo Anon Reva,
<verse eid="NUM 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15"/>mo ol bigfala levelples ya long saed blong vilej ya Ara, mo long saed blong kantri ya Moab.”
<verse eid="NUM 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16"/>Nao biaen oli aot long ples ya bakegen, oli go long wan ples ya we nem blong hem Behere, we i min se “Wel we i gat fulap wota long hem”. Nao long ples ya, Hae God i talem long Moses se, “Yu singaot olgeta man i kam wanples, nao bambae mi mi givim wota long olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17"/>Nao ol man ya oli sing long wan singsing we i talem se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“!Wel!
</para>
  <para style="q1">!Yu mas givim wota long mifala!
</para>
  <para style="q1">Sipos yu givim,
</para>
  <para style="q2">bambae mifala i glad tumas,
</para>
  <para style="q3">mifala i singsing.
<verse eid="NUM 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18"/>Wel ya,
</para>
  <para style="q2">ol pikinini blong king oli digim
</para>
  <para style="q3">long ol wokingstik blong king,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mo ol lida oli digim
</para>
  <para style="q4">long ol wokingstik blong olgeta.”
</para>
  <para style="p">Nao biaen oli aot long draeples ya bakegen, oli go long Matana.
<verse eid="NUM 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19"/>Nao oli aot long ples ya bakegen, oli go long Nahaliel, mo biaen, oli aot long Nahaliel, oli go long Bamot.
<verse eid="NUM 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20"/>Nao oli aot long Bamot bakegen, oli go long bigfala levelples ya long kantri blong ol man Moab, we i klosap long hil ya Pisga. Long top blong hil ya, man i save lukluk i godaon long draeples.
<verse eid="NUM 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olgeta oli winim King Sihon mo King Og
</para>
  <para style="r">(Dutronome 2.26—3.11)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21"/>Nao olgeta ya oli sanem sam man blong oli go luk King Sihon, we i king blong ol laen* blong Amoro,* blong oli askem long hem se,
<verse eid="NUM 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22"/>“Plis yu letem mifala i pastru long kantri ya blong yu. Mifala wetem ol anamol blong mifala, bambae mifala i no save go olbaot. Mifala i no save go insaed long ol garen blong yufala mo long ol plantesen blong yufala, mo mifala i no save dring wota long ol wel blong yufala tu. Bambae mifala i stap folem bigrod ya nomo, gogo kasem we mifala i goaot long kantri blong yu bakegen.”
<verse eid="NUM 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23"/>Be hem i no save letem olgeta oli pastru long kantri blong hem. Hem i singaot ol soldia blong hem oli kam wanples, nao oli wokbaot i kam long ples ya Jahaj long draeples, mo oli mekem faet long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24"/>Be olgeta ya oli kilim plante soldia blong hem oli ded, mo oli holem ol graon blong olgeta, i stat long Anon Reva, i go kasem Jabok Reva long not we i mak blong graon blong ol man Amon saed i kam. Be oli no save go moa long saed ya, from we ol man Amon oli strong tumas, oli blokem olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 21:24"/><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25-26"/>Ol laen blong Isrel* ya oli holem olgeta taon blong ol laen blong Amoro, wetem bigfala taon ya Hesbon we i kaptel blong olgeta, we King Sihon i stap long hem, mo ol vilej we oli stap raonabaot long ol taon ya, nao oli go stap long olgeta. Fastaem, taon ya i blong king blong ol man Moab, be bifo finis, King Sihon i go mekem faet long hem, mo i holem taon ya wetem olgeta graon blong king ya i go kasem Anon Reva.
<verse eid="NUM 21:25-26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27"/>Taswe ol man blong mekem singsing oli stap sing long wan sing we i talem se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“!Yufala i kam long taon ya Hesbon
</para>
  <para style="q2">we fastaem i hedkwota blong King Sihon!
</para>
  <para style="q1">Bambae yumi bildim taon ya bakegen,
</para>
  <para style="q2">yumi wokem i kam gud olsem fastaem.
<verse eid="NUM 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jer 48.45,46</char></note>Bifo,
</para>
  <para style="q2">ol soldia blong king ya
</para>
  <para style="q3">oli kamaot long taon ya
</para>
  <para style="q2">olsem faea we i bon strong,
</para>
  <para style="q4">i kakae evri samting.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Oli spolem taon ya Ara
</para>
  <para style="q3">long Moab,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mo oli spolem tu ol man blong ol hil ya
</para>
  <para style="q4">long Anon Reva antap.
<verse eid="NUM 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29"/>!Ol man Moab,
</para>
  <para style="q2">sore tumas long yufala!
</para>
  <para style="q1">Yufala i stap mekem wosip
</para>
  <para style="q3">long god ya Kemos,
</para>
  <para style="q2">be olgeta ya oli kam spolemgud yufala.
</para>
  <para style="q1">God ya blong yufala
</para>
  <para style="q2">i letem ol laen blong Amoro
</para>
  <para style="q3">oli kam ronemaot ol man blong yufala
</para>
  <para style="q4">oli ronronwe i go long ol narafala ples.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Mo i letem king ya blong olgeta
</para>
  <para style="q2">i holem ol woman blong yufala
</para>
  <para style="q3">oli kam slef* blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30"/>Be naoia,
</para>
  <para style="q2">ol man we oli kamaot biaen long olgeta,
</para>
  <para style="q3">mifala i spolemgud olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Long olgeta ples ya,
</para>
  <para style="q2">i stat long taon ya Hesbon,
</para>
  <para style="q3">i go kasem taon ya Dibon,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mo i stat long taon ya Nasim,
</para>
  <para style="q3">i go kasem taon ya Nofa,
</para>
  <para style="q4">klosap long taon ya Medebaha,
</para>
  <para style="q2">be olgeta ya oli lus evriwan finis.”
<verse eid="NUM 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31"/>Long fasin ya nao, ol laen blong Isrel oli holem kantri ya Amoro, nao oli stap olwe long ples ya.
<verse eid="NUM 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32"/>Nao Moses i sanem ol man blong hem blong oli go lukaot wan gudfala rod blong go mekem faet long ol man blong taon ya Jasere. Mo biaen, olgeta oli go ronemaot ol laen blong Amoro we oli stap long taon ya, mo oli holem taon ya wetem ol vilej we oli stap raonabaot long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33"/>Nao oli tanemraon, oli folem rod ya we i blong go long kantri ya Basan. Nao King Og we i king blong Basan, hem wetem ol man blong hem oli kam mekem faet long olgeta ya long taon ya Edrei.
<verse eid="NUM 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se, “Moses. Yu no fraet long king ya. Mi bambae mi givhan long yufala, nao bambae yufala i winim hem wetem ol man blong hem, mo bambae mi givim kantri ya blong hem i go long yufala. Bambae yufala i mas mekem long hem olsem we yufala i mekem long King Sihon, king ya blong ol laen blong Amoro, we hedkwota blong hem long Hesbon.”
<verse eid="NUM 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35"/>Nao oli kilim king ya wetem ol pikinini blong hem, mo olgeta man blong hem, gogo i no gat wan man nating i stap. Nao oli holem kantri ya blong hem i blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 21:35"/><verse eid="NUM 21:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22"/>
  <para style="s">King blong Moab i sanem tok i go long Balam blong i kam luk hem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1"/>Nao ol laen* blong Isrel* oli aot long ples ya, oli wokbaot i go, gogo oli mekem ples blong olgeta long bigfala levelples long Moab, long saed blong Jodan Reva long is, long ples ya we man i save lukluk stret i go long Jeriko.
<verse eid="NUM 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="2-7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2-7"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.2-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 31.8; 2 Pita 2.15,16; Jud 1.11</char></note>Nao long taem ya, King Balak we papa blong hem Jiporo, hem i king blong Moab, mo taem hem i harem ol samting ya we ol laen blong Isrel oli mekem long ol laen blong Amoro,* mo i save we olgeta oli plante we plante, hem wetem ol man blong hem oli fraet tumas, oli seksek. Nao olgeta oli go talem long ol lida blong ol man Midian se, “Ol man ya oli plante tumas, bambae i no longtaem oli spolem olgeta samting long ples ya blong yumi, olsem we bul i save flatem olgeta gudfala gras long open ples.”
</para>
  <para style="p">Nao hem i talem long ol lida blong hem, wetem ol lida blong ol man Midian se, “Yufala i go long kantri ya Amao, long taon ya Petoro, klosap long Yufretes Reva, yufala i singaot man ya Balam we papa blong hem Beo i kam. Bambae yufala i talemaot long hem, we i gat wan bigfala kampani we oli plante we plante, we oli aot long Ijip, oli kam stap klosap long yumi, mo oli kavremap olgeta ples ya finis. Mo yumi fraet se bambae oli tekem olgeta graon blong yumi, from we oli plante winim yumi. Mi mi wantem blong hem i kam givhan long mi, i singaot* trabol i kam long olgeta. Sipos hem i glad blong givhan, maet yumi save winim olgeta, yumi save ronemaot olgeta. Mi mi save we taem hem i blesem ol man, olgeta oli harem gud, mo taem hem i singaot trabol i kam long olgeta, trabol i mas kam kasem olgeta.”
</para>
  <para style="p">Nao ol lida ya oli tekem sam mane blong go givim long man ya, blong i kam singaot trabol i kam long ol laen blong Isrel, mo oli aot, oli go luk hem, mo oli talemaot tok ya blong king long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 22:2-7"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8"/>Nao hem i talem long olgeta se, “Ale, yufala i stap. Bambae yumi slip long ples ya. Nao sipos Hae God i talem wan tok long mi long naet, tumora bambae mi save talemaot long yufala.” Mo olgeta oli stap wetem hem long naet ya.
<verse eid="NUM 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9"/>Nao long naet ya, God i kamtru long hem, i askem long hem se, “?Ol man ya we oli stap wetem yu, oli kam wea?”
<verse eid="NUM 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10"/>Mo hem i talem se, “Olgeta oli kam long Moab ya. King Balak i sanem olgeta i kam blong talemaot long mi
<verse eid="NUM 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11"/>we i gat wan bigfala kampani we oli plante we plante, we oli aot long Ijip, oli kam stap klosap long ples blong hem. Olgeta oli kavremap olgeta ples ya, mo hem i wantem blong mi mi givhan long hem, mi go singaot trabol i kam long olgeta, blong hem i save go mekem faet long olgeta blong ronemaot olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12"/>Nao God i talem long hem se, “Bambae yu no go wetem olgeta ya, mo yu no mas singaot trabol i kam long ol man ya longwe, from we mi mi stap blesem olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13"/>Nao long moning, Balam i girap, i go luk ol man ya, mo i talem long olgeta se, “I moa gud yufala i gohom bakegen. Hae God i blokem mi se mi no save go wetem yufala.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14"/>Ale, olgeta oli gobak, oli talem se, “King, hem i talem se i no save kam.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15"/>Nao king i sanem ol narafala lida blong hem we oli hae moa, i winim olgeta we i sanem fastaem, mo oli plante moa, blong oli go bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16"/>Nao olgeta ya oli go luk Balam, mo oli talem long hem we king i talem se, “Plis yu no letem wan samting i blokem yu, blong yu no kam luk mi.
<verse eid="NUM 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17"/>Bambae mi mi pem yu we mi mekem yu yu kam rijman, mo sipos yu wantem wan samting bakegen, bambae mi mekem long yu olsem we yu yu talem. Plis yu givhan long mi, yu kam, yu singaot trabol i kam long olgeta ya.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18"/>Be hem i talem se, “Nating we sipos king i tekemaot olgeta gol mo silva we i stap long haos blong hem, i givim i kam long mi, be Hae God i God blong mi, mo mi bambae mi no save ova long tok blong hem. Nating we wan smol samting nomo, be mi no save brekem tok blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19"/>Be i moa gud yufala i slip long ples ya tede, olsem we olgeta ya we i kam fastaem oli mekem, blong mi save faenemaot se Hae God i gat narafala samting blong talem long mi no nogat.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20"/>Nao long naet ya, God i kamtru long Balam bakegen, i talem long hem se, “Olgeta ya oli kam blong singaot yu bakegen blong go wetem olgeta. I gud yu mekemrere, yu go, be bambae yu mekem stret olsem nomo we mi mi talem long yu.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21"/>Nao long moning, hem i mekemrere dongki blong hem, mo i biaen long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">God i kros long Balam mo i mekem dongki i toktok
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22"/>Nao Balam i sidaon long dongki blong hem, i wokbaot i go, mo tu man blong wok blong hem i stap wokbaot wetem hem. Be God i kros tumas from we hem i go, nao taem hem i stap wokbaot i go, enjel* blong Hae God i kam stanap long rod blong blokem hem.
<verse eid="NUM 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23"/>Nao enjel ya i holem naef blong faet, i stap stanap long rod, mo taem dongki ya i luk hem, hem i tanem hem, i gowe long rod, i go insaed long wan garen. Be Balam i wipim hem, i mekem i kambak long rod.
<verse eid="NUM 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24"/>Nao enjel i go stanap long ples we rod i kam smol, we i pas long medel blong tu plantesen grep,* we tufala i gat stonwol i blokem tufala, mo rod i pas long medel blong tufala stonwol ya.
<verse eid="NUM 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25"/>Mo taem dongki i luk enjel ya bakegen, hem i go wokbaot klosap long stonwol, mo leg blong Balam i pas long stonwol ya. Nao hem i wipim dongki ya bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26"/>Nao enjel i aot long ples ya bakegen, i go fastaem long tufala, i go stanap long wan ples we rod i kam smol moa, we i no moa gat rum blong dongki i pas.
<verse eid="NUM 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27"/>Mo taem dongki i luk enjel ya bakegen, hem i ledaon long bel blong hem. Nao Balam i kros gud long dongki ya, i gohed, i wipim hem long wokingstik blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28"/>Nao Hae God i letem dongki ya i toktok olsem man, nao i talem long Balam se, “?Mi mi mekem wanem samting long yu? Tri taem finis yu yu wipim mi. ?From wanem yu spolem mi olsem?”
<verse eid="NUM 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29"/>Mo Balam i talem se, “!From we yu stap mekem long mi olsem we mi mi krangke! Sipos mi holem naef blong faet blong mi, naoia nomo bambae mi kilim yu yu ded.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30"/>Be dongki i talem se, “!Yu luk! !Mi mi dongki blong yu nomo! !Taem yu yu wokbaot, oltaem nomo mi nao mi stap karem yu! ?Be yu save tingbaot we mi mekem olsem long yu samtaem?”
</para>
  <para style="p">Nao Balam i talem se, “No. I no gat.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31"/>Nao Hae God i letem Balam i luk enjel ya we i stap stanap long ples ya, i holem naef blong faet blong hem. Nao Balam i nildaon, i bodaon we fes blong hem i godaon, i kasem graon.
<verse eid="NUM 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32"/>Nao enjel ya i talem se, “!Balam! !Tri taem nao yu yu wipim dongki ya blong yu! ?From wanem yu stap mekem olsem? Mi mi kam blong blokem rod blong yu, from we yu mekem i nogud, yu hareap tumas blong kam.
<verse eid="NUM 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33"/>Be dongki ya blong yu i luk mi, nao tri taem, hem i gowe long rod. Sipos hem i no gowe olsem, bambae mi mi kilim yu yu ded, mi letem hem nomo i stap.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34"/>Nao Balam i talem se, “Sore, mi mi mekem i nogud ya. Mi no save we yu yu stap stanap long rod blong blokem mi olsem. Sipos yu ting se i no stret blong mi go, naoia bambae mi gohom bakegen.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35"/>Be enjel i talem se, “No, yu go wetem ol man ya, be bambae yu talem ol tok ya nomo we mi bambae mi talem long yu.” Nao Balam i biaen long olgeta, i go.
<verse eid="NUM 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">King Balak i mekem welkam long Balam
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36"/>Nao taem King Balak i harem we Balam i stap kam, hem i go long taon ya Ara blong mitim hem. Taon ya i stap long Anon Reva, we i mak blong graon blong kantri ya Moab.
<verse eid="NUM 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37"/>Nao hem i talem long hem se, “?From wanem yu no kam taem mi mi singaot yu fastaem? ?Yu ting se bambae mi no save pem yu?”
<verse eid="NUM 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38"/>Nao Balam i talem se, “Yes i tru, mi mi no kam fastaem, mi jes kam naoia, be mi no save talem wan samting blong givhan long yu. Mi mi save talem ol tok ya nomo we God i givim long mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39"/>Nao hem i go wetem king ya, tufala i gobak long taon ya Kiriatujot,
<verse eid="NUM 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40"/>mo long ples ya, king i kilim ol buluk mo sipsip blong hem blong mekem sakrefaes, mo i givim sam mit i go long Balam wetem ol haeman ya we oli stap wetem hem.
<verse eid="NUM 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fas tok we God i givim long Balam blong i talemaot long King Balak
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41"/>Nao long moning, King Balak i tekem Balam i go antap long hil ya Bamotbal, mo long ples ya, Balam i save luk haf blong ol laen* blong Isrel* ya we oli stap saed i kam.
<verse eid="NUM 22:41"/><verse eid="NUM 22:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23"/>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1"/>Nao hem i talem long king se, “King. Mi wantem blong yu wokem seven olta long ples ya, mo blong yu tekem seven bul mo seven man sipsip i kam long mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2-3"/>Nao king i mekem olsem we hem i talem, mo tufala i kilim ol bul mo ol man sipsip ya, mo tufala i bonem olgeta wanwan long ol seven olta ya, blong mekem sakrefaes ya we oli bonem i bon evriwan. Nao hem i talem long king se, “Yu stap klosap long ol sakrefaes ya fastaem, yu wet long mi. Mi bambae mi go longwe, blong traem luk se bambae Hae God i kam talem wan tok long mi no nogat. Sipos hem i kam talemaot wan tok long mi, bambae mi mi kam talemaot long yu.” Nao hem i wokbaot hem wan, i go antap long top blong hil ya, we i no gat bus, i ples nating nomo.
<verse eid="NUM 23:2-3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4"/>Nao God i kamtru long hem, mo Balam i talem long hem se, “Mi wokem seven olta, mo mi kilim seven bul mo seven man sipsip wanwan long olgeta finis, blong mekem sakrefaes, blong mekem wosip long yu.”
<verse eid="NUM 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5"/>Nao Hae God i talem tok blong hem long Balam, mo i sanem hem blong i go talemaot tok ya long king.
<verse eid="NUM 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6"/>Nao hem i gobak, i luk we king ya i stap stanap yet long ples ya we tufala i mekem ol sakrefaes ya long hem, mo ol lida blong ol man Moab oli stap wetem hem.
<verse eid="NUM 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7"/>Nao hem i talemaot tok ya we Hae God i talem long hem. Hem i talem se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“King Balak, // yu yu king blong Moab.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Yu yu tekem mi mi kam long ples ya.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Mi mi aot long kantri ya Siria, // long ples blong hil,
</para>
  <para style="q2">long saed long is.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Yu yu talem se mi kam, // mi givhan long yu,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mi singaot* trabol // i kam long ol laen blong Isrel ya,
</para>
  <para style="q3">blong oli go lus olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8"/>!Be yu luk!
</para>
  <para style="q1">!God i no singaot trabol // i kam long ol man ya!
</para>
  <para style="q1">?Olsem wanem // bambae mi mi save singaot trabol
</para>
  <para style="q2">i kam long olgeta?
</para>
  <para style="q1">!Hem i no talem nating // se bambae olgeta oli lus!
</para>
  <para style="q1">?Olsem wanem // bambae mi mi save talem wan tok olsem?
<verse eid="NUM 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9"/>Taem mi stanap // antap long bigfala klif ya we i hae,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mi save luk olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Taem mi stap // long top blong hil ya,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mi save wajem olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Olgeta i wan kampani nomo,
</para>
  <para style="q2">we oli no joen long ol narafala man.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Olgeta i save
</para>
  <para style="q2">we Hae God i stap blesem olgeta,
</para>
  <para style="q2">i winim // we i stap blesem ol narafala man.
<verse eid="NUM 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10"/>Olgeta oli plante we plante,
</para>
  <para style="q2">olsem asis blong graon nomo.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Olgeta oli plante tumas, // man i no save kaontem olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Olgeta ya oli man blong God, // mo prea blong mi // we laef blong mi bambae i finis
</para>
  <para style="q3">long gudfala fasin,
</para>
  <para style="q2">olsem we laef blong olgeta
</para>
  <para style="q3">bambae i finis.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Olgeta ya oli stret man nomo, // mo mi mi wantem tumas
</para>
  <para style="q2">se sipos mi mi ded, // be tingting blong mi
</para>
  <para style="q3">bambae i stap kwaet, // olsem we tingting blong olgeta ya
</para>
  <para style="q3">bambae i stap kwaet, // long taem we bambae oli ded.”
<verse eid="NUM 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11"/>Nao king i tok long hem, i talem se, “!Ei, yu yu no givhan long mi nating! !Mi mi tekem yu yu kam, blong yu singaot trabol i kam long ol enemi ya blong mi, be yu yu girap, yu blesem olgeta!”
<verse eid="NUM 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12"/>Be hem i talem se, “No, be mi mi no save talem narafala tok long yu, mi save talemaot ol tok ya nomo we Hae God i talem long mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Seken tok we Hae God i givim long Balam blong i talemaot long king
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13"/>Nao King Balak i talem long Balam se, “Yu kam, yumitufala i go long wan narafala ples we yu save luk smol haf nomo blong olgeta. Long ples ya nao bambae yu save givhan long mi, yu save singaot* trabol i kam long olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14"/>Nao hem i tekem hem i go long open ples ya long Jofim, long top blong hil ya Pisga. Nao long ples ya tu, hem i wokem seven olta, mo i kilim seven bul mo seven man sipsip mo i bonem olgeta wanwan long ol olta ya, blong mekem sakrefaes.
<verse eid="NUM 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15"/>Nao hem i talem long king se, “King. Yu stap klosap long ol sakrefaes ya fastaem, yu wet long mi. Mi bambae mi go longwe blong mit wetem God.”
<verse eid="NUM 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16"/>Nao Hae God i kamtru long hem, i talem tok blong hem long hem, mo i sanem hem blong i go talemaot tok ya long king.
<verse eid="NUM 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17"/>Nao hem i gobak, i luk we king ya i stap stanap yet long ples ya we hem i mekem ol sakrefaes ya long hem, mo ol lida ya blong ol man Moab oli stap wetem hem.
</para>
  <para style="p">Nao king i askem long hem se, “?Hae God i talem olsem wanem?”
<verse eid="NUM 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18"/>Mo hem i talemaot ol tok we Hae God i givim long hem. Hem i talem se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“King Balak.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Yu kam lesin long ol tok
</para>
  <para style="q3">we bambae mi mi talem.
<verse eid="NUM 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19"/>God i no olsem man,
</para>
  <para style="q2">we i save giaman, // hem i no olsem yumi,
</para>
  <para style="q2">we yumi save jenisim tok blong yumi.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Sipos hem i promes blong mekem wan samting, // be bambae hem i mas mekem.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Sipos hem i talem tok blong hem, // be wantaem nomo,
</para>
  <para style="q2">tok ya i mas kamtru.
<verse eid="NUM 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20-21"/>Hem i talem long mi
</para>
  <para style="q2">blong mi blesem ol laen* blong Isrel* ya, // mo taem hem i blesem olgeta, // mi mi no save blokem tok blong hem.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Ol samting we bambae i kasem olgeta,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mi mi luk finis.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Bambae oli no save kasem badlak, // mo trabol i no save kasem olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Hae God i God blong olgeta, // mo oltaem hem i stap wetem olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Oltaem olgeta oli stap talemaot // we hem i King blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 23:20-21"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22"/>Hem nao i stap lidim olgeta // oli aot long Ijip oli kam.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Long taem blong faet,
</para>
  <para style="q2">hem i stap givhan long olgeta, // i stap faet olsem wael bul, // we i no gat man i save blokem.
<verse eid="NUM 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23"/>I no gat man
</para>
  <para style="q2">i save wokem posen long olgeta ya, // mo i no gat kleva // we paoa blong hem i save spolem olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Naoia i taem // blong ol man oli tokbaot olgeta se,
</para>
  <para style="q2">‘!Yufala i kam luk!
</para>
  <para style="q2">!Hemia i wok blong God ya!’
<verse eid="NUM 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24"/>Olgeta ya oli strong tumas, // oli olsem bigfala laeon // we i kilim anamol blong i kakae,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mo i no save spel
</para>
  <para style="q3">gogo i terem long ol smosmol pis, // nao i gohed i kakae, // gogo i finisim mit blong hem,
</para>
  <para style="q3">mo i stap dring blad blong hem // gogo i finisim evriwan.”
<verse eid="NUM 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25"/>Nao king i tok long hem, i talem se, “!Ei, sipos yu no save singaot trabol i kam long olgeta, be plis yu no mekem wan samting blong blesem olgeta!”
<verse eid="NUM 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26"/>Be hem i talem se, “Mi mi talem finis se mi mas mekem ol samting ya nomo we Hae God i talem long mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Namba tri tok we Hae God i givim long Balam blong i talemaot long King
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27"/>Nao King Balak i talem bakegen se, “Yu kam, yumitufala i go long wan narafala ples. Long ples ya, maet God bambae i glad blong letem yu yu givhan long mi, yu singaot* trabol i kam long olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28"/>Nao tufala i go antap long top blong hil ya Peoro we man i save lukluk i go long draeples.
<verse eid="NUM 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29"/>Nao Balam i talem long hem se, “King. Mi wantem blong yu wokem seven olta long ples ya, mo bambae yu tekem seven bul mo seven man sipsip i kam.”
<verse eid="NUM 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30"/>Nao king i mekem olsem we hem i talem, mo i kilim ol bul mo ol man sipsip ya, i bonem olgeta wanwan long ol seven olta ya, blong mekem sakrefaes.
<verse eid="NUM 23:30"/><verse eid="NUM 23:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24"/>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1"/>Long taem ya Balam i save finis we Hae God i wantem blong i blesem ol laen* blong Isrel,* nao hem i no go blong lukaot saen bakegen, olsem we i mekem tu taem finis. Hem i tanem hem, i lukluk i go long draeples,
<verse eid="NUM 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2"/>long ples ya we olgeta oli putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta long hem folem ol twelef laen blong olgeta. Mo taem hem i luk olgeta, Spirit blong God i kam long hem,
<verse eid="NUM 24:2"/><verse number="3-5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3-5"/>mo hem i talemaot tok we God i givim long hem.<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">24.3-5: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Narafala rod blong tanem tok long las haf blong vas 2 i olsem. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mo taem hem i luk olgeta, <char style="bd" closed="true">paoa</char> blong God i kam long hem, <char style="fv" closed="true">3-5</char> mo hem i talemaot tok we God i givim long hem.</char></note> Hem i talem se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“!Ol laen blong Isrel!
</para>
  <para style="q1">Mi Balam we papa blong mi Beo, // mo tok blong mi i olsem.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Mi mi save lukluk i go longwe, // mo mi save harem ol tok
</para>
  <para style="q2">we God i stap talem.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Hem i gat olgeta paoa, // mo naoia,
</para>
  <para style="q2">we i olsem we mi mi hafslip, // be ae blong mi i stap open bigwan, // mi mi luk wan vison*
</para>
  <para style="q2">we hem i soemaot long mi.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Ol haos tapolen blong yufala // oli naes we i naes.
<verse eid="NUM 24:3-5"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6"/>Oli laenap gud, // olsem ol longlongfala laen blong pamtri.*
</para>
  <para style="q1">Oli olsem ol garen // we oli stap klosap long reva.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Oli olsem ol tri ya alos* // we Hae God i planem olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Oli olsem ol bigbigfala tri ya sida,* // we oli stap gru long saed blong wota.
<verse eid="NUM 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7"/>Long ples blong yufala,
</para>
  <para style="q2">bambae yufala i no save sot long ren, // nao bambae yufala i save planem // ol kakae blong yufala
</para>
  <para style="q2">we graon blong garen blong yufala
</para>
  <para style="q3">bambae i sofsof gud.
</para>
  <para style="q1">King blong yufala bambae i hae moa
</para>
  <para style="q2">i winim King Agag, // mo hem bambae i rul long olgeta ples.
<verse eid="NUM 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8"/>God i stap lidim yufala // i aot long Ijip i kam, // mo long taem blong faet, // hem i stap givhan long yufala,
</para>
  <para style="q2">i stap faet olsem wael bul,
</para>
  <para style="q3">we i no gat man i save blokem hem.
</para>
  <para style="q1">From samting ya, // yufala i stap flatemgud ol enemi blong yufala,
</para>
  <para style="q2">yufala i stap brebrekem ol bun blong olgeta, // mo yufala i stap smasem ol ara blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.9 a: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jen 49.9; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jen 12.3</char></note>Yufala i olsem wan laeon
</para>
  <para style="q2">we i strong tumas, // no wan woman laeon,
</para>
  <para style="q2">we taem hem i slip, // i no gat man i save go wekemap hem.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Sipos man i blesem yufala,
</para>
  <para style="q2">God bambae i blesem hem, // be sipos man i singaot trabol // i kam long yufala,
</para>
  <para style="q2">God bambae i singaot trabol
</para>
  <para style="q3">i kam long hem.”
<verse eid="NUM 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10"/>Nao king ya i kros tumas, i taetem han blong hem, i talem long hem se, “!Mi mi tekem yu yu kam long ples ya blong yu singaot trabol i kam long ol enemi ya blong mi, be nogat! !Tri taem nao, we yu girap, yu blesem olgeta nomo!
<verse eid="NUM 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11"/>!Yu aot long ples ya! !Yu gohom! !Mi mi promes blong pem yu, be nogat! !Yu no save tekem pei blong yu, from we Hae God i blokem yu!”
<verse eid="NUM 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12"/>Be hem i talem long king se, “King. Mi mi talem finis long ol man ya we yu sanem olgeta i kam long mi,
<verse eid="NUM 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13"/>se nating we sipos yu tekemaot olgeta gol mo silva we i stap long haos blong yu, yu givim i kam long mi, be bambae mi mi no save ova long tok blong Hae God. Mi mi no save mekem wan samting nating we i kamaot long tingting blong mi nomo, mi mas talemaot ol tok ya nomo we hem i talem long mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Las tok we Hae God i givim long Balam blong i talemaot long king
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14"/>Nao Balam i talem long king se, “Naoia bambae mi gohom, be fastaem, mi wantem talemaot long yu, se ol samting we ol laen* blong Isrel* ya bambae oli mekem long ol man ples blong yu i olsem.”
<verse eid="NUM 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15"/>Nao hem i talemaot tok we Hae God i givim long hem. Hem i talem se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“Mi Balam, // mo tok blong mi i olsem.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Mi mi save lukluk i go longwe,
<verse eid="NUM 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16"/>mo mi save harem ol tok
</para>
  <para style="q2">we God i stap talem.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Hem i hae we i hae, // mo mi save kasem ol waes
</para>
  <para style="q2">we i kamaot long hem.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Hem i gat olgeta paoa, // mo naoia,
</para>
  <para style="q2">we i olsem we mi mi hafslip, // be ae blong mi i stap open bigwan,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mi mi luk wan vison*
</para>
  <para style="q3">we hem i soemaot long mi.
<verse eid="NUM 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17"/>Mi mi stap lukluk ol laen blong Isrel, // mo mi luk we long fiuja
</para>
  <para style="q2">bambae i gat wan king // i kamaot biaen long olgeta,
</para>
  <para style="q3">olsem wan sta we i kamaot // we i saen we i saen.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Hem bambae i aot long Isrel i kam // olsem we wan bigfala sta we i gat tel blong hem,
</para>
  <para style="q2">i kamaot.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Hem bambae i kam kilim
</para>
  <para style="q2">ol lida blong yufala oli ded, // mo bambae i smasem hed // blong ol laen blong Set.
<verse eid="NUM 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18"/>Ol man Edom bambae oli agens long hem, // be hem bambae i kam mekem faet long olgeta, // i winim olgeta,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mo i tekemaot ol graon blong olgeta,
</para>
  <para style="q3">i holem i blong hem.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Nao oltaem, ol laen ya blong Isrel // bambae oli stap win,
<verse eid="NUM 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2"><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19"/>oltaem bambae oli stap purumpurumbut
</para>
  <para style="q2">long ol enemi blong olgeta, // gogo oli flatemdaon olgeta,
</para>
  <para style="q3">we bambae i no moa gat wan i stap.”
<verse eid="NUM 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20"/>Nao long vison ya we hem i luk, hem i luk ol laen blong Amalek, nao i talemaot tok we Hae God i givim long hem. Hem i talem se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“!Ol laen blong Amalek!
</para>
  <para style="q1">Fastaem, yufala i strong moa
</para>
  <para style="q2">winim ol narafala kantri, // be long fiuja, // bambae yufala i lus olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21-22"/>Nao bakegen long vison ya, hem i luk ol laen blong Ken, mo i talemaot tok we Hae God i givim long hem. Hem i talem se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“!Ol laen blong Ken!
</para>
  <para style="q1">Ples ya we yufala i stap long hem,
</para>
  <para style="q2">hem i wan sefples ya.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Hem i olsem nes blong pijin, // we i stap antap long wan klif
</para>
  <para style="q2">we i hae tumas.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Be taem ol man Asiria oli kam holem yufala, // nao yufala i kam slef* blong olgeta,
</para>
  <para style="q2">bambae olgeta oli spolemgud yufala.”
<verse eid="NUM 24:21-22"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23"/>Mo bakegen, hem i talemaot wan narafala tok we Hae God i givim long hem, i talem se,
</para>
  <para style="q1">“?Be ol man ya // we oli stap hivap long not,
</para>
  <para style="q2">oli kam wea?
<verse eid="NUM 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1"><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24"/>Olgeta ya oli aot // long aelan ya Saepras longwe.
</para>
  <para style="q1">Bambae oli sel i kam,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mo bambae oli kamso long ples ya, // nao bambae oli kam mekem faet
</para>
  <para style="q2">long ol man Asiria // mo ol laen blong Eba,
</para>
  <para style="q2">mo bambae oli winim olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="q2">Be biaen, // olgeta ya tu bambae oli lus olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25"/>Nao biaen, hem i girap, i gobak long ples blong hem, mo king tu i wokbaot i gohom.
<verse eid="NUM 24:25"/><verse eid="NUM 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25"/>
  <para style="s">Ol laen blong Isrel oli stap long Peoro
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1"/>Nao long taem ya, ol laen* blong Isrel* oli mekem ples blong olgeta long bigfala levelples ya Kasis, long medel blong ol hil. Mo ol man blong olgeta oli stat blong go slip wetem ol woman Moab.
<verse eid="NUM 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2"/>Ol woman ya oli stap singaot olgeta blong oli go long ol lafet blong olgeta, we oli stap mekem sakrefaes blong mekem wosip long ol god blong olgeta. Mo ol man ya oli stap kakae ol kakae blong ol sakrefaes ya, mo oli stap mekem wosip tu long god ya
<verse eid="NUM 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3"/>Bal* we i god blong ol man Peoro. Nao from samting ya, Hae God i kros tumas long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4"/>Nao hem i talem long Moses se, “Yu singaot olgeta lida blong ol laen blong yufala oli kam, nao yu kilim olgeta evriwan oli ded long fes blong olgeta man, stret olsem we mi mi talem, blong mi mi no moa save kros long yufala bakegen.”
<verse eid="NUM 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5"/>Nao Moses i singaot ol lida we hem i bin jusumaot olgeta blong jajem ol man, i talem long olgeta se, “Yufala i go kilim olgeta man ya long ol laen blong yufala wanwan, we oli stap mekem wosip long god ya Bal, we i god blong ol man Peoro.”
<verse eid="NUM 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6"/>Nao Moses wetem ol man oli stap stanap long doa blong Haos Tapolen blong Hae God, oli stap krae. Mo long taem ya, wan long olgeta i tekem wan woman Midian i go long haos tapolen blong hem, stret long fes blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7"/>Nao i gat wan pris i stap we nem blong hem Finehas, we papa long hem Hae Pris Eleasara, mo bubu blong hem Hae Pris Eron, mo taem hem i luk tufala ya, hem i girap, i aot long olgeta ya we oli stap, i go tekem spia blong hem,
<verse eid="NUM 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8"/>nao i biaen long tufala. Hem i go insaed long haos tapolen blong man ya, nao i sperem tufala ya, mo spia i gotru long tufala wantaem i kasem graon. Long fasin ya, hem i blokem rabis sik we i stap spolem ol man, nao sik ya i finis.
<verse eid="NUM 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9"/>Be sik ya i kilim twanti fo taosen man finis oli ded.
<verse eid="NUM 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11"/>“From we pris i mekem samting ya, naoia kros blong mi i finis, mi no moa kros long yufala. Fastaem mi mi kros tumas long yufala, be hem i blokem yufala blong yufala i no moa mekem wosip long narafala god ya, yufala i mekem wosip long mi nomo, nao from samting ya, mi mi no spolem yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12"/>From samting ya, bambae yu talem long hem we mi mi mekem wan promes* wetem hem naoia, se bambae mitufala i stap fren gud olwe, gogo i no save finis.
<verse eid="NUM 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13"/>Hem i pris, mo naoia mi mi promes long hem se nem ya bambae i no save lus long hem samtaem, mo ol pikinini blong hem wetem olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long hem bambae oli holem nem ya tu, gogo i no save finis. Yufala i man blong mi, mo hem i blokem yufala blong i no gat wan long yufala i save go mekem wosip long narafala god, mo i mekem rod blong mi mi fogivim yufala, mi tekemaot ol sin blong yufala. From samting ya, nem ya pris bambae i no save lus long olgeta samtaem.”
<verse eid="NUM 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14"/>Man ya we pris i kilim hem i ded wetem woman Midian ya, nem blong hem Simri we papa blong hem Salu, we Salu ya i hed blong wan laen blong Simeon.*
<verse eid="NUM 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15"/>Mo woman ya, nem blong hem Kosbi we papa blong hem Juru, we Juru ya i lida blong wan laen blong ol man Midian.
<verse eid="NUM 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17"/>“Ale, yufala i girap, yufala i go mekem faet long ol man Midian ya. Yufala i mas kilim olgeta i ded,
<verse eid="NUM 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18"/>from fasin nogud ya we oli mekem long yufala, we oli giaman long yufala long Peoro, mo from woman ya we pris ya i kilim hem i ded long taem ya we rabis sik ya i kasem yufala long ples ya.”
<verse eid="NUM 25:18"/><verse eid="NUM 25:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26"/>
  <para style="s">Namba tu sensas we oli mekem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 1.1-46</char></note>Nao biaen long taem ya we rabis sik ya i finis, Hae God i talem long Moses mo Hae Pris Eleasara we papa blong hem Eron se,
<verse eid="NUM 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2"/>“Yutufala i mas mekem sensas blong kaontem olgeta man ya we i laen* blong Isrel,* we yia blong olgeta i kasem twanti i go antap, we oli naf finis blong go long faet. Bambae yutufala i mas folem nem blong ol stamba blong olgeta blong kaontem olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 26:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3-4"/>Nao tufala i mekem olsem we hem i talem. Olgeta oli stap long bigfala levelples ya long Moab, klosap long Jodan Reva, we taon ya Jeriko i stap narasaed i go, nao tufala i singaot olgeta man we yia blong olgeta i kasem mak ya oli kam wanples, nao tufala i kaontem olgeta.
</para>
  <para style="p">Nao ol twelef laen blong Isrel we bifo oli aot long Ijip oli kam, taem olgeta oli kam kasem ples ya, namba blong olgeta i olsem.
<verse eid="NUM 26:3-4"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5-7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5-7"/>Ruben,* we i fasbon pikinini blong Isrel, hem i gat fo pikinini boe blong hem, we nem blong olgeta, Hanok mo Palu mo Hesron mo Kami. Nao long laen blong Ruben, i gat ol laen blong Hanok, mo ol laen blong Palu, mo ol laen blong Hesron, mo ol laen blong Kami, mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i gat foti tri taosen seven handred toti.
<verse eid="NUM 26:5-7"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8"/>Nao long laen blong Palu, i gat Eliab,
<verse eid="NUM 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9"/>wetem trifala pikinini blong hem, Nemuel, mo Datan, mo Abiram. Datan mo Abiram, hemia tufala ya we olgeta oli jusumaot tufala blong tufala i lida blong olgeta, be tufala i agens long Moses mo Hae Pris Eron, nao tufala i joen long Kora olgeta taem oli girap, oli agens long Hae God.
<verse eid="NUM 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10"/>Nao long taem ya we faea i kilim Kora wetem tu handred fifti man blong hem oli ded, graon i open, i solemdaon tufala ya, nao tufala oli ded wetem Kora olgeta. Tufala ya i kam olsem wan saen long olgeta man blong wekemap olgeta blong oli no agens long Hae God.
<verse eid="NUM 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11"/>Be ol pikinini blong Kora oli no ded long taem ya.
<verse eid="NUM 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12-14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12-14"/>Mo Simeon* i gat faef pikinini boe blong hem we nem blong olgeta, Nemuel, mo Jamin, mo Jakin, mo Sera, mo Saol. Nao long laen blong Simeon, i gat ol laen blong Nemuel, mo ol laen blong Jamin, mo ol laen blong Jakin, mo ol laen blong Sera, mo ol laen blong Saol, mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem twanti tu taosen, tu handred.
<verse eid="NUM 26:12-14"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15"/>Mo long sem fasin, long laen blong Gad,* i gat ol laen blong Jefon, mo ol laen blong Hagi, mo ol laen blong Suni,
<verse eid="NUM 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16"/>mo ol laen blong Osni, mo ol laen blong Eri,
<verse eid="NUM 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17"/>mo ol laen blong Arod, mo ol laen blong Areheli,
<verse eid="NUM 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18"/>mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem foti taosen, faef handred.
<verse eid="NUM 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="19-22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19-22"/>Mo long laen blong Juda,* i gat ol laen blong Sela, mo ol laen blong Peres, mo ol laen blong Sera. Mo long laen blong Peres ya, i gat ol laen blong Hesron mo ol laen blong Hamul. Mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem seventi sikis taosen, faef handred. Mo i gat tu narafala pikinini blong Juda bakegen, we tufala i ded bifo olgeta, long Kenan,* we nem blong wan Ere, mo nem blong narawan Onan, be i no gat ol laen blong tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 26:19-22"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23"/>Mo long laen blong Isakara,* i gat ol laen blong Tola, mo ol laen blong Pua,
<verse eid="NUM 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24"/>mo ol laen blong Jasub, mo ol laen blong Simron,
<verse eid="NUM 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25"/>mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem sikisti fo taosen, tri handred.
<verse eid="NUM 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26"/>Mo long laen blong Sebulun,* i gat ol laen blong Sered, mo ol laen blong Elon mo ol laen blong Jalehel,
<verse eid="NUM 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27"/>mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem sikisti taosen, faef handred.
<verse eid="NUM 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28"/>Nao pikinini blong Isrel ya Josef, hem i gat tu pikinini boe blong hem, we nem blong tufala Manase* mo Efrem.*
<verse eid="NUM 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="29-32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29-32"/>Mo Manase i gat pikinini boe blong hem we nem blong hem Makiri, mo Makiri i gat pikinini boe blong hem we nem blong hem Gilead, mo Gilead i gat ol pikinini boe blong hem we nem blong olgeta, Jesa, mo Helek, mo Asriel, mo Sekem, mo Semida, mo Hefa. Nao long laen blong Manase, i gat ol laen blong Makiri, mo long laen blong Makiri, i gat ol laen blong Gilead, mo long laen blong Gilead, i gat ol laen blong Jesa, mo ol laen blong Helek, mo ol laen blong Asriel, mo ol laen blong Sekem, mo ol laen blong Semida, mo ol laen blong Hefa.
<verse eid="NUM 26:29-32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33"/>Mo long laen blong Hefa ya, i gat wan man we nem blong hem Jelofehad. Hem i no gat pikinini boe blong hem, i gat ol gel nomo, we nem blong olgeta, Mala, mo Noa, mo Hoglaha, mo Milka, mo Tijaha.
<verse eid="NUM 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34"/>Mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem fifti tu taosen, seven handred.
<verse eid="NUM 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35"/>Mo long laen blong Efrem, i gat ol laen blong Sutela, mo ol laen blong Bekere, mo ol laen blong Tahan.
<verse eid="NUM 26:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36"/>Mo long laen blong Sutela ya, i gat ol laen blong Eran.
<verse eid="NUM 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37"/>Mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem toti tu taosen faef handred.
</para>
  <para style="p">Hemia nao olgeta laen blong Josef.
<verse eid="NUM 26:37"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38"/>Mo long laen blong Benjamin,* i gat ol laen blong Bela, mo ol laen blong Asbel, mo ol laen blong Ahiram,
<verse eid="NUM 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39"/>mo ol laen blong Sefufam, mo ol laen blong Hufam.
<verse eid="NUM 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40"/>Mo long laen blong Bela ya, i gat ol laen blong Ad mo ol laen blong Nahaman.
<verse eid="NUM 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41"/>Mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem foti faef taosen sikis handred.
<verse eid="NUM 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42"/>Mo long laen blong Dan,* i gat ol laen blong Husim,
<verse eid="NUM 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43"/>mo namba blong olgeta ya, i kasem sikisti fo taosen fo handred.
<verse eid="NUM 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44"/>Mo long laen blong Asere,* i gat ol laen blong Jimnaha, mo ol laen blong Jisvi, mo ol laen blong Beria.
<verse eid="NUM 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45"/>Mo long laen blong Beria ya, i gat ol laen blong Heba, mo ol laen blong Malkiel.
<verse eid="NUM 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46"/>Asere ya, hem i gat wan gel tu, we nem blong hem Sera.
<verse eid="NUM 26:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47"/>Mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem fifti tri taosen fo handred.
<verse eid="NUM 26:47"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48"/>Mo long laen blong Naftali,* i gat ol laen blong Jajehel, mo ol laen blong Guni,
<verse eid="NUM 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49"/>mo ol laen blong Jeja, mo ol laen blong Silem,
<verse eid="NUM 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50"/>mo namba blong olgeta evriwan i kasem foti faef taosen fo handred.
<verse eid="NUM 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51"/>Nao long taem ya, namba blong olgeta laen blong Isrel evriwan we oli man, mo we oli naf blong faet, i kasem sikis handred wan taosen, seven handred toti.
<verse eid="NUM 26:51"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 34.13; Jos 14.1,2</char></note>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53"/>“Moses. Ol graon ya we bambae mi mi givim i go long yufala, bambae yufala i mas seraot i go long ol laen ya blong yufala, folem ol namba blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 26:53"/><verse number="54-56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54-56"/>Bigfala graon bambae i go long laen we i gat plante man long hem, mo smol graon bambae i go long laen we i no gat plante man long hem. Be yufala i mas sakem ol spesel ston* blong faenemaot se wanem graon bambae i go long wanem laen.”
<verse eid="NUM 26:54-56"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57"/>Nao long laen blong Livae,* i gat ol laen blong Geson, mo ol laen blong Kohat, mo ol laen blong Merari.
<verse eid="NUM 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58"/>Mo long ol laen ya, i gat ol laen blong Libni, mo ol laen blong Hebron, mo ol laen blong Mali, mo ol laen blong Musi, mo ol laen blong Kora. Nao long laen blong Kohat, i gat wan man bifo we nem blong hem Amram,
<verse eid="NUM 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59"/>mo hem i tekem wan woman we i laen blong Livae we nem blong hem Jokebed. Woman ya i bon long Ijip, mo tufala i bonem tri pikinini, wan gel, we nem blong hem Miriam, mo tu boe, we nem blong tufala Eron mo Moses.
<verse eid="NUM 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.60: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 3.2</char></note>Nao Eron ya i kam hae pris, mo hem i gat fo pikinini boe blong hem, we nem blong olgeta, Nadab, mo Abihu, mo Eleasara, mo Itamara.
<verse eid="NUM 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Lev 10.1,2; Nam 3.4</char></note>Be Nadab mo Abihu, tufala i ded long taem ya we tufala i bonem insens* long faea we i no tabu blong givim i go long Hae God.
<verse eid="NUM 26:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62"/>Nao namba blong olgeta laen blong Livae we oli man, mo oli gat wan manis no antap long hem, i kasem twanti tri taosen. Be tufala i no kaontem olgeta ya wetem ol narafala laen ya, tufala i putum olgeta long wan narafala lis, from we olgeta ya, Hae God i talem finis se bambae oli no save holem graon long kantri ya we hem bambae i givim long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 26:62"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63"/>Long taem ya we ol laen blong Isrel oli stap long bigfala levelples ya long Moab, klosap long Jodan Reva, we taon ya Jeriko i stap narasaed i go, Moses mo hae pris, tufala i raetemdaon nem blong ol man blong olgeta, folem ol laen blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64"/>Be ol man we oli stap long ol lis blong sensas ya we Moses mo Hae Pris Eron, tufala i bin mekem bifo long draeples long Sinae, i no moa gat wan long olgeta nating i stap long ol niufala lis ya,
<verse eid="NUM 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.65: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 14.26-35</char></note>from we Hae God i talem finis se olgeta evriwan bambae i ded long draeples, nao olgeta evriwan oli ded. Keleb we papa blong hem Jefune, mo Josua we papa blong hem Nun, tufala ya nomo i stap.
<verse eid="NUM 26:65"/><verse eid="NUM 26:65"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27"/>
  <para style="s">Ol dota blong Jelofehad
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1-3"/>Nao i gat wan man we i ded bifo long draeples, we nem blong hem Jelofehad. Hem i gat faef dota blong hem we nem blong olgeta, Mala, mo Noa, mo Hoglaha, mo Milka, mo Tijaha. Jelofehad ya, hem i laen* blong Hefa, mo Hefa i kamaot long laen blong Gilead we papa blong hem Makiri. Mo Makiri ya, papa blong hem Manase,* we papa blong hem Josef ya bifo. Nao wan taem, Moses, wetem Hae Pris Eleasara, mo ol lida blong olgeta, mo ol narafala man oli stap long doa blong Haos Tapolen ya we oli stap kam long hem blong mit wetem Hae God. Nao ol woman ya oli kam luk olgeta, oli talem se, “Olgeta. Papa blong mifala i no gat wan pikinini boe blong hem. Hem i ded long draeples, be hem i no wan long olgeta ya we oli biaen long Kora, we oli girap agens long Hae God. Hem i ded from ol sin blong hem nomo.
<verse eid="NUM 27:1-3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4"/>?Hem i no gat pikinini boe blong hem, be from wanem nem blong hem bambae i mas lus long yumi? Mifala i wantem se taem yufala i givim graon long ol famle blong papa blong mifala, bambae yufala i makemaot haf i blong mifala.”
<verse eid="NUM 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5"/>Nao Moses i go talemaot tingting ya blong olgeta long Hae God,
<verse eid="NUM 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6"/>mo Hae God i talem long hem se,
<verse eid="NUM 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 36.2</char></note>“Samting ya we olgeta oli askem i stret ya. Sipos yufala i givim graon long ol famle blong papa blong olgeta, bambae yufala i mas makemaot haf i blong olgeta. Graon we i blong go long olfala blong olgeta, bambae i mas go long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 27:7"/><verse number="8-11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8-11"/>Mi mi Hae God, mi God blong yufala, mo tok blong mi long poen ya i olsem. Sipos man i ded we i no gat pikinini boe blong hem, graon blong hem bambae i mas go long ol dota blong hem. Mo sipos i no gat dota blong hem, bambae graon ya i mas go long ol stret brata blong hem. Sipos i no gat stret brata blong hem, bambae graon ya i mas go long ol stret brata blong papa blong hem. Be sipos i no gat stret brata blong papa blong hem tu, ale, graon ya blong hem bambae i mas go long wan laen blong hem we i klosap moa long hem, mo man ya bambae i save holem olsem graon blong hem stret. Yu mas talemaot tok ya blong mi long olgeta man ya, mo oltaem, bambae yufala i mas folem loa ya, stret olsem we mi mi talem long yu.”
<verse eid="NUM 27:8-11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hae God i jusumaot Josua blong i tekem ples blong Moses
</para>
  <para style="r">(Dutronome 31.1-8)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Dut 3.23-27; 32.48-52</char></note>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se, “Moses. Yu go antap long bigfala hil ya Abarim, yu lukluk i go long olgeta ples long kantri ya we bambae mi mi givim i go long yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13"/>Taem yu luklukgud olgeta ples ya finis, bambae yu yu ded olsem we brata blong yu Hae Pris Eron i ded bifo.
<verse eid="NUM 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14"/>Bambae yu tu yu ded, from we bifo, long draeples, long springwota ya Meriba, taem we olgeta man oli stap tok agens long mi, be yutufala tu i girap, yutufala i agens long tok blong mi, yutufala i no talemaot long fes blong olgeta we mi mi tabu, mi gat paoa.” (Springwota ya Meriba, hem i stap long draeples ya Jin, klosap long ples ya Kades.)
<verse eid="NUM 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15"/>Nao Moses i prea, i talem se,
<verse eid="NUM 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16"/>“Hae God, yu yu stamba blong laef. Olgeta man oli kasem laef long yu nomo. Plis yu jusumaot wan man we bambae i save lidim ol man ya,
<verse eid="NUM 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">1 King 22.17; Esik 34.5; Mat 9.36; Mak 6.34</char></note>mo i save givim tok long olgeta long taem blong faet, blong ol man ya blong yu oli no save stap olsem ol sipsip we i no gat man blong lukaot long olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18-19"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.18-19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 24.13</char></note>Nao Hae God i talem long hem se, “Josua we papa blong hem Nun, hem i wan man we paoa blong mi i stap long hem.<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">27.18-19: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Narafala rod blong tanem fas haf blong tok ya blong Hae God i olsem. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Josua we papa blong hem Nun, hem i wan man we <char style="bd" closed="true">Spirit</char> blong mi i stap long hem.</char></note> Bambae yu tekem hem i kam stanap long fes blong Hae Pris Eleasara wetem olgeta man, nao yu putum han blong yu long hed blong hem, yu prea long hem. Nao long fes blong olgeta man, bambae yu talemaot we hem bambae i tekem ples blong yu.
<verse eid="NUM 27:18-19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20"/>Bambae yu letem hem i karem hae nem blong yu, blong ol man ya oli save tinghevi long hem, oli save obei long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 28.30; 1 Saml 14.41; 28.6</char></note>Hae pris ya bambae i stap yusum tufala spesel ston ya Yurim* mo Tumim* blong faenemaot ol samting we mi mi wantem, mo Josua bambae i mas folem ol tok we hem i talem. Nao long fasin ya, bambae hae pris ya i stap lidim hem wetem ol narafala man long evri samting we oli stap mekem.”
<verse eid="NUM 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22"/>Nao Moses i mekem olsem we Hae God i talem long hem. Hem i tekem Josua i kam stanap long fes blong hae pris ya wetem olgeta man ya,
<verse eid="NUM 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Dut 31.23</char></note>nao i putum han blong hem long hed blong hem, i prea long hem, mo i talemaot long olgeta man we hem bambae i tekem ples blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 27:23"/><verse eid="NUM 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28"/>
  <para style="s">Ol kakae we ol laen blong Isrel oli mas givim blong mekem wosip long Hae God
</para>
  <para style="r">(Eksodas 29.38-46)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1"/>Nao Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses
<verse eid="NUM 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2"/>blong i go talemaot long ol laen* blong Isrel.* Hem i talem se, “Oltaem long stret taem blong mekem sakrefaes, bambae yufala i mas bonem ol kakae long Olta blong givim i kam long mi, blong mekem wosip long mi, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem. Ol rul blong ol sakrefaes ya bambae i olsem.”
<verse eid="NUM 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol kakae we i blong bonem wetem tufala sakrefaes ya we olgeta oli mas mekem evri dei
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3-4"/>“Evri dei, bambae yufala i mas kilim tu smol man sipsip, we tufala evriwan i gat wan yia blong tufala, mo yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes ya long tufala we i blong bonem i bon evriwan. Fasin ya yufala i mas mekem oltaem nomo, we wan long tufala, yufala i mekem sakrefaes long hem long moning, mo narawan, yufala i mekem long sapa. Mo kakae we yufala i mas bonem wetem tufala blong givim i kam long mi i olsem.
<verse eid="NUM 28:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5"/>Long moning, taem yufala i bonem fas sipsip ya, yufala i mas tekem wan kilo flaoa we oli wokem long wit* we i beswan, mo yufala i mas tantanem wetem wan lita olifoel* we i beswan, nao yufala i bonem wetem sipsip ya.
<verse eid="NUM 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6"/>Sakrefaes ya, mi mi talemaot tok blong hem long yufala bifo, long taem ya we yufala i stap long hil ya Sinae, mo bambae yufala i mas mekem evri dei nomo. Bambae yufala i mas bonem i bon evriwan, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7"/>Mo taem yufala i mekem sakrefaes ya, bambae yufala i mas kafsaedem wan lita waen tu i go long Olta, blong givim i kam long mi.
<verse eid="NUM 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8"/>Mo long sapa, taem yufala i mekem sakrefaes long seken sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas givim sem kakae ya bakegen, olsem we yufala i givim long moning. Ol kakae ya, hem i wan presen we yufala i bonem blong givim i kam long mi, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.”
<verse eid="NUM 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol kakae we i blong bonem wetem ol spesel sakrefaes ya we oli mas mekem long Sabat dei
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9"/>Nao Hae God i talem se, “Mo oltaem long Sabat* dei, bambae yufala i mas mekem narafala sakrefaes bakegen long mi. Bambae yufala i mas kilim tu man sipsip we tufala evriwan i gat wan yia nomo blong tufala, mo tufala i no gat wan samting i rong long bodi blong tufala. Mo wetem tufala sipsip ya, yufala i mas bonem tu kilo flaoa we yufala i tantanem wetem olifoel,* mo yufala i mas kafsaedem waen tu i go wetem tufala long Olta.
<verse eid="NUM 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10"/>Sakrefaes ya, yufala i mas bonem i bon evriwan, mo yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes olsem evri taem long Sabat dei, antap long tu narafala sakrefaes ya we yufala i mas mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i mas kafsaedem i go long Olta wetem tufala.”
<verse eid="NUM 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol kakae we i blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya we oli mas mekem long fas dei blong manis
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11"/>Nao Hae God i talem se, “Mo oltaem, long fas dei* blong manis, bambae yufala i mas mekem ol narafala sakrefaes bakegen long mi. Bambae yufala i mas kilim tu yang bul, mo wan man sipsip, mo seven smol man sipsip we oli gat wan yia blong olgeta, mo olgeta anamol ya evriwan oli no mas gat wan samting i rong long bodi blong olgeta. Ol anamol ya, yufala i mas bonem olgeta oli bon evriwan.
<verse eid="NUM 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12"/>Nao wetem tufala bul ya, yufala i mas bonem sikis kilo flaoa we yufala i tantanem wetem olifoel,* tri kilo wetem wan, tri kilo wetem wan, mo wetem man sipsip ya, yufala i mas bonem tu kilo flaoa olsem bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13"/>Mo wetem ol seven smol sipsip ya, yufala i mas bonem seven kilo flaoa olsem bakegen, wan kilo wetem wan, wan kilo wetem wan. Ol kakae ya, hem i wan presen we yufala i mas bonem i bon evriwan blong givim i kam long mi, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14"/>Mo waen we i stret blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya i olsem. Wetem tufala bul ya, yufala i mas kafsaedem fo lita waen i go long Olta, tu lita wetem wan, tu lita wetem wan, mo wetem man sipsip ya, wan lita haf. Mo wetem ol seven smol sipsip ya, yufala i mas kafsaedem seven lita waen, wan lita wetem wan, wan lita wetem wan. Hemia ol kakae we i blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya we yufala i mas mekem oltaem long fas dei blong manis.
<verse eid="NUM 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15"/>Mo bakegen, antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen ya we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala, long fas dei blong manis, bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala.”
<verse eid="NUM 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol kakae we i blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes we oli mas mekem long Lafet blong Kakae Bred we i No Gat Is long hem
</para>
  <para style="r">(Levitikas 23.5-14)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 12.1-13; Dut 16.1,2</char></note>Nao Hae God i talem se, “Mo evri yia, long fas manis blong yia, long namba fotin dei* blong hem, bambae yufala i mas mekem Lafet* blong Pasova* blong ona long mi.
<verse eid="NUM 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 12.14-20; 23.15; 34.18; Dut 16.3-8</char></note>Mo long namba fiftin dei blong manis ya, bambae yufala i mas statem Lafet ya blong Kakae Bred nomo we i No Gat Is long hem, mo lafet ya bambae i stap gogo kasem seven dei.
<verse eid="NUM 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18"/>Long fas dei blong lafet ya, bambae yufala i mas kam wanples blong mekem wosip long mi, mo long dei ya, bambae i tabu blong yufala i mekem wok blong yufala long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19"/>Long dei ya, yufala i mas kilim tu yang bul, mo wan man sipsip, mo seven smol man sipsip we oli gat wan yia blong olgeta, mo olgeta anamol ya evriwan oli no mas gat wan samting i rong long bodi blong olgeta, nao yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes ya long olgeta, we i blong bonem i bon evriwan.
<verse eid="NUM 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20"/>Mo kakae we i stret blong yufala i bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya i olsem. Wetem tufala bul ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem sikis kilo flaoa we yufala i tantanem wetem olifoel,* tri kilo wetem wan, tri kilo wetem wan, mo wetem man sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem tu kilo flaoa olsem bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21"/>Mo wetem ol seven smol sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem seven kilo flaoa olsem bakegen, wan kilo wetem wan, wan kilo wetem wan.
<verse eid="NUM 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala, blong yufala i save joen gud long mi bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23"/>Ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri moning.
<verse eid="NUM 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24"/>Nao long seven dei, evri dei, bambae yufala i mas bonem ol kakae ya blong givim i kam long mi, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem. Evri dei, ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen ya we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25"/>Nao long namba seven dei blong lafet ya, bambae yufala i mas kam wanples bakegen blong mekem wosip long mi, mo long dei ya tu, bambae i tabu blong yufala i mekem wok blong yufala long hem.”
<verse eid="NUM 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol kakae we i blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya we oli mas mekem long Lafet blong Tekemaot Kakae long Garen
</para>
  <para style="r">(Levitikas 23.23-25)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Eks 23.16; 34.22; Dut 16.9-12</char></note>Nao Hae God i talem se, “Mo long fas dei blong Lafet* blong Tekemaot Kakae long Garen<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">28.26: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olbaot long Niutesteman, ol man oli stap talem dei ya se dei blong Pentekos.</char></note>, we yufala i kam givim ol niufala kakae long mi, bambae yufala i mas kam wanples blong mekem wosip long mi, mo long dei ya, bambae i tabu blong yufala i mekem wok blong yufala long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27"/>Long dei ya, bambae yufala i mas kilim tu yang bul, mo wan man sipsip, mo seven smol man sipsip we oli gat wan yia blong olgeta, mo olgeta anamol ya evriwan oli no mas gat wan samting i rong long bodi blong olgeta. Nao yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes ya long olgeta, we i blong bonem i bon evriwan, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28"/>Mo kakae we i stret blong yufala i bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya i olsem. Wetem tufala bul ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem sikis kilo flaoa we yufala i tantanem wetem olifoel,* tri kilo wetem wan, tri kilo wetem wan, mo wetem man sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem tu kilo flaoa olsem bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29"/>Mo wetem ol seven smol sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem seven kilo flaoa olsem bakegen, wan kilo wetem wan, wan kilo wetem wan.
<verse eid="NUM 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30"/>Mo long taem ya, bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala, blong yufala i save joen gud long mi bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31"/>Bambae yufala i mas bonem ol sakrefaes ya wetem ol kakae mo waen blong olgeta, antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala, mo yufala i mas lukluk gud se i no gat wan samting i rong long bodi blong ol anamol ya.”
<verse eid="NUM 28:31"/><verse eid="NUM 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29"/>
  <para style="s">Ol kakae we i blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya we oli mas mekem long Lafet blong Niu Yia
</para>
  <para style="r">(Levitikas 23.23-25)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1"/>Nao Hae God i talem se, “Mo evri yia, long namba seven manis blong yia, long fas dei* blong hem, bambae yufala i mas kam wanples blong mekem wosip long mi, mo bambae i tabu blong yufala i mekem wok blong yufala long dei ya. Hemia i dei blong mekem Lafet* blong Niu Yia, mo i dei blong bloem ol trampet blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2"/>Long dei ya, bambae yufala i mas kilim wan yang bul, mo wan man sipsip, mo seven smol man sipsip we oli gat wan yia blong olgeta, mo olgeta anamol ya evriwan oli no mas gat wan samting i rong long bodi blong olgeta. Nao yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes ya long olgeta, we i blong bonem i bon evriwan, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3"/>Mo kakae we i stret blong yufala i bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya i olsem. Wetem bul ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem tri kilo flaoa we yufala i tantanem wetem olifoel,* mo wetem man sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem tu kilo flaoa olsem bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4"/>Mo wetem ol seven smol sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem seven kilo flaoa olsem bakegen. Wan kilo wetem wan, wan kilo wetem wan.
<verse eid="NUM 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes blong tekemaot sin blong yufala, blong yufala i save joen gud long mi bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6"/>Ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long ol narafala sakrefaes we bambae yufala i stap mekem oltaem long fas dei blong manis wetem ol kakae we yufala i stap bonem wetem olgeta, mo antap bakegen long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala. Gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.”
<verse eid="NUM 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol kakae we i blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya we oli mas mekem long Dei blong Stretem Sin
</para>
  <para style="r">(Levitikas 23.26-32)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Lev 16.29-34</char></note>Nao Hae God i talem se, “Mo evri yia, long namba seven manis blong yia, long namba ten dei* blong hem, bambae yufala i mas livim kakae, yufala i mas kam wanples blong mekem wosip long mi, mo long dei ya, bambae i tabu blong yufala i mekem wok blong yufala long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8"/>Long dei ya, bambae yufala i mas kilim wan yang bul, mo wan man sipsip, mo seven smol man sipsip we oli gat wan yia blong olgeta, mo olgeta anamol ya evriwan oli no mas gat wan samting i rong long bodi blong olgeta. Nao yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes ya long olgeta, we i blong bonem i bon evriwan, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9"/>Mo kakae we i stret blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya i olsem. Wetem bul ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem tri kilo flaoa we yufala i tantanem wetem olifoel,* mo wetem man sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem tu kilo flaoa olsem bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10"/>Mo wetem ol seven smol sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem seven kilo flaoa olsem bakegen, wan kilo wetem wan, wan kilo wetem wan.
<verse eid="NUM 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala, we hemia i antap long narafala man nani ya we bambae yufala i mekem sakrefaes long hem long dei ya blong tekemaot ol sin blong olgeta man, mo i antap bakegen long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala.”
<verse eid="NUM 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol kakae we i blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya we oli mas mekem long Lafet blong Wokem ol Wansaed Haos
</para>
  <para style="r">(Levitikas 23.33-44)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Lev 23.34; Dut 16.13-15</char></note>Nao Hae God i talem se, “Mo evri yia, long namba seven manis, long namba fiftin dei* blong hem, bambae yufala i mas kam wanples blong mekem wosip long mi, mo blong mekem lafet. Lafet ya bambae i stat long namba fiftin, mo bambae i stap go kasem namba twanti tu, mo long taem ya, bambae i tabu blong yufala i mekem wok blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13"/>Long fas dei ya, bambae yufala i mas kilim totin yang bul, mo tu man sipsip, mo fotin smol man sipsip we oli gat wan yia blong olgeta, mo olgeta anamol ya evriwan oli no mas gat wan samting i rong long bodi blong olgeta. Mo yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes ya long olgeta, we i blong bonem i bon evriwan, mo gudfala smel blong hem bambae i mekem mi mi glad tumas long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14"/>Mo kakae we i stret blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya i olsem. Wetem ol bul ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem toti naen kilo flaoa we yufala i tantanem wetem olifoel,* tri kilo wetem wan, tri kilo wetem wan, mo wetem tufala man sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem fo kilo flaoa olsem, tu kilo wetem wan, tu kilo wetem wan.
<verse eid="NUM 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15"/>Mo wetem ol fotin smol sipsip ya, bambae yufala i mas bonem fotin kilo flaoa olsem bakegen, wan kilo wetem wan, wan kilo wetem wan.
<verse eid="NUM 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala. Ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17"/>“Mo long seken dei blong lafet ya, bambae yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes long twelef yang bul, mo tu man sipsip, mo fotin smol man sipsip, we olgeta ya bambae oli sem mak nomo long ol anamol ya long fas dei.
<verse eid="NUM 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18"/>Mo kakae blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya bambae i olsem ol kakae we yufala i bonem wetem ol anamol ya wanwan long fas dei, mo waen we bambae yufala i kafsaedem i go wetem olgeta bambae i folem namba blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala. Mo ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20"/>“Mo long namba tri dei blong hem, bambae yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes long leven yang bul, mo tu man sipsip, mo fotin smol man sipsip, we olgeta ya bambae oli sem mak nomo long ol anamol ya long fas dei.
<verse eid="NUM 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21"/>Mo kakae blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya bambae i olsem ol kakae we yufala i bonem wetem ol anamol ya wanwan long fas dei, mo waen we bambae yufala i kafsaedem i go wetem olgeta bambae i folem namba blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala. Mo ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23"/>“Mo long namba fo dei blong hem, bambae yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes long ten yang bul, mo tu man sipsip, mo fotin smol man sipsip, we olgeta ya bambae oli sem mak nomo long ol anamol ya long fas dei.
<verse eid="NUM 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24"/>Mo kakae blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya bambae i olsem ol kakae we yufala i bonem wetem ol anamol ya wanwan long fas dei, mo waen we bambae yufala i kafsaedem i go wetem olgeta bambae i folem namba blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala. Mo ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26"/>“Mo long namba faef dei blong hem, bambae yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes long naen yang bul, mo tu man sipsip, mo fotin smol man sipsip, we olgeta ya bambae oli sem mak nomo long ol anamol ya long fas dei.
<verse eid="NUM 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27"/>Mo kakae blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya bambae i olsem ol kakae we yufala i bonem wetem ol anamol ya wanwan long fas dei, mo waen we bambae yufala i kafsaedem i go wetem olgeta bambae i folem namba blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala. Mo ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29"/>“Mo long namba sikis dei blong hem, bambae yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes long eit yang bul, mo tu man sipsip, mo fotin smol man sipsip, we olgeta ya bambae oli sem mak nomo long ol anamol ya long fas dei.
<verse eid="NUM 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30"/>Mo kakae blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya bambae i olsem ol kakae we yufala i bonem wetem ol anamol ya wanwan long fas dei, mo waen we bambae yufala i kafsaedem i go wetem olgeta bambae i folem namba blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala. Mo ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 29:31"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32"/>“Mo long namba seven dei blong hem, bambae yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes long seven yang bul, mo tu man sipsip, mo fotin smol man sipsip, we olgeta ya bambae oli sem mak nomo long ol anamol ya long fas dei.
<verse eid="NUM 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33"/>Mo kakae blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya bambae i olsem ol kakae we yufala i bonem wetem ol anamol ya wanwan long fas dei, mo waen we bambae yufala i kafsaedem i go wetem olgeta bambae i folem namba blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala. Mo ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35"/>“Mo long namba eit dei blong lafet ya, bambae yufala i mas kam wanples bakegen blong mekem wosip long mi, mo long dei ya, bambae i tabu blong yufala i mekem wok blong yufala long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 29:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36"/>Long dei ya, bambae yufala i mas mekem sakrefaes long wan yang bul, mo wan man sipsip, mo seven smol man sipsip, we olgeta ya bambae oli sem mak nomo long ol anamol ya long fas dei.
<verse eid="NUM 29:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37"/>Mo kakae blong bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya bambae i olsem ol kakae we yufala i bonem wetem ol anamol ya wanwan long fas dei, mo waen we bambae yufala i kafsaedem i go wetem olgeta bambae i folem namba blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 29:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38"/>Mo bambae yufala i mas kilim wan man nani blong mekem spesel sakrefaes ya blong tekemaot sin blong yufala. Mo ol sakrefaes ya bambae i antap long tufala sakrefaes ya we yufala i stap mekem evri dei, wetem ol kakae mo waen we yufala i stap bonem wetem tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 29:38"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39"/>“Hemia ol kakae we yufala i mas bonem wetem ol sakrefaes ya we yufala i mas mekem long ol lafet blong yufala. Ol rul ya oli kavremap ol sakrefaes ya we yufala i kilim anamol, no yufala i tekem kakae blong garen* blong yufala, yufala i bonem blong givim i kam long mi, no yufala i tekem waen, yufala i kafsaedem i go long Olta blong givim i kam long mi, no yufala i kilim anamol blong mekem sakrefaes ya we pris i bonem haf, yufala i kakae haf blong soemaot we yufala i stap fren gud wetem mi. Ol kakae ya i antap long ol samting we bambae yufala i mas givim i kam long mi blong fulumap promes we yufala i mekem long mi, mo i antap tu long ol presen we bambae yufala i givim i kam long mi long gladhat blong yufala nomo.”
<verse eid="NUM 29:39"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40"/>Nao Moses i go talemaot olgeta tok ya we Hae God i talem, blong ol man oli harem.
<verse eid="NUM 29:40"/><verse eid="NUM 29:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30"/>
  <para style="s">Ol rul blong ol promes we ol woman long laen blong Isrel oli save mekem long Hae God
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1"/>Nao bakegen, Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses, blong i go talemaot long ol lida blong ol laen* blong Isrel.*
<verse eid="NUM 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">30.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Dut 23.21-23; Mat 5.33</char></note>Nao Moses i go talemaot long olgeta se, “Hae God i talem se sipos wan long yumi i mekem promes long hem, se bambae i givim wan samting i go long hem, no i livimaot wan samting long laef blong hem, man ya i no mas brekem promes ya blong hem bakegen, bambae hem i mas mekem evri samting we hem i promes blong mekem.
<verse eid="NUM 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3"/>“Mo sipos wan gel we i stap yet long haos blong papa blong hem i mekem wan promes olsem long Hae God,
<verse eid="NUM 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4"/>mo papa blong hem i harem promes ya, be i no tok, gel ya bambae i mas mekem evri samting we hem i promes blong mekem.
<verse eid="NUM 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5"/>Be sipos papa blong hem i harem, nao i blokem hem blong i no mekem ol samting ya we i promes blong mekem, gel ya bambae i no moa save holem promes ya. Mo Hae God bambae i fogivim hem, i tekemaot ol sin blong hem, from we papa blong hem i no letem blong hem i holem promes ya.
<verse eid="NUM 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6-7"/>“Mo sipos wan gel olsem i mekem wan promes olsem long Hae God, nao i mared, nao man blong hem i harem nius blong promes ya, be i no tok, nating we gel ya i minim promes ya no i no minim, be hem bambae i mas mekem evri samting we hem i promes blong mekem.
<verse eid="NUM 30:6-7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8"/>Be sipos man blong hem i harem nius blong promes ya, nao i blokem woman ya blong i no mekem, woman ya bambae i no moa save holem promes ya. Mo Hae God bambae i fogivim hem, i tekemaot ol sin blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9"/>“Be sipos wan wido no wan woman we man blong hem i mekem divos long hem finis i mekem wan promes olsem long God, hem bambae i mas mekem evri samting we hem i promes blong mekem.
<verse eid="NUM 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10"/>“Mo sipos wan woman we i mared i mekem wan promes olsem long God,
<verse eid="NUM 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11"/>mo man blong hem i harem nius blong promes ya be i no tok, woman ya bambae i mas mekem evri samting we hem i promes blong mekem.
<verse eid="NUM 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12"/>Be sipos man blong hem i harem nius blong promes ya, nao i blokem woman ya blong i no holem promes ya blong hem, woman ya bambae i no moa save holem promes ya. Mo Hae God bambae i fogivim hem, i tekemaot ol sin blong hem, from we man blong hem i blokem hem blong i no mekem promes blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13"/>I nomata wanem promes woman olsem i mekem, be man blong hem i gat raet blong mekem promes blong hem i stanap, no blong brekem promes ya.
<verse eid="NUM 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14"/>Be sipos man ya i harem nius blong promes we woman blong hem i mekem, nao hem i no tok go kasem nekis dei, woman ya bambae i mas mekem evri samting we hem i promes blong mekem. Sipos man i no blokem promes blong woman blong hem long dei we hem i harem, be hemia i mekem promes blong woman ya i stanap strong.
<verse eid="NUM 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15"/>Be sipos woman i mekem promes long Hae God, nao biaen, man blong hem i girap, i blokem woman blong hem blong i no moa holem promes ya, bambae man ya i mas kasem panis, from we woman blong hem i no mekem ol samting we hem i promes long Hae God, se bambae i mekem.”
<verse eid="NUM 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16"/>Hemia ol rul we Hae God i givim long Moses long ol bisnes blong promes we woman i save mekem long Hae God. Ol rul ya i kavremap gel we i no mared, i stap yet long haos blong papa blong hem, mo woman we i mared finis.
<verse eid="NUM 30:16"/><verse eid="NUM 30:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31"/>
  <para style="s">Hae God i talem long Moses se ol laen blong Isrel oli mas go mekem faet long ol man Midian
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2"/>“Yufala i mas go kilim ol man Midian ya oli ded, blong panisim olgeta from ol samting ya we oli mekem long yufala. Mo taem yufala i panisim olgeta finis, bambae yu yu ded, yu go stap wetem ol olfala bubu blong yu bifo, we oli ded finis.”
<verse eid="NUM 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3"/>Nao Moses i talem long olgeta se, “Yufala i mas mekemrere blong go mekem faet long ol man Midian ya, blong Hae God i panisim olgeta from ol samting ya we oli mekem.
<verse eid="NUM 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4"/>Bambae ol twelef laen* ya blong yumi oli mas jusumaot twelef taosen man we wan taosen i kamaot long wan laen, wan taosen i kamaot long wan laen, blong oli go faet.”
<verse eid="NUM 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5"/>Nao ol lida blong ol twelef laen ya oli jusumaot twelef taosen man olsem blong oli go faet.
<verse eid="NUM 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6"/>Nao Moses i putumap pris ya Finehas we papa blong hem Hae Pris Eleasara, blong hem i komanda blong olgeta, mo i sanem olgeta oli go blong mekem faet. Mo ol tabu samting we oli karem i go wetem olgeta, mo ol trampet blong singaot ol man, oli stap long han blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7"/>Nao olgeta oli girap, oli go mekem faet long ol man Midian ya, olsem we Hae God i talem, mo oli kilim olgeta man Midian evriwan oli ded, ol woman wetem ol pikinini nomo oli stap.
<verse eid="NUM 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8"/>Mo long taem ya oli kilim ol faef king blong ol man Midian tu oli ded, we nem blong olgeta, King Evi, mo King Rekem, mo King Juru, mo King Huru, mo King Reba. Mo man ya Balam, oli kilim hem tu i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9"/>Nao oli holem olgeta woman blong ol man Midian ya, wetem olgeta pikinini blong olgeta, mo ol buluk, mo ol sipsip blong olgeta, mo olgeta gudgudfala samting we oli stap long ol haos blong olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10"/>mo oli bonem olgeta taon blong olgeta, wetem ol ples we oli putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11"/>Nao oli tekem ol woman ya wetem ol pikinini mo ol anamol mo ol samting ya we oli tekemaot long ol haos ya,
<verse eid="NUM 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12"/>mo oli aot, oli gobak long Moses mo hae pris mo ol brata blong olgeta, we oli stap long ol haos tapolen blong olgeta long bigfala levelples ya long Moab, klosap long Jodan Reva, we taon ya Jeriko i stap narasaed reva ya i go.
<verse eid="NUM 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Olgeta we oli go long faet oli kambak
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13"/>Nao Moses mo Hae Pris Eleasara mo ol narafala lida blong olgeta oli aot long ples ya we oli stap long hem, oli go blong mitim olgeta ya we oli stap kambak long faet.
<verse eid="NUM 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14"/>Be taem Moses i luk olgeta, hem i kros tumas long ol lida blong olgeta, wetem ol komanda mo ol kapten blong olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15"/>mo hem i tok long olgeta, i talem se, “!Ei! ?From wanem yufala i no kilim ol woman ya?
<verse eid="NUM 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 25.1-9</char></note>!Olgeta ya nao oli folem tok blong man ya Balam, mo oli pulum ol man blong yumi oli gowe long Hae God long ples ya Peoro! !Samting ya nao i pulum rabis sik ya i kam long yumi bifo!
<verse eid="NUM 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17"/>!From samting ya, yufala i mas tekem olgeta boe ya, wetem olgeta woman we oli slip wetem man finis, yufala i mas kilim olgeta i ded!
<verse eid="NUM 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18"/>Ol gel ya nomo we oli no save man yet oli save stap, oli blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19"/>Be yufala evriwan we i bin kilim man, no we i bin tajem dedbodi, bambae yufala i mas stap afsaed long ples ya blong yumi go kasem seven dei. Long namba tri dei blong hem, mo bakegen long namba seven dei blong hem, yufala wetem ol gel ya we yufala i tekem olgeta i kam, bambae yufala i mas mekem yufala i klin long fes blong Hae God.
<verse eid="NUM 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20"/>Mo olgeta klos blong yufala, wetem olgeta samting we oli wokem long skin blong anamol, no long hea blong nani, no long wud, olgeta samting ya tu bambae yufala i mas mekem olgeta oli klin long fes blong hem.”
<verse eid="NUM 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21"/>Nao hae pris ya i talem long olgeta se, “Hae God i givim rul finis long Moses blong mekem ol samting oli klin long fes blong hem, mo ol rul ya i olsem.
<verse eid="NUM 31:21"/><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22-23"/>Olgeta samting we faea i no save spolem, olsem gol, mo silva, mo bras, mo aean, mo tin, mo led, fastaem yufala i mas bonem olgeta long faea mo biaen, yufala i mas wasem olgeta long spesel wota ya blong mekem olgeta i klin long fes blong hem. Be ol narafala samting ya, yufala i mas wasem olgeta long spesel wota ya nomo.
<verse eid="NUM 31:22-23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24"/>Mo long namba seven dei ya blong hem, bambae yufala i mas wasem ol klos blong yufala, nao bambae yufala i klin long fes blong hem, yufala i save kam insaed bakegen long ples blong yumi.”
<verse eid="NUM 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moses i seraot ol samting we oli tekemaot long ol man Midian
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26"/>“Yu wetem Hae Pris Eleasara, mo ol narafala lida blong yufala, yufala i mas tekem olgeta samting we olgeta ya oli tekemaot long ol man Midian long faet, wetem ol gel, mo ol anamol, nao yufala i mas kaontem olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27"/>Mo yufala i mas seraot ol samting ya long stret haf. Haf bambae i blong olgeta we oli go long faet, mo narafala haf bambae i blong olgeta we oli no go.
<verse eid="NUM 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28"/>Nao long haf ya we i blong olgeta we oli go long faet, long evri faef handred gel, bambae yufala i mas tekemaot wan gel, mo long ol buluk, mo ol dongki, mo ol sipsip, mo ol nani we i blong olgeta, yufala i mas mekem sem fasin. Olgeta samting ya i takis blong givim i kam long mi,
<verse eid="NUM 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29"/>nao bambae yufala i mas givim olgeta i go long hae pris, olsem spesel presen we yufala i givim i kam long mi.
<verse eid="NUM 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30"/>Mo long haf ya we i blong olgeta we oli no go, long evri fifti gel, bambae yufala i mas tekemaot wan gel, mo long ol buluk, mo ol dongki, mo ol sipsip, mo ol nani we i blong olgeta, bambae yufala i mas mekem sem fasin. Ol samting ya, yufala i mas givim i go long ol Livaet* from we olgeta oli stap lukaot long Haos Tapolen blong mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 31:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31"/>Nao Moses wetem hae pris, tufala i mekem ol samting ya olsem we Hae God i talem.
<verse eid="NUM 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="32-35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32-35"/>Lis blong ol samting ya we olgeta oli tekemaot long ol man Midian long taem blong faet i olsem. Ol sipsip wetem ol nani, i gat sikis handred seventi faef taosen. Mo ol buluk, i gat seventi tu taosen. Mo ol dongki, i gat sikisti wan taosen. Mo ol gel ya, i gat toti tu taosen. Be ol narafala samting we ol soldia oli holem i blong olgeta, oli no kaontem.
<verse eid="NUM 31:32-35"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36"/>Nao haf ya we i blong ol soldia we oli go long faet i olsem. Ol sipsip wetem ol nani, i gat tri handred toti seven taosen faef handred,
<verse eid="NUM 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37"/>mo takis we oli tekemaot long olgeta blong givim i go long Hae God, i gat sikis handred seventi faef.
<verse eid="NUM 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38"/>Mo ol buluk, i gat toti sikis taosen, mo takis we oli tekemaot long olgeta, seventi tu.
<verse eid="NUM 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39"/>Mo ol dongki, i gat toti taosen faef handred, mo takis we oli tekemaot long olgeta, sikisti wan.
<verse eid="NUM 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40"/>Mo ol gel ya, i gat sikistin taosen, mo takis we oli tekemaot long olgeta, toti tu.
<verse eid="NUM 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41"/>Ol takis ya i olsem wan spesel presen we olgeta i givim i go long Hae God, nao Moses i givim long hae pris ya, olsem we Hae God i talem.
<verse eid="NUM 31:41"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42"/>Mo haf we i blong ol narafala man i sem mak olsem haf ya blong olgeta we oli go long faet.
<verse eid="NUM 31:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43"/>Ol sipsip wetem ol nani, i gat tri handred toti seven taosen faef handred.
<verse eid="NUM 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44"/>Mo ol buluk, i gat toti sikis taosen.
<verse eid="NUM 31:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45"/>Mo ol dongki, i gat toti taosen faef handred.
<verse eid="NUM 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46"/>Mo ol gel ya, i gat sikistin taosen.
<verse eid="NUM 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47"/>Mo long haf ya, long evri fifti samting, Moses i tekemaot wan, mo ol samting ya i olsem wan spesel presen we ol man oli givim i go long Hae God. Nao hem i givim ol samting ya i go long ol Livaet, olsem we Hae God i talem, from we olgeta oli stap lukaot long Haos Tapolen blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48"/>Nao ol lida blong olgeta we oli go long faet, wetem ol komanda mo ol kapten blong olgeta oli kam luk Moses,
<verse eid="NUM 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49"/>mo oli talem long hem se, “Olfala, mifala i kaontem ol man blong mifala, be i no gat wan long olgeta i lus,
<verse eid="NUM 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50"/>mo mifala i wantem givim presen i go long Hae God from. Taem mifala i stap longwe, mifala i tekemaot ol flas samting blong ol man Midian we oli wokem long gol, mifala i karem i kam. Long ol samting ya i gat ol ring blong han, mo ol ring blong fingga, mo ol bidbid, mo ol jen mo ol iaring blong olgeta. Ol samting ya, mifala i wantem givim i go long Hae God, blong talem tangkiu long hem from we mifala i no ded long faet ya, mifala evriwan i laef.”
<verse eid="NUM 31:50"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51"/>Nao Moses wetem hae pris, tufala i tekem olgeta samting ya we ol man ya oli givim,
<verse eid="NUM 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52"/>mo taem ol pris oli skelem olgeta, wet blong hem klosap i kasem tu handred kilo, mo praes blong hem i samwe long wan handred twanti faef milian vatu.*
<verse eid="NUM 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53"/>Olgeta man we oli go long faet oli bin holem plante samting we oli tekemaot longwe, i blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54"/>Nao Moses wetem hae pris, tufala i tekem ol gol ya, tufala i go putum long Haos Tapolen blong Hae God, blong mekem se oltaem, bambae hem i stap tingbaot ol laen* blong Isrel,* mo bambae i stap lukaot gud long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 31:54"/><verse eid="NUM 31:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32"/>
  <para style="s">Ol laen ya blong Isrel we oli stap long saed blong Jodan Reva long is
</para>
  <para style="r">(Dutronome 3.12-22)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1"/>Nao long taem ya, ol laen* blong Ruben,* mo ol laen blong Gad* oli gat plante anamol blong olgeta, mo oli luk we ol ples ya long Gilead, raonabaot long taon ya Jasere oli gudfala ples blong fidim anamol.
<verse eid="NUM 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2"/>Nao oli go luk Moses wetem Hae Pris Eleasara mo ol narafala lida blong olgeta, oli talem long olgeta se,
<verse eid="NUM 32:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3-4"/>“Ol taon ya Atarot, mo Dibon, mo Jasere, mo Nimraha, mo Hesbon, mo Eleale, mo Sibma, mo Neboho, mo Beon, Hae God i givhan long yumi blong yumi holem olgeta, mo ol ples raonabaot long olgeta oli gudfala ples blong fidim anamol, mo mifala i gat plante anamol blong mifala.
<verse eid="NUM 32:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5"/>Plis yufala i no mekem mifala i gokros long Jodan Reva, yufala i letem mifala i stap long ples ya. I moa gud yufala i givim ol graon ya nomo long mifala, blong mifala i stap long hem, i blong mifala.”
<verse eid="NUM 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6"/>Nao Moses i talem se, “?Weswe? ?Yufala i wantem stap long ples ya, blong mifala nomo i go mekem faet longwe?
<verse eid="NUM 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7"/>Fasin ya bambae i mekem tingting blong ol brata ya blong yufala i foldaon, nao bambae mifala i no save gokros long Jodan Reva ya blong go long graon ya we Hae God i makemaot finis se i blong yumi. !Yufala i no save mekem olsem!
<verse eid="NUM 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 13.17-33</char></note>!Hemia sem fasin ya nomo we ol papa blong yufala oli mekem bifo! Taem yumi stap long Kadesbanea, mi mi sanem ol man oli kam insaed long kantri ya Kenan,* blong oli lukluksave ples ya.
<verse eid="NUM 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9"/>Mo olgeta oli wokbaot gogo oli kasem levelples ya Eskol long medel blong ol hil, mo oli lukluk gud ol ples ya. Be taem oli kambak, oli mekem tingting blong olgeta man i foldaon, nao nating we Hae God i makemaot kantri ya finis se i blong yumi, be yumi no kam insaed long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 14.26-35</char></note>Nao long taem ya, Hae God i kros tumas, i tok long mifala,
<verse eid="NUM 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11"/>i talem se, ‘!Mi mi talem stret long yufala! !Tingting blong yufala i no stap strong long mi nating! Mi mi promes* finis long Ebraham mo Aesak mo Jekob,* se bambae mi givim kantri ya long olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long trifala, be yufala i no trastem mi. Nao from samting ya, yufala we i kamaot long Ijip, we yia blong yufala i kasem twanti i go antap, bambae i no gat wan long yufala i save go insaed long kantri ya.’
<verse eid="NUM 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12"/>Tok ya i kavremap mifala evriwan long taem ya, Keleb we papa blong hem Jefune, we i laen blong Kenas, mo Josua we papa blong hem Nun, tufala ya nomo i stap we tingting blong tufala i stap strong long Hae God. Nao tufala ya nomo bambae i go insaed long kantri ya.
<verse eid="NUM 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13"/>Long taem ya, Hae God i kros long mifala evriwan, nao i mekem we yumi stap wokbaot olbaot long draeples ya foti yia, gogo kasem we ol papa ya blong yufala we oli mekem sin long fes blong hem long taem ya oli ded evriwan.
<verse eid="NUM 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14"/>!Be naoia, yufala i girap, yufala i wantem mekem sem fasin we olgeta ya oli mekem! !Yufala i stret pikinini blong olgeta! !Yufala tu i man nogud! ?Yufala i wantem mekem Hae God i kros long yumi bakegen?
<verse eid="NUM 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15"/>Sipos yufala i girap, yufala i tanem baksaed long hem naoia, bambae hem i lego yumi bakegen. Bambae yumi evriwan i go lus longwe long draeples, be trabol ya bambae i fol blong yufala nomo.”
<verse eid="NUM 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16-17"/>Be oli kam klosap moa long Moses, oli talem long hem se, “No, yumi ya, yumi wan kampani nomo, mo bambae mifala i kam wetem yufala. Be fastaem, plis yu letem blong mifala i wokem ol stonwol blong blokem ol anamol blong mifala, mo blong mifala i wokem ol bigfala stonwol i goraon long ol taon ya tu blong blokem ol pikinini blong mifala blong oli stap gud. Nao biaen, bambae mifala i kam wetem yufala, mo bambae mifala i lidim faet ya, gogo kasem we mifala i putum yufala evriwan long kantri ya we bambae i blong yufala. Ol pikinini ya blong mifala bambae oli save stap long ples ya fastaem. Sipos i gat ol stonwol i goraon long ol taon ya, bambae oli save stap gud long olgeta, ol man ples ya bambae oli no save kilim olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 32:16-17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18"/>Bambae mifala i no save kambak long ples ya bakegen, gogo kasem we ol narafala brata ya evriwan oli holem ol graon ya we bambae yufala i makemaot se i blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19"/>Mo bambae mifala i no save holem graon tu long narasaed Jodan Reva ya i go, from we mifala i kasem blong mifala finis long ples ya.”
<verse eid="NUM 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20"/>Nao Moses i talem se, “Sipos yufala i talem tru se bambae yufala i kam wetem mifala, hemia i min se bambae yufala i mas rere blong faet stret olsem we Hae God i talem.
<verse eid="NUM 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21"/>Olgeta man blong faet blong yufala oli mas gokros long narasaed Jodan Reva wetem mifala blong mekem faet long ol enemi ya blong Hae God olsem we hem bambae i talem, gogo kasem we hem i winim olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22"/>i holem kantri ya blong olgeta i blong yumi. Biaen, bambae yufala i save kambak long ples ya bakegen, from we long taem ya, bambae yufala i no moa gat wan samting blong mekem long fes blong Hae God no long fes blong ol brata ya blong yufala. Mo long taem ya, Hae God bambae i talem se ol graon long saed ya i blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23"/>Be sipos yufala i no holem promes ya blong yufala, mi mi talem long yufala naoia se yufala i mas lukaot. Sipos yufala i no holem promes ya, bambae yufala i stap mekem sin agens long Hae God ya. Mo yufala i mas save we hem bambae i panisim yufala from sin ya blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24"/>Yufala i save go wokem ol stonwol blong ol taon ya blong yufala mo blong ol yad blong ol anamol ya blong yufala, be bambae yufala i mas mekem olgeta samting ya we yufala i promes blong mekem.”
<verse eid="NUM 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25"/>Nao olgeta oli talem long hem se, “Olfala, bambae mifala i mekem olsem we yu yu talem.
<verse eid="NUM 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26"/>Ol woman blong mifala mo ol pikinini blong mifala mo ol anamol blong mifala, bambae olgeta oli stap nomo long ples ya long ol taon ya long Gilead.
<verse eid="NUM 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27"/>Be mifala evriwan i rere blong go mekem faet olsem we Hae God bambae i talem. Bambae mifala i gokros long Jodan Reva ya blong go mekem faet olsem we yu yu talem.”
<verse eid="NUM 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">32.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jos 1.12-15</char></note>Nao Moses i talem long hae pris mo Josua, mo ol narafala lida blong olgeta se,
<verse eid="NUM 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29"/>“Sipos ol brata ya blong yufala oli gokros long Jodan Reva wetem yufala blong go mekem faet olsem we Hae God bambae i talem, nao yufala i winim ol man Kenan ya, bambae yufala i save givim ol graon ya long Gilead i go long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30"/>Be sipos oli no go wetem yufala, bambae oli mas kasem graon blong olgeta long Kenan olsem yufala nomo.”
<verse eid="NUM 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31"/>Nao ol laen blong Gad wetem ol laen blong Ruben oli talem se, “Olfala, bambae mifala i mekem olsem we Hae God i talem.
<verse eid="NUM 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32"/>Bambae mifala i gokros long reva ya, mifala i go insaed long kantri ya Kenan blong mekem faet olsem we hem bambae i talem, blong bambae mifala i save holem graon ya we yumi stap long hem naoia, i blong mifala.”
<verse eid="NUM 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33"/>Nao from samting ya, Moses i makemaot olgeta ples ya we King Sihon blong Amoro* mo King Og blong Basan, tufala i king long hem, wetem ol taon blong tufala, mo ol vilej we oli stap raonabaot long olgeta, se bambae oli blong ol laen blong Gad, wetem ol laen blong Ruben, mo haf blong ol laen blong Manase.*
<verse eid="NUM 32:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34"/>Nao ol laen blong Gad oli wokemgud bakegen ol bigfala stonwol we oli goraon long ol taon ya Dibon, mo Atarot, mo Aroere,
<verse eid="NUM 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35"/>mo Atrotsofan, mo Jasere, mo Jogbeha,
<verse eid="NUM 32:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36"/>mo Betnimra, mo Betaran. Mo oli wokem ol fenis blong ol anamol blong olgeta tu.
<verse eid="NUM 32:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37"/>Mo ol laen blong Ruben oli wokemgud bakegen ol bigfala stonwol we oli goraon long ol taon ya Hesbon, mo Eleale, mo Kiriataem,
<verse eid="NUM 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38"/>mo Neboho, mo Balmeon we biaen oli jenisim nem blong hem, mo Sibma. Mo taem oli wokemgud ol taon ya bakegen, oli putum ol niufala nem blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39"/>Mo ol laen blong Makiri, we papa blong hem Manase oli go insaed long ples ya Gilead, oli ronemaot ol man Amoro we oli stap long hem, nao oli stap long ples ya.
<verse eid="NUM 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40"/>Nao Moses i givim ples ya long olgeta, i blong olgeta, mo oli stap olwe long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41"/>Man ya Jaere, we i laen blong Manase, hem i go mekem faet long samfala vilej, mo i winim olgeta, nao i putum nem blong olgeta ya se “Ol vilej blong Jaere”.
<verse eid="NUM 32:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42"/>Mo man ya Noba i go mekem faet long taon ya Kenat mo ol vilej we oli stap raonabaot long hem, mo i winim olgeta, nao i putum nem blong hem long taon ya se Noba.
<verse eid="NUM 32:42"/><verse eid="NUM 32:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33"/>
  <para style="s">Rod we ol laen blong Isrel oli folem, i stat long Ijip, i kam kasem Moab
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1-2"/>Nao taem ol laen* blong Isrel* oli aot long Ijip, oli wokbaot i kam kasem Moab, olgeta oli stap aninit long han blong Moses wetem Hae Pris Eron, mo taem olgeta oli wokbaot, oli stap wokbaot folem ol laen blong olgeta. Mo Hae God i talem long Moses se taem oli putumap ol haos tapolen blong olgeta, hem i mas raetemdaon nem blong ples we oli stap long hem, mo oltaem hem i stap mekem olsem. Nao rod we olgeta oli folem i olsem.
<verse eid="NUM 33:1-2"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3"/>Long fas manis blong yia ya we oli aot long Ijip, long namba fiftin dei* blong hem, we hemia i dei biaen long fas Lafet* blong Pasova,* olgeta oli stat blong wokbaot. Hae God i stap lukaot gud long olgeta, i stap blokemgud olgeta, nao oli aot long taon ya Rameses stret long fes blong ol man Ijip.
<verse eid="NUM 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4"/>Long taem ya, ol man Ijip oli stap berem ol fasbon pikinini boe blong olgeta, we Hae God i kilim olgeta oli ded. Hem i mekem samting ya blong soemaot we hem i gat moa paoa, i winim ol god blong ol man Ijip.<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">33.4: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Narafala rod blong tanem tok long las haf blong vas ya i olsem. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hem i mekem samting ya blong soemaot we <char style="bd" closed="true">ol god blong ol man Ijip oli no gat paoa nating</char>.</char></note>
<verse eid="NUM 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5"/>Nao taem oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Sukot.
<verse eid="NUM 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Etam, we i stap klosap long draeples, saed i kam.
<verse eid="NUM 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli tanemraon, oli gobak long Pihahirot, nao oli mekem ples blong olgeta klosap long Migdol, long saed blong Baljefon long is.
<verse eid="NUM 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8"/>Biaen, oli aot long Pihahirot, oli gokros long Red Si, oli go insaed long draeples ya Suru. Oli wokbaot tri dei, nao oli kam kasem Mara, mo oli mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya.
<verse eid="NUM 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Elim, we i gat twelef springwota mo seventi pamtri* i stap long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta daon long Red Si.
<verse eid="NUM 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long draeples ya Sin.
<verse eid="NUM 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Dofkaha.
<verse eid="NUM 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Alus.
<verse eid="NUM 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Refidim, we i no gat wota long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long draeples ya Sinae.
<verse eid="NUM 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Kibrot Hatahava, we i min se, “Beregraon blong ol man we oli wantem mit tumas”.
<verse eid="NUM 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Hajerot.
<verse eid="NUM 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Ritma.
<verse eid="NUM 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Rimonperes.
<verse eid="NUM 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Libnaha.
<verse eid="NUM 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Risa.
<verse eid="NUM 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Kehelata.
<verse eid="NUM 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta klosap long hil ya Sefa.
<verse eid="NUM 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Harada.
<verse eid="NUM 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Makelot.
<verse eid="NUM 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Tahat.
<verse eid="NUM 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Teraha.
<verse eid="NUM 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Mitkaha.
<verse eid="NUM 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Hasmona.
<verse eid="NUM 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Moserot.
<verse eid="NUM 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Benejahakan.
<verse eid="NUM 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Hohagidgad.
<verse eid="NUM 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Jotbata.
<verse eid="NUM 33:33"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Abrona.
<verse eid="NUM 33:34"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Ejionkeba.
<verse eid="NUM 33:35"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long draeples ya Jin, long ples ya Kades.
<verse eid="NUM 33:36"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta klosap long hil ya Horo, long mak blong graon blong ol man Edom.
<verse eid="NUM 33:37"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 20.22-28; Dut 10.6; 32.50</char></note>Nao long namba foti yia biaen long taem ya we olgeta oli aot long Ijip, long namba faef manis blong yia ya, long fas dei blong hem, Hae God i talem long Hae Pris Eron blong i go antap long hil ya. Mo taem hem i go antap, hem i ded long ples ya.
<verse eid="NUM 33:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39"/>Long taem ya, hem i gat wan handred twanti tri yia blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 33:39"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 21.1</char></note>Nao long taem ya, king blong ples ya Arad long kantri ya Kenan,* long saed blong hem long saot, hem i harem nius blong olgeta, we oli stap kam.
<verse eid="NUM 33:40"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41"/>Biaen, oli aot long hil ya Horo, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Jalmona.
<verse eid="NUM 33:41"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Punon.
<verse eid="NUM 33:42"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Obot.
<verse eid="NUM 33:43"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long mak blong graon blong ol man Moab, klosap long olfala taon ya Abarim, we i kam nogud finis.
<verse eid="NUM 33:44"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Dibonkad.
<verse eid="NUM 33:45"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long ples ya Almondiblataem.
<verse eid="NUM 33:46"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta klosap long hil ya Abarim, long saed blong hil ya Neboho.
<verse eid="NUM 33:47"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48"/>Biaen, oli aot long ples ya, oli kam mekem ples blong olgeta long bigfala levelples ya long Moab, long saed blong Jodan Reva long is, we taon ya Jeriko i stap narasaed reva ya i go.
<verse eid="NUM 33:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49"/>Nao oli stap long saed blong Jodan Reva long is, long medel blong tufala ples ya Betsesimot, long saot, mo bigfala levelples ya Kasis, long not.
<verse eid="NUM 33:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tok we Hae God i givim long Moses blong i go talemaot long olgeta
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50"/>Nao taem olgeta oli stap long bigfala levelples ya long Moab long saed blong Jodan Reva long is, we taon ya Jeriko i stap narasaed reva ya i go, Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses
<verse eid="NUM 33:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51"/>blong i go talemaot long ol laen* blong Isrel.* Hem i talem se, “Taem yufala i gokros long Jodan Reva blong go long kantri ya Kenan,*
<verse eid="NUM 33:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52"/>bambae yufala i mas ronemaot olgeta man we oli stap long kantri ya. Bambae yufala i mas spolem ol aedol blong ol god blong olgeta we oli wokem long ston mo long aean, mo yufala i mas brekemdaon olgeta ples blong mekem wosip tu blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 33:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53"/>Bambae yufala i mas holem kantri ya, nao yufala i mas stap long hem, from we mi mi makemaot finis se i blong yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 33:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 26.54-56</char></note>Bambae yufala i mas seraot ol graon long kantri ya i go long ol laen ya blong yufala, folem ol namba blong olgeta. Bigfala graon i mas go long laen we i gat plante man long hem, mo smol graon i mas go long laen we i no gat plante man long hem. Mo blong seraot ol graon ya, yufala i mas sakem ol spesel ston blong faenemaot se wanem graon bambae i go long wanem laen.
<verse eid="NUM 33:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55"/>Be sipos yufala i no ronemaot olgeta man ya evriwan we oli stap long ples ya, olgeta we oli stap bambae oli mekem tumas trabol long yufala. Bambae oli olsem smol pis wud we i sap tumas, i stap stikim ae blong yufala, no nil blong aranis we i stap stikim bodi blong yufala, we oltaem yufala i stap harem nogud tumas from. Oltaem bambae olgeta oli stap faet agens long yufala.
<verse eid="NUM 33:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56"/>Mo sipos yufala i no ronemaot olgeta, bambae mi mi spolem yufala, olsem we mi mekem plan fastaem se bambae mi spolem olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 33:56"/><verse eid="NUM 33:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34"/>
  <para style="s">Ol mak blong kantri ya we Hae God i makemaot se i blong olgeta
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1"/>Nao Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses
<verse eid="NUM 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2"/>blong i go talemaot long ol laen* blong Isrel.* Hem i talem se, “Taem yufala i go insaed long kantri ya Kenan,* mak blong kantri ya bambae i olsem.
<verse eid="NUM 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3"/>Long saed i go long saot, mak blong hem bambae i stat long Ded Si,* long saed blong hem long saotis, long draeples ya Jin, nao i ron i folem mak blong graon blong ol man Edom, long saed blong hem long wes.
<verse eid="NUM 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4"/>Bambae mak ya i ron i go long saot go kasem ples ya we rod i gotru long ol hil long ples ya Akrabim, nao i ron i gotru long draeples ya gogo kasem ples ya Kadesbanea. Nao long ples ya, bambae i tanem i go long not lelebet, i go long ples ya Hajarada, nao i ron i go long ples ya Asmon.
<verse eid="NUM 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5"/>Nao long ples ya, bambae i tanem i go long bigfala krik ya we i mak blong graon blong ol man Ijip, nao i folem krik ya go kasem Mediterenian Si.
<verse eid="NUM 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6"/>“Mo long saed i go long wes, mak ya bambae i stat long krik ya long saot, i folem Mediterenian Si, i ron i go kasem saed blong hil ya Horo long not.
<verse eid="NUM 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7"/>“Mo long saed i go long not, mak ya bambae i stat long solwota, i pas long hil ya Horo,
<verse eid="NUM 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8"/>nao i ron i go long is, i go long ples ya we rod i pastru long ol hil, long Hamat, nao i go long ples ya Jedad,
<verse eid="NUM 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9"/>nao i go long ples ya Sifron, mo i go finis long Hajarenan.
<verse eid="NUM 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10"/>“Mo long saed i go long is, mak ya bambae i stat long Hajarenan, i ron i go long saot, i go long ples ya Sefam,
<verse eid="NUM 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11"/>nao bambae i go moa, i go long ples ya Habel, long narasaed ples ya Aen long is, nao bambae i go long ples blong hil long saed blong Lugun ya Galili* long is.
<verse eid="NUM 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12"/>Nao bambae i folem saed blong Jodan Reva long is, i ron i go long saot, i go kasem Ded Si bakegen, nao i folem Ded Si ya long saed i go long is, go kasem stat blong hem bakegen.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Hemia nao mak blong kantri ya blong yufala.”
<verse eid="NUM 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 26.52-56</char></note><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jos 14.1-5</char></note>Nao Moses i go talemaot ol tok ya, mo i talem se, “Hae God i makemaot graon ya finis se i blong ol naen laen ya blong yufala, wetem haf ya blong ol laen blong Manase.* Bambae yufala i mas sakem ol spesel ston* blong faenemaot se wanem laen bambae i kasem wanem graon.
<verse eid="NUM 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14"/>Ol laen blong Ruben* wetem ol laen blong Gad,* mo narafala haf ya blong ol laen blong Manase oli kasem graon blong olgeta finis,
<verse eid="NUM 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15"/>long ples ya we yumi stap long hem, we taon ya Jeriko i stap narasaed reva ya i go, mo oli seraot ol graon ya finis, folem ol famle blong olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol lida we wok blong olgeta i blong seraot ol graon
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16"/>Nao Hae God i talem long Moses se,
<verse eid="NUM 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17"/>“Hae Pris Eleasara wetem Josua we papa blong hem Nun, tufala bambae i seraot ol graon ya i go long ol man.
<verse eid="NUM 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18"/>Mo bambae i mas gat ol lida blong ol laen* ya blong yufala wanwan, blong oli givhan long tufala.
<verse eid="NUM 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19"/>Nem blong ol lida ya bambae i olsem.
</para>
  <para style="p">“Lida blong ol laen blong Juda,* Keleb we papa blong hem Jefune.
<verse eid="NUM 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20"/>“Mo lida blong ol laen blong Simeon,* Selumiel we papa blong hem Amihud.
<verse eid="NUM 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21"/>“Mo lida blong ol laen blong Benjamin,* Elidad we papa blong hem Kislon.
<verse eid="NUM 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22"/>“Mo lida blong ol laen blong Dan,* Buki we papa blong hem Jogli.
<verse eid="NUM 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23"/>“Mo lida blong ol laen blong Manase,* Haniel we papa blong hem Efod.
<verse eid="NUM 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24"/>“Mo lida blong ol laen blong Efrem,* Kemuel we papa blong hem Siftan.
<verse eid="NUM 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25"/>“Mo lida blong ol laen blong Sebulun,* Elijafan we papa blong hem Panak.
<verse eid="NUM 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26"/>“Mo lida blong ol laen blong Isakara,* Paltiel we papa blong hem Asan.
<verse eid="NUM 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27"/>“Mo lida blong ol laen blong Asere,* Ahihud we papa blong hem Selomi.
<verse eid="NUM 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28"/>“Mo lida blong ol laen blong Naftali,* Pedahel we papa blong hem Amihud.”
<verse eid="NUM 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29"/>Hemia nao ol man we Hae God i jusumaot olgeta blong oli seraot ol graon ya long Kenan* i go long olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 34:29"/><verse eid="NUM 34:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35"/>
  <para style="s">Ol taon we oli givim i go long ol Livaet
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1-2"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.1-2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jos 21.1-42</char></note>Nao long taem ya we ol laen* blong Isrel* oli stap yet long bigfala levelples ya long Moab klosap long Jodan Reva, Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses blong i go talemaot long olgeta. Hem i talem se, “Long ol graon we bambae yufala i kasem i blong yufala, bambae yufala i mas makemaot sam taon blong yufala wetem ol graon we i stap raonabaot long olgeta, blong givim i go long ol Livaet.*
<verse eid="NUM 35:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3"/>Ol taon ya bambae i blong olgeta, blong oli save stap long medel blong yufala, mo ol graon raonabaot long ol taon ya bambae i blong ol buluk blong olgeta, wetem ol narafala anamol blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4"/>Saes blong graon ya, bambae i mas tekem samwe long fo handred fifti meta, we bambae i stat long stonwol blong taon i goaot kasem mak blong hem, mo bambae i mas olsem long ol fo saed blong taon.
<verse eid="NUM 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5"/>Hemia i min se ol taon ya bambae oli stap long medel blong pis graon we i skwea, we saes blong hem i samwe long wan handred hekta. Mo graon ya i blong ol anamol blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 35:5"/><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6-7"/>Bambae yufala i mas givim foti eit taon i go long olgeta, wetem ol graon we i stap raonabaot long olgeta, we i blong ol anamol blong olgeta. Mo long ol taon ya, bambae yufala i mas makemaot sikis taon we oli gat stonwol i goraon long olgeta, se oli taon blong haed we man i save stap gud long hem. Nao sipos wan man i kilim wan narafala man i ded be i no tingting blong mekem olsem, i akseden nomo, man ya bambae i save ronwe i go haed long wan long ol taon ya, blong i stap gud long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 35:6-7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8"/>Mo namba blong ol taon we ol laen blong yufala bambae oli givim long olgeta bambae i folem graon blong yufala. Laen we i gat plante taon blong hem, bambae i mas givim plante taon long olgeta, mo laen we i no gat plante taon bambae i no mas givim plante olsem.”
<verse eid="NUM 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ol taon blong haed we man i save go haed long hem
</para>
  <para style="r">(Dutronome 19.1-13; Josua 20.1-9)
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Dut 19.2-4; Jos 20.1-9</char></note>Nao Hae God i givim tok blong hem long Moses
<verse eid="NUM 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10"/>blong i talemaot long ol laen* blong Isrel.* Hem i talem se, “Taem yufala i gokros long Jodan Reva, nao yufala i holem kantri ya Kenan* finis,
<verse eid="NUM 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11"/>bambae yufala i mas makemaot sam taon blong yufala we oli gat ol stonwol oli goraon long olgeta, we bambae oli kam ol taon blong haed blong yufala. Nao sipos wan man i kilim wan narafala man i ded we i no tingting blong mekem olsem, i akseden nomo, man ya bambae i save ronwe i go haed long wan long ol taon ya, blong i stap gud long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12"/>Nao long taon ya, bambae hem i save stap gud, from we famle blong man ya we i ded bambae i no save mekem wan samting long hem blong givimbak fasin ya long hem we hem i mekem, gogo kasem we hem i pas long kot fastaem.
<verse eid="NUM 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13"/>Bambae yufala i mas makemaot sikis taon olsem,
<verse eid="NUM 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14"/>we tri bambae i stap long saed blong Jodan Reva ya saed i kam long is, mo tri bambae i stap narasaed i go, long kantri ya Kenan.
<verse eid="NUM 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15"/>Ol taon ya bambae oli taon blong haed blong yufala, mo blong ol strenja we oli kam stap wetem yufala, nating we oli stap longtaem no sot taem wetem yufala. Nating we man i blong weples, be sipos hem i kilim narafala man i ded long fasin olsem, bambae hem i save go haed long wan long ol taon ya, blong i stap gud long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="16-19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16-19"/>“Sipos wan man i holem wan samting blong faet we oli wokem long aean, no long ston, no long wud, nao i kilim narafala man i ded, man ya i brekem loa ya we i talem se bambae yufala i no kilim man i ded, nao yufala i mas kilim hem i ded. Wok blong kilim hem i ded blong givimbak samting ya bambae i stap long han blong wan stret angkel blong man ya we i ded, mo sipos hem i faenem man ya, bambae hem i mas kilim hem i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 35:16-19"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20"/>“No sipos wan man we i badfren long narafala man i kilim narafala man ya i ded, long fasin ya we i pusum hem i foldaon, no i stonem hem long wan samting,
<verse eid="NUM 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21"/>no i faetem hem, hem tu i brekem loa ya, mo yufala i mas kilim hem i ded. Wok blong kilim hem i ded bambae i stap long han blong wan stret angkel blong man ya we i ded, mo sipos hem i faenem man ya, bambae hem i mas kilim hem i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="22-24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22-24"/>“Be sipos wan man i kilim wan narafala man we tufala i no badfren nating, mo hem i no tingting blong mekem olsem, i akseden nomo, olgeta man ples blong man ya we i ded bambae oli mas luklukgud long bisnes ya, se man ya i tingting blong mekem olsem, no i akseden nomo. Maet hem i pusum narafala man ya i foldaon, no i stonem hem long wan samting, no i wantem stonem wan narafala samting, be i mestem, nao i kasem man ya, i kilim hem i ded, be olgeta oli mas tekemaot hem long taon ya we i stap haed long hem, oli mas tekem hem i go long kot, mo sipos oli luk we hem i no tingting blong kilim man ya,
<verse eid="NUM 35:22-24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25"/>bambae oli mas blokem angkel blong man ya we i ded blong i no mekem wan samting long hem, mo oli mas tekem hem i gobak long taon ya we i ronwe i go stap long hem fastaem. Nao man ya i mas stap long taon ya gogo kasem we man we i hae pris long taem ya i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26"/>Be sipos wan man we i bin kilim man long fasin ya i girap, i go afsaed long taon ya we i stap haed long hem,
<verse eid="NUM 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27"/>nao wan angkel blong man ya we i ded i faenem hem, i kilim hem i ded, be fasin ya bambae i no brekem Loa. Samting ya i blong givimbak trabol ya nomo.
<verse eid="NUM 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28"/>Man we i bin kilim man i ded i mas stap long taon ya we i ronwe i go haed long hem, gogo kasem we man we i hae pris long taem ya i ded, nao biaen, bambae hem i save gobak long hom blong hem bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29"/>Ol rul ya bambae i holem yufala evriwan, wetem ol pikinini blong yufala mo olgeta we bambae oli kamaot biaen long yufala, i nomata weples bambae yufala i stap long hem.
<verse eid="NUM 35:29"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Dut 17.6; 19.15</char></note>“Sipos ol man oli stap talem se wan man i kilim wan narafala man i ded, bambae i mas gat tu man no i moa long tu man we oli witnes blong samting ya se i tru, blong yufala i jajem man ya se i mas ded. Sipos wan man nomo i luk, nao hem nomo i witnes agens long man ya, tok blong hem, hem wan, bambae i no naf blong yufala i jajem man ya se i mas ded.
<verse eid="NUM 35:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31"/>Sipos wan man i kilim narafala man i ded, bambae yufala i mas kilim hem i ded. Bambae hem i no save pemaot laef blong hem long mane, blong i save go fri.
<verse eid="NUM 35:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32"/>Mo sipos wan man i kilim narafala man i ded we i no tingting blong mekem olsem, nao i ronwe i go haed long wan long ol taon ya, bambae yufala i no letem hem i pemaot laef blong hem, blong i save go fri, i gohom. Bambae hem i mas stap long taon ya, gogo kasem we man we i hae pris long taem ya i ded.
<verse eid="NUM 35:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33"/>Sipos yufala i letem man olsem i pemaot laef blong hem blong i go fri, bambae yufala i mekem ples ya we yufala i stap long hem i kam doti long fes blong mi. Samting ya, we man i kilim narafala man i ded, hem i mekem ples i doti long fes blong mi. Mo i no gat narafala rod blong mekem i klin bakegen, wan rod nomo i stap. Yufala i mas kilim man ya we i kilim man i ded. Hemia nomo i save mekem ples i klin bakegen.
<verse eid="NUM 35:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34"/>Mi mi Hae God, mo yufala ol laen blong Isrel, yufala i man blong mi. Mi mi stap long medel blong yufala, mo yufala i mas lukaot gud blong ples blong yufala bambae i no kam doti long fes blong mi.”
<verse eid="NUM 35:34"/><verse eid="NUM 35:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36"/>
  <para style="s">Ol graon bambae i mas stap olwe long laen we i holem fastaem
</para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1"/>Nao long ol laen* blong Manase,* we papa blong hem Josef, i gat ol laen blong pikinini ya blong hem Makiri, mo long olgeta ya, i gat ol laen blong Gilead we i pikinini blong Makiri ya. Nao ol hed blong ol famle blong olgeta ya oli kam luk Moses wetem ol narafala lida blong olgeta,
<verse eid="NUM 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Nam 27.7</char></note>mo oli talem se, “Hae God i talem long yufala, se bambae yufala i mas seraot ol graon ya i kam long ol laen blong mifala, mo bambae yufala i mas sakem ol spesel ston* blong faenemaot se wanem graon bambae i kam long wanem laen. Mo hem i talem long yufala tu, se graon ya we i blong Jelofehad, brata blong mifala, bambae yufala i mas givim i go long ol dota blong hem.
<verse eid="NUM 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3"/>Be i gud yufala i tingbaot. Sipos olgeta ya oli mared long ol man blong narafala laen, bambae graon ya blong olgeta i go long narafala laen ya, nao graon we yufala i givim long laen blong mifala bambae i kam smol.
<verse eid="NUM 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4"/>Mo long namba fifti yia we i Yia blong Givimbak ol Samting, we bambae mifala i mas givimbak olgeta graon we mifala i bin pem i gobak long ol fas ona blong hem bakegen, be long taem ya, ol graon blong ol dota ya blong Jelofehad bambae i stap olgeta long ol laen ya we ol gel ya oli mared i go long olgeta, nao long fasin ya, graon ya blong mifala bambae i lus olgeta.”
<verse eid="NUM 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5"/>Nao Moses i talemaot tok blong Hae God, blong olgeta man ya oli harem. Hem i talem se, “Samting ya we ol laen blong Manase oli talem i tru ya.
<verse eid="NUM 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6"/>Hae God i talem se ol dota ya blong Jelofehad oli save mared long hu man we oli wantem, be bambae oli mas mared* insaed long laen ya nomo blong olgeta<note style="f" caller="+"> <char style="fr" closed="false">36.6: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Long kastom blong ol laen blong Isrel bifo, sipos boe mo gel, tufala i wantem mared, be tufala i klosap nomo long sem famle, olgeta oli luk se mared i no stret. Yu luk Levitikas japta 18 mo 20.17-21, mo Dutronome 27.20-23. Be sipos gel i gat graon, hem i no save mared long man long narafala laen, hem i mas mared long laen blong hem nomo blong graon blong hem i stap nomo long famle blong olgeta.</char></note>
<verse eid="NUM 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7"/>Nating we yufala i blong wanem laen, be olgeta graon we bambae yufala i kasem, bambae i mas stap long laen blong yufala nomo.
<verse eid="NUM 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8"/>Sipos gel i gat raet blong holem graon we i blong wan olfala bubu blong hem, bambae hem i mas mared insaed long laen ya blong hem nomo. Long fasin ya, graon blong hem bambae i stap nomo long laen blong ol bubu blong hem,
<verse eid="NUM 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9"/>mo bambae i no save aot long han blong laen blong hem, blong pas i go long han blong narafala laen. Bambae olgeta graon blong yufala i mas stap olwe long han blong yufala nomo.”
<verse eid="NUM 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10-11"/>Nao ol dota ya blong Jelofehad, we nem blong olgeta, Mala, mo Tijaha, mo Hoglaha, mo Milka, mo Noa oli mekem olsem we Hae God i talem long Moses, oli mared long ol pikinini blong ol brata blong papa blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 36:10-11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12"/>Oli mared insaed long wan long ol laen blong Manase, we papa blong hem Josef ya bifo. Nao long fasin ya, ol graon blong olgeta i stap olwe nomo long han blong laen blong papa ya blong olgeta.
<verse eid="NUM 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p"><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13"/>Hemia nao ol loa mo ol rul we Hae God i givim long Moses blong i givim long olgeta, long taem ya we oli stap long bigfala levelples ya long Moab, long saed blong Jodan Reva long is, we taon ya Jeriko i stap narasaed reva ya i go.
<verse eid="NUM 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36"/>
</usx>
